<li><a class="nav-link" href="#GeometryNodeCgalConvexLayers2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalConvexLayers2">Convex Layers 2D</a></li><li><a class="nav-link" href="#GeometryNodeCgalConvexLayers3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalConvexLayers3">Convex Layers 3D</a></li><li><a class="nav-link" href="#GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicVoronoi2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicVoronoi2">Periodic Voronoi 2D</a></li><li><a class="nav-link" href="#GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicVoronoi3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicVoronoi3">Periodic Voronoi 3D</a></li><li><a class="nav-link" href="#GeometryNodeCgalMinCylinder3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMinCylinder3">Min Cylinder 3D</a></li><li><a class="nav-link" href="#GeometryNodeCgalMinAnnulus3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMinAnnulus3">Min Annulus 3D</a></li><li><a class="nav-link" href="#GeometryNodeCgalSimplePolygon2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSimplePolygon2">Simple Polygon 2D</a></li></ul></details><details class="nav-fold"><summary>Curve <span class="count">1</span></summary><ul class="nav-list"><li><a class="nav-link" href="#GeometryNodeCgalSimplifyPolyline3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSimplifyPolyline3">Simplify Polyline 3D</a></li></ul></details></details>
