<main class="content"><div class="content-inner">

<article class="page is-active" id="page-intro" data-page="intro">
  <h1><span class="zh">BIKINI 用户手册</span><span class="en">BIKINI User Manual</span></h1>
  <p class="lead zh">严格对照 <code>E:\Achieve List.txt</code>。<strong>只收录清单内的 BIKINI 项</strong>。
  官方节点（如 <code>Evaluate Closure</code>、<code>Grid Gradient / Divergence / Laplacian</code>）
  <strong>不在清单里、不写节点页</strong>。清单里的 gradient/divergence 指
  <code>GeometryNodeMeshGradient</code> / <code>GeometryNodeMeshDivergence</code>，不是官方 Grid*。
  <code>CompositorNodeImageProcess</code> 是<strong>合成器</strong>节点（接通 GTE 组），不是 GTE 编辑器内节点。</p>
  <p class="lead en">Strictly from Achieve List. Official nodes excluded.
  <code>CompositorNodeImageProcess</code> is a Compositor node, not a GTE-editor node.</p>
  <div class="admonition tip">
    <div class="title">Coverage（清单白名单）</div>
    <p class="zh">侧栏按 <strong>v1 / v2</strong> 折叠。v1：几何 30 · GTE 17 · 合成器 1 · 着色器 4 · 界面 10。
    v2：CGAL 142 · Box/Jolt · Texture · 着色器 portal/字符串 · 物体编辑器 · 界面 6。
    IO 来自本编译版 blender.exe。清单 CGAL 写 153，本 EXE 为 142。</p>
    <p class="en">Sidebar is grouped into <strong>v1 / v2</strong>. v1 is the previous drop; v2 is this one.
    CGAL count in this EXE: 142 (Achieve List: 153).</p>
  </div>
  <p class="zh">每页仅 <strong>Inputs / Outputs</strong> + Menu 全部模式/默认 + 显示条件。无「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="en">Inputs/Outputs only; menus list all modes + defaults + visibility.</p>
</article>
<article class="page" id="page-achieve" data-page="achieve">
  <h1>Achieve List 对照统计</h1>
  <p class="zh">逐行对照清单。状态：<span class="st ok">ok</span> 本 EXE 可实例化并已写 IO 页；
  <span class="st miss">miss</span> 清单有但本 EXE 不能 <code>nodes.new</code>；
  <span class="st wf">wf</span> 工作流/UI；<span class="st off">off</span> 清单注释禁用。</p>
  <p class="en">ok = in this EXE + IO page; miss = on list but not instantiable; wf = workflow; off = commented out.</p>
  <h2><span class="zh">几何节点（Achieve List）</span><span class="en">Geometry Nodes (Achieve List)</span></h2><table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th>Achieve List 项</th><th>Status</th><th>映射 / 说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>String属性</td><td><span class="st wf">wf</span></td><td>工作流 / UI（非独立节点）</td></tr><tr><td>几何节点Portal</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeNamedPortal</code>, <code>GeometryNodeStoreNamedPortal</code></td></tr><tr><td>几何Clip</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeGeometryClip</code></td></tr><tr><td>设置默认闭包</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeSetClosureDefault</code></td></tr><tr><td>loop细分</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeLoopSubdivision</code></td></tr><tr><td>nearest neighbours</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeKNearest</code></td></tr><tr><td>//viewport camera</td><td><span class="st off">off</span></td><td>清单已注释禁用 //</td></tr><tr><td>模拟区Cache Limit</td><td><span class="st wf">wf</span></td><td>工作流 / UI（非独立节点）</td></tr><tr><td>debug节点</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeDebug</code></td></tr><tr><td>enable input/output优化</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>NodeEnableInput</code>, <code>NodeEnableOutput</code></td></tr><tr><td>timeshift</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeTimeShift</code></td></tr><tr><td>Sparse Matrix Math</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeSparseMatrixMath</code></td></tr><tr><td>Linear Solver</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeLinearSolver</code></td></tr><tr><td>Mesh Laplace</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeMeshLaplacian</code></td></tr><tr><td>Object info Seed</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeObjectInfo</code></td></tr><tr><td>Repeat Zone的break</td><td><span class="st wf">wf</span></td><td>工作流 / UI（非独立节点）</td></tr><tr><td>select element</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeSelectElements</code></td></tr><tr><td>edit element</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeEditElements</code></td></tr><tr><td>heat geodesic</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeHeatGeodesic</code></td></tr><tr><td>instant mesh</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeInstantMeshes</code></td></tr><tr><td>quadwild</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeQuadWild</code></td></tr><tr><td>tri remesh</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeTriangleRemesh</code></td></tr><tr><td>voronoi破碎</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeVoronoiFracture</code></td></tr><tr><td>Delaunay 3D</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeDelaunay3D</code></td></tr><tr><td>Write at Index</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeWriteAtIndex</code></td></tr><tr><td>rbf interpolate</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeRBFInterpolate</code></td></tr><tr><td>图染色</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeMeshGraphColoring</code></td></tr><tr><td>tangent field</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeTangentField</code></td></tr><tr><td>gradient（Mesh）</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeMeshGradient</code>（勿与官方 Grid* / Evaluate Closure 混淆）</td></tr><tr><td>divergence（Mesh）</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeMeshDivergence</code>（勿与官方 Grid* / Evaluate Closure 混淆）</td></tr><tr><td>curve intersection</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>GeometryNodeCurveIntersections</code></td></tr><tr><td>expression（几何）</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>NodeExpression</code></td></tr></tbody></table><h2><span class="zh">界面 UI 与便捷操作</span><span class="en">UI &amp; Shortcuts</span></h2><table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th>Achieve List 项</th><th>Status</th><th>映射 / 说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>视口叠加层属性预览优化</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><a class="nav-link" href="#ui-viewport-overlay-attr" data-page="ui-viewport-overlay-attr"><span class="zh">侧栏 → 界面 UI · 视口属性预览</span><span class="en">Sidebar → UI · Viewport Attribute Text Overlay</span></a></td></tr><tr><td>节点组 Separator 与 Message</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><a class="nav-link" href="#ui-group-separator-message" data-page="ui-group-separator-message"><span class="zh">侧栏 → 界面 UI · 组 Separator / Message</span><span class="en">Sidebar → UI · Group Interface Separator &amp; Message</span></a></td></tr><tr><td>抖动分离与多节点 Combo 插线</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><a class="nav-link" href="#ui-shake-combo-insert" data-page="ui-shake-combo-insert"><span class="zh">侧栏 → 界面 UI · 抖动分离 / Combo 插线</span><span class="en">Sidebar → UI · Shake Detach &amp; Combo Insert</span></a></td></tr><tr><td>按住 U + 拖动对齐节点</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><a class="nav-link" href="#ui-u-align" data-page="ui-u-align"><span class="zh">侧栏 → 界面 UI · U 键对齐节点</span><span class="en">Sidebar → UI · Hold U + Drag Align</span></a></td></tr><tr><td>电子表格属性列排序</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><a class="nav-link" href="#ui-spreadsheet-sort" data-page="ui-spreadsheet-sort"><span class="zh">侧栏 → 界面 UI · 电子表格列排序</span><span class="en">Sidebar → UI · Spreadsheet Column Sort</span></a></td></tr><tr><td>节点组参数：加入下一行（横排）</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><a class="nav-link" href="#ui-join-to-next" data-page="ui-join-to-next"><span class="zh">侧栏 → 界面 UI · 参数横排 Join</span><span class="en">Sidebar → UI · Join Parameter to Next (Horizontal)</span></a></td></tr><tr><td>Ctrl+LMB 节点组参数改名</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><a class="nav-link" href="#ui-ctrl-lmb-rename" data-page="ui-ctrl-lmb-rename"><span class="zh">侧栏 → 界面 UI · Ctrl+LMB 改名</span><span class="en">Sidebar → UI · Ctrl+LMB Rename Group Socket</span></a></td></tr><tr><td>节点组 Menu 多选与 List 输出</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><a class="nav-link" href="#ui-menu-multi" data-page="ui-menu-multi"><span class="zh">侧栏 → 界面 UI · Menu 多选 / List</span><span class="en">Sidebar → UI · Menu Multi-Selection &amp; List Output</span></a></td></tr><tr><td>Ctrl+LMB 改 Socket 数据类型</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><a class="nav-link" href="#ui-ctrl-socket-type" data-page="ui-ctrl-socket-type"><span class="zh">侧栏 → 界面 UI · Ctrl 改接口类型</span><span class="en">Sidebar → UI · Ctrl+LMB Change Socket Data Type</span></a></td></tr><tr><td>Alt+LMB 改 Socket Structure 形状</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><a class="nav-link" href="#ui-alt-socket-shape" data-page="ui-alt-socket-shape"><span class="zh">侧栏 → 界面 UI · Alt 改接口形状</span><span class="en">Sidebar → UI · Alt+LMB Change Socket Structure Shape</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><h2><span class="zh">着色器</span><span class="en">Shaders</span></h2><table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th>Achieve List 项</th><th>Status</th><th>映射 / 说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>image socket</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>NodeSocketImage</code> / <code>GeometryNodeImageTexture</code>（着色器树；inline → <code>ShaderNodeTexImage</code>）</td></tr><tr><td>sdf shape（着色器）</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>ShaderNodeSDFShape</code></td></tr><tr><td>fractal（着色器）</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>ShaderNodeFractalPrimitive</code></td></tr><tr><td>expression（着色器）</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>NodeExpression</code></td></tr><tr><td>HLSL</td><td><span class="st ok">ok</span></td><td><code>ShaderNodeHLSL</code></td></tr></tbody></table><h2><span class="zh">合成器</span><span class="en">Compositor</span></h2><table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th>Achieve List 项</th><th>Status</th><th>映射 / 说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>接通合成器</td><td><span 