<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeNamedPortal" data-page="GeometryNodeNamedPortal">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeNamedPortal</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Named Portal</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">按 Portal 名称读取<strong>同一节点树</strong>内唯一的 Store Named Portal 发布的几何。名称为空、不存在或不唯一时输出空 Geometry 并报错。不跨组、不跨物体。</p>
  <p class="en">Reads geometry published by the unique Store Named Portal with the same Portal name in the same node tree. Empty/missing/duplicate names yield empty Geometry + error.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Portal<span class="type">String (Portal ID)</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Portal 名称（字符串）。须与同树内某个 Store Named Portal 的 Portal 完全一致。RNA：<code>portal_name</code>。</span><span class="en">Portal name (string). Must match a Store Named Portal in the same tree. RNA: portal_name.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">读到的几何；名称无效时为空。</span><span class="en">Fetched geometry; empty if name invalid.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeStoreNamedPortal" data-page="GeometryNodeStoreNamedPortal">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeStoreNamedPortal</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Store Named Portal</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">把输入 Geometry 以 Portal 名称发布到当前节点树，供同名 Named Portal 读取。Geometry 输出为透传。Store 名称在树内必须唯一（重名会自动加 .001 后缀）。</p>
  <p class="en">Publishes Geometry under Portal name for Named Portal readers. Geometry output is pass-through. Store names must be unique in the tree.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Portal<span class="type">String (Portal ID)</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">发布用的 Portal 名称（字符串，默认 Portal）。树内唯一。RNA：<code>portal_name</code>。</span><span class="en">Publish name (string, default Portal). Unique in tree. RNA: portal_name.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>Portal</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要发布并透传的几何。</span><span class="en">Geometry to publish and pass through.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要发布并透传的几何。</span><span class="en">Geometry to publish and pass through.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeGeometryClip" data-page="GeometryNodeGeometryClip">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeGeometryClip</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Geometry Clip</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用平面裁切几何：按 Mode 保留上方/下方/两侧，并输出裁切后的几何与两侧选择。</p>
  <p class="en">Clips geometry with a plane; Mode keeps above/below/both; outputs geometry and side selections.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mode<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">保留哪一侧：Above / Below / Both。</span><span class="en">Which side to keep: Above / Below / Both.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Above</code>, <code>Below</code>, <code>Both</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Above</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">待裁切几何。</span><span class="en">Geometry to clip.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Plane Position<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平面上一点（世界/物体空间随图）。</span><span class="en">A point on the plane.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Plane Normal<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平面法线方向。</span><span class="en">Plane normal.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 1.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">待裁切几何。</span><span class="en">Geometry to clip.</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Above<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平面上方元素选择/结果侧。</span><span class="en">Above-plane selection/side.</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Below<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平面下方元素选择/结果侧。</span><span class="en">Below-plane selection/side.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Mode <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Both</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Above</code>, <code>Below</code>, <code>Both</code></p>
<table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th><span class="zh">模式</span><span class="en">Mode</span></th><th><span class="zh">此时显示的 Inputs</span><span class="en">Inputs shown</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th><code>Above</code></th><td><code>Mode</code>, <code>Geometry</code>, <code>Plane Position</code>, <code>Plane Normal</code></td></tr>
<tr><th><code>Below</code></th><td><code>Mode</code>, <code>Geometry</code>, <code>Plane Position</code>, <code>Plane Normal</code></td></tr>
<tr><th><code>Both</code></th><td><code>Mode</code>, <code>Geometry</code>, <code>Plane Position</code>, <code>Plane Normal</code></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeSetClosureDefault" data-page="GeometryNodeSetClosureDefault">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeSetClosureDefault</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
