<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeLoopSubdivision" data-page="GeometryNodeLoopSubdivision">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeLoopSubdivision</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Loop Subdivision</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">对 Mesh 做 Loop 细分，Level 控制迭代次数。</p>
