<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeKNearest" data-page="GeometryNodeKNearest">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeKNearest</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Nearest Neighbors</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">在 Target 点集上为 Source 的每个点查询近邻：K Nearest 固定 K 个，Radius 球内全部邻居。邻居按距离排序；Source=Target 时包含自身。</p>
  <p class="en">Nearest-neighbor query: K nearest or all within Radius. Sorted by distance; includes self when Source=Target.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Mode<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">K Nearest 或 Radius。</span><span class="en">K Nearest or Radius.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>K Nearest</code>, <code>Radius</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>K_NEAREST</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">always</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Source Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">查询点来源。</span><span class="en">Query points.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Target Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">被搜索点集。</span><span class="en">Search target points.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>K<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">近邻个数（仅 K Nearest）。</span><span class="en">Neighbor count (K mode).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = K Nearest</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Radius<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">搜索半径（仅 Radius）。</span><span class="en">Search radius (Radius mode).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Radius</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Indices<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">邻居目标点索引（按距离升序）。</span><span class="en">Neighbor target indices (distance order).</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Source Indices<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Radius 模式：每条邻居对应的源点索引。</span><span class="en">Radius mode: source index per neighbor.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Mode <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>K_NEAREST</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>K Nearest</code>, <code>Radius</code></p>
<table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th>Mode</th><th><span class="zh">显示的 Inputs</span><span class="en">Inputs shown</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th><code>K Nearest</code></th><td><code>Source Geometry</code>, <code>Target Geometry</code>, <code>K</code></td></tr>
<tr><th><code>Radius</code></th><td><code>Source Geometry</code>, <code>Target Geometry</code>, <code>Radius</code></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
