<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeDebug" data-page="GeometryNodeDebug">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeDebug</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Debug</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">在视口叠加层显示字段 Value（及可选文字），便于调试属性/场；Geometry 透传。</p>
  <p class="en">Viewport overlay of field Value (optional text) for debugging; Geometry is pass-through.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
