<article class="page" id="page-NodeEnableInput" data-page="NodeEnableInput">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>NodeEnableInput</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Enable Input</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">控制组接口是否显示与求值：Enable=true 时 Value 透传且外部接口可见；Enable=false 时<strong>隐藏</strong>被控组接口（非灰显）、忽略外部 wire，输出组接口静态默认值或 Default Input（Position / Normal / Index / Scene Frame 等）。Value 接 Group Input 时绑定该接口。</p>
  <p class="en">Gates a group-interface input: Enable=true passes Value and shows the interface; Enable=false <strong>hides</strong> the controlled group socket (not merely grey), ignores external wires, and outputs the interface static default or Default Input (Position / Normal / Index / Scene Frame, …). Wire Value from Group Input to bind that interface.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Data Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Value 的 socket 数据类型（节点头）。</span><span class="en">Value socket data type (node header).</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>FLOAT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">always</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Enable<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">为 true 时透传 Value 并显示组接口；false 时隐藏接口并改用默认路径。</span><span class="en">true: pass Value + show interface; false: hide interface and use defaults.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>False</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Value<span class="type">Dynamic</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">被控值；通常接 Group Input。Enable=false 时不 request（不读外部 wire）。</span><span class="en">Controlled value (usually Group Input). Not requested when Enable=false.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Value<span class="type">Dynamic</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Enable=true 时为透传；false 时为组接口默认 / Default Input。</span><span class="en">Pass-through when enabled; interface default / Default Input when disabled.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-NodeEnableOutput" data-page="NodeEnableOutput">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>NodeEnableOutput</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Enable Output</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">Enable=true 时 Value 透传；Enable=false 时输出类型回退默认（不 request Value）。用于按条件启用组输出路径；与 Enable Input（隐藏接口 + 接口默认值）语义不同。</p>
  <p class="en">Enable=true passes Value; Enable=false falls back to type default (Value not requested). Conditional group-output gating; differs from Enable Input (hide interface + interface defaults).</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Data Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Value 的 socket 数据类型（节点头）。</span><span class="en">Value socket data type (node header).</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>FLOAT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">always</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Enable<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">为 true 时透传 Value；false 时输出类型默认。</span><span class="en">true: pass Value; false: type fallback default.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>False</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Value<span class="type">Dynamic</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">被控值。Enable=false 时不 request。</span><span class="en">Controlled value. Not requested when Enable=false.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Value<span class="type">Dynamic</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Enable=true 时透传；false 时为类型默认回退。</span><span class="en">Pass-through when enabled; type default when disabled.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeTimeShift" data-page="GeometryNodeTimeShift">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeTimeShift</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Time Shift</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">把几何求值时间偏移到指定 Frame（常用于模拟区采样其它帧）。</p>
