<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeSparseMatrixMath" data-page="GeometryNodeSparseMatrixMath">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeSparseMatrixMath</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Sparse Matrix Math</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">稀疏矩阵二元运算（加/减/乘等 Operation），A/B 为稀疏矩阵 Bundle。</p>
  <p class="en">Sparse matrix binary ops (Add/Sub/Mul…) on matrix Bundles A/B.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Operation<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">矩阵运算类型。</span><span class="en">Matrix operation.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Add</code>, <code>Subtract</code>, <code>Multiply</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>ADD</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">always</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>A<span class="type">Bundle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">左操作数稀疏矩阵。</span><span class="en">Left sparse matrix.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>B<span class="type">Bundle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">右操作数稀疏矩阵。</span><span class="en">Right sparse matrix.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Result<span class="type">Bundle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">结果矩阵。</span><span class="en">Result matrix.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
