</article>

<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeLinearSolver" data-page="GeometryNodeLinearSolver">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeLinearSolver</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Linear Solver</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">稀疏线性代数：解 Ax=b、分解、带分解回代、矩阵-向量乘、特征对等。Mode / Data Type 控制可见接口。</p>
  <p class="en">Sparse linear algebra: solve Ax=b, factor, solve-with-factor, multiply, eigenpairs. Mode gates IO.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Mode<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">主模式：解方程 / 分解 / 带分解回代 / 矩阵向量乘。</span><span class="en">Main mode: solve / factor / solve-with-factor / multiply.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Linear System Solve</code>, <code>Decompose</code>, <code>Solve with Decomposition</code>, <code>Multiply</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>SOLVE → Linear System Solve</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Data Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">未知量类型。Decompose 模式下节点会隐藏此菜单。</span><span class="en">Unknown type. Hidden in Decompose mode.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Float</code>, <code>Vector</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>FLOAT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode ≠ Decompose（Decompose 时隐藏）</code></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Solver Class<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">仅 Mode=Linear System Solve 时显示。</span><span class="en">Only when Mode = Linear System Solve.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Direct</code>, <code>Iterative</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>DIRECT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Linear System Solve</code></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Direct Method<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">仅 Mode=Solve 且 Solver Class=Direct（或 Decompose→Matrix Factor）。</span><span class="en">Solve+Direct, or Decompose→Matrix Factor.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>LLT</code>, <code>LDLT</code>, <code>LU</code>, <code>QR</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>LLT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode=Solve 且 Solver Class=Direct；或 Mode=Decompose 且 Decompose Mode=Matrix Factor</code></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Iterative Method<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">仅 Mode=Solve 且 Solver Class=Iterative。</span><span class="en">Only Solve + Iterative.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>GMRES</code>, <code>DGMRES</code>, <code>MINRES</code>, <code>CG</code>, <code>LSCG</code>, <code>BiCGSTAB</code>, <code>IDRS</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>CG</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode=Solve 且 Solver Class=Iterative</code></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Preconditioner<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">仅 Iterative 求解时显示。</span><span class="en">Only with Iterative solver.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Identity</code>, <code>Diagonal</code>, <code>IncompleteLUT</code>, <code>IncompleteCholesky</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>DIAGONAL</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode=Solve 且 Solver Class=Iterative</code></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Decompose Mode<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">仅 Mode=Decompose：矩阵因式 或 特征分解。</span><span class="en">Only Mode=Decompose: matrix factor or eigen.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Matrix Factor</code>, <code>Eigen</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>MATRIX_FACTOR</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Decompose</code></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Eigen Solver<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">仅 Mode=Decompose 且 Decompose Mode=Eigen。带 Shift 的求解器才会显示 Shift 输入。</span><span class="en">Only Decompose→Eigen. *Shift* solvers show Shift input.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>GenEigsSolver</code>, <code>SymEigsSolver</code>, <code>GenEigsRealShiftSolver</code>, <code>SymEigsShiftSolver</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>SYM_EIGS</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Decompose 且 Decompose Mode = Eigen</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>A<span class="type">Bundle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">系数稀疏矩阵 Bundle。</span><span class="en">Coefficient sparse matrix.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>b<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">右端项 list。</span><span class="en">RHS vector list.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Linear System Solve 或 Solve with Decomposition</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>x<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">未知量/乘子向量；输出亦为解 x。</span><span class="en">Unknown / multiply vector; output is solution x.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Multiply（输入向量；输出 x 见 Outputs）</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Pin<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Dirichlet 钉扎布尔 list（值取自 b）。</span><span class="en">Dirichlet pin mask (values from b).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>False</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Linear System Solve / Solve with Decomposition；或 Mode=Decompose 且 Decompose Mode=Eigen</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Decomposition<span class="type">Bundle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">分解 Bundle 输入/输出。</span><span class="en">Factorization Bundle in/out.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Solve with Decomposition（输入已有分解）</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Num Eigenpairs<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">特征对个数 k。</span><span class="en">Number of eigenpairs k.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Decompose 且 Decompose Mode = Eigen</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Shift<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Shift-invert 位移 σ。</span><span class="en">Shift-invert σ.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Decompose 且 Decompose Mode = Eigen 且 Eigen Solver 为 *Shift*（GenEigsRealShift / SymEigsShift）</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Max Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">迭代法最大迭代。</span><span class="en">Iterative max iterations.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1000</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Linear System Solve 且 Solver Class = Iterative</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Tolerance<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">迭代收敛容差。</span><span class="en">Iterative tolerance.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.000000013351432e-10</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Linear System Solve 且 Solver Class = Iterative</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>x<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">未知量/乘子向量；输出亦为解 x。</span><span class="en">Unknown / multiply vector; output is solution x.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode ∈ {Linear System Solve, Solve with Decomposition, Multiply}</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Decomposition<span class="type">Bundle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">分解 Bundle 输入/输出。</span><span class="en">Factorization Bundle in/out.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Decompose 且 Decompose Mode = Matrix Factor</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Eigenvectors<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">嵌套 list：k 个长度 n 的向量。</span><span class="en">Nested list: k vectors of length n.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Decompose 且 Decompose Mode = Eigen</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Eigenvalues<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">长度 k 的特征值 list。</span><span class="en">Eigenvalue list length k.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Decompose 且 Decompose Mode = Eigen</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Mode <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">主模式：解方程 / 分解 / 带分解回代 / 矩阵向量乘。</span><span class="en">Main mode: solve / factor / solve-with-factor / multiply.</span><br><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>SOLVE → Linear System Solve</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Linear System Solve</code>, <code>Decompose</code>, <code>Solve with Decomposition</code>, <code>Multiply</code></p>
<h3>Data Type <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">未知量类型。Decompose 模式下节点会隐藏此菜单。</span><span class="en">Unknown type. Hidden in Decompose mode.</span><br><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>FLOAT</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Float</code>, <code>Vector</code></p>
<h3>Solver Class <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">仅 Mode=Linear System Solve 时显示。</span><span class="en">Only when Mode = Linear System Solve.</span><br><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>DIRECT</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Direct</code>, <code>Iterative</code></p>
<h3>Direct Method <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">仅 Mode=Solve 且 Solver Class=Direct（或 Decompose→Matrix Factor）。</span><span class="en">Solve+Direct, or Decompose→Matrix Factor.</span><br><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>LLT</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>LLT</code>, <code>LDLT</code>, <code>LU</code>, <code>QR</code></p>
<h3>Iterative Method <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">仅 Mode=Solve 且 Solver Class=Iterative。</span><span class="en">Only Solve + Iterative.</span><br><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>CG</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>GMRES</code>, <code>DGMRES</code>, <code>MINRES</code>, <code>CG</code>, <code>LSCG</code>, <code>BiCGSTAB</code>, <code>IDRS</code></p>
<h3>Preconditioner <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">仅 Iterative 求解时显示。</span><span class="en">Only with Iterative solver.</span><br><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>DIAGONAL</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Identity</code>, <code>Diagonal</code>, <code>IncompleteLUT</code>, <code>IncompleteCholesky</code></p>
<h3>Decompose Mode <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">仅 Mode=Decompose：矩阵因式 或 特征分解。</span><span class="en">Only Mode=Decompose: matrix factor or eigen.</span><br><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>MATRIX_FACTOR</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Matrix Factor</code>, <code>Eigen</code></p>
<h3>Eigen Solver <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">仅 Mode=Decompose 且 Decompose Mode=Eigen。带 Shift 的求解器才会显示 Shift 输入。</span><span class="en">Only Decompose→Eigen. *Shift* solvers show Shift input.</span><br><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>SYM_EIGS</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>GenEigsSolver</code>, <code>SymEigsSolver</code>, <code>GenEigsRealShiftSolver</code>, <code>SymEigsShiftSolver</code></p>
<h3><span class="zh">Mode 下 Inputs / Outputs 显隐</span><span class="en">Visibility by Mode</span></h3>
<table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th>Mode</th><th>Sub</th><th><span class="zh">显示的 Inputs</span><span class="en">Inputs</span></th><th><span class="zh">显示的 Outputs</span><span class="en">Outputs</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Linear System Solve</th><td>Direct</td><td><code>A</code>, <code>b</code>, <code>Pin</code></td><td><code>x</code></td></tr><tr><th>Linear System Solve</th><td>Iterative</td><td><code>A</code>, <code>b</code>, <code>Pin</code>, <code>Max Iterations</code>, <code>Tolerance</code></td><td><code>x</code></td></tr><tr><th>Decompose</th><td>Matrix Factor</td><td><code>A</code></td><td><code>Decomposition</code></td></tr><tr><th>Decompose</th><td>Eigen（无 Shift）</td><td><code>A</code>, <code>Pin</code>, <code>Num Eigenpairs</code></td><td><code>Eigenvectors</code>, <code>Eigenvalues</code></td></tr><tr><th>Decompose</th><td>Eigen + Shift 求解器</td><td><code>A</code>, <code>Pin</code>, <code>Num Eigenpairs</code>, <code>Shift</code></td><td><code>Eigenvectors</code>, <code>Eigenvalues</code></td></tr><tr><th>Solve with Decomposition</th><td>—</td><td><code>A</code>, <code>b</code>, <code>Pin</code>, <code>Decomposition</code></td><td><code>x</code></td></tr><tr><th>Multiply</th><td>—</td><td><code>A</code>, <code>x</code></td><td><code>x</code></td></tr></tbody></table>
<p class="note-inline"><span class="zh">说明：</span><span class="en">Note: </span><code>Num Eigenpairs</code> <span class="zh">仅在</span><span class="en">only when</span> <code>Mode=Decompose</code> + <code>Decompose Mode=Eigen</code>；<span class="zh">不是始终显示。</span><span class="en">not always visible.</span></p>
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
