<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeMeshLaplacian" data-page="GeometryNodeMeshLaplacian">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeMeshLaplacian</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Mesh Laplacian</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">从 Mesh 构建稀疏拉普拉斯/扩散矩阵（Uniform/Cotangent 等），供 Linear Solver 使用。</p>
  <p class="en">Builds sparse Laplacian/diffusion matrix from Mesh for Linear Solver.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Mode<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Uniform 或 Cotangent 离散。</span><span class="en">Uniform or Cotangent.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Uniform</code>, <code>Cotangent</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>UNIFORM</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">always</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入网格。</span><span class="en">Input mesh.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Diffusion Matrix<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">是否构建扩散形式。</span><span class="en">Build diffusion form.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>False</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Diffusion Coefficient<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">扩散系数。</span><span class="en">Diffusion coefficient.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Use Mass<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">是否用质量矩阵。</span><span class="en">Include mass matrix.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>False</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Matrix<span class="type">Bundle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">稀疏矩阵 Bundle。</span><span class="en">Sparse matrix Bundle.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
