<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeSelectElements" data-page="GeometryNodeSelectElements">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeSelectElements</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Select Elements</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">交互选择几何元素。仅选中本节点时按 <strong>Enter</strong> 进入原生 Edit Mode，用 B/C/1/2/3/A 等编辑模式快捷键点选/框选；<strong>Esc</strong> 确认写回索引，<strong>RMB</strong> 取消。输出透传 Geometry + Selection（Bool 场）。Domain（点/边/面/样条）由编辑会话中的选择模式决定并写入内部存储，<strong>不是</strong>节点上给用户调的 Input/菜单参数。</p>
  <p class="en">Interactive element pick. With only this node selected, Enter → native Edit Mode (B/C/1/2/3/A…); Esc commits indices, RMB cancels. Outputs pass-through Geometry + Selection. Domain is set by edit-mode selectmode when confirming — not a user-facing Input menu.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入：已实现的 Mesh 或 Curves（二选一，同时有会报错）。输出：透传同一几何。</span><span class="en">In: realized Mesh or Curves (not both). Out: pass-through geometry.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入：已实现的 Mesh 或 Curves（二选一，同时有会报错）。输出：透传同一几何。</span><span class="en">In: realized Mesh or Curves (not both). Out: pass-through geometry.</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Selection<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Bool 场：Esc 确认后选中的元素为 true（domain 由编辑模式选择方式写入内部，非用户菜单）。</span><span class="en">Bool field after Esc; domain comes from edit-mode selectmode (internal), not a user menu.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>

