<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeInstantMeshes" data-page="GeometryNodeInstantMeshes">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeInstantMeshes</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Instant Meshes</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">Instant Meshes 各向同性重网格：Quad/Triangle 模式，按边长/面数/顶点数等目标控制分辨率。</p>
  <p class="en">Instant Meshes isotropic remesh: Quad/Triangle; targets edge length / face / vertex count.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入网格。</span><span class="en">Input mesh.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Mode<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Quad 或 Triangle 重网格。</span><span class="en">Quad or Triangle remesh.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Quad</code>, <code>Triangle</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Quad</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Target<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">分辨率目标：Auto / Edge Length / Faces / Vertices。</span><span class="en">Resolution target mode.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Auto</code>, <code>Edge Length</code>, <code>Faces</code>, <code>Vertices</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Auto</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Edge Length<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">目标边长（Target=Edge Length）。</span><span class="en">Target edge length.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.10000000149011612</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Target = Edge Length</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Face Count<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">目标面数（Target=Faces）。</span><span class="en">Target face count.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1000</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Target = Faces</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Vertex Count<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">目标顶点数（Target=Vertices）。</span><span class="en">Target vertex count.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1000</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Target = Vertices</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Crease Angle<span class="type">FloatAngle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">折痕角度阈值。</span><span class="en">Crease angle threshold.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.5235987901687622</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">求解迭代。</span><span class="en">Solver iterations.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>6</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Smooth Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">光顺迭代。</span><span class="en">Smoothing iterations.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>2</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Extrinsic<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">是否使用外在度量。</span><span class="en">Use extrinsic metric.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>True</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Align Boundaries<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">对齐边界。</span><span class="en">Align to boundaries.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>True</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Pure Quad<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">纯四边（仅 Mode=Quad）。</span><span class="en">Pure quads (Mode=Quad only).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>True</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Quad</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Deterministic<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">确定性结果。</span><span class="en">Deterministic output.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>True</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
