<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入网格。</span><span class="en">Input mesh.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Mode <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Triangle</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Quad</code>, <code>Triangle</code></p>
<table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th><span class="zh">模式</span><span class="en">Mode</span></th><th><span class="zh">此时显示的 Inputs</span><span class="en">Inputs shown</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th><code>Quad</code></th><td><code>Mesh</code>, <code>Mode</code>, <code>Target</code>, <code>Edge Length</code>, <code>Face Count</code>, <code>Vertex Count</code>, <code>Crease Angle</code>, <code>Iterations</code>, <code>Smooth Iterations</code>, <code>Extrinsic</code>, <code>Align Boundaries</code>, <code>Pure Quad</code>, <code>Deterministic</code></td></tr>
<tr><th><code>Triangle</code></th><td><code>Mesh</code>, <code>Mode</code>, <code>Target</code>, <code>Edge Length</code>, <code>Face Count</code>, <code>Vertex Count</code>, <code>Crease Angle</code>, <code>Iterations</code>, <code>Smooth Iterations</code>, <code>Extrinsic</code>, <code>Align Boundaries</code>, <code>Deterministic</code></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<h3>Target <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Vertices</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Auto</code>, <code>Edge Length</code>, <code>Faces</code>, <code>Vertices</code></p>
<table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th><span class="zh">模式</span><span class="en">Mode</span></th><th><span class="zh">此时显示的 Inputs</span><span class="en">Inputs shown</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th><code>Auto</code></th><td><code>Mesh</code>, <code>Mode</code>, <code>Target</code>, <code>Crease Angle</code>, <code>Iterations</code>, <code>Smooth Iterations</code>, <code>Extrinsic</code>, <code>Align Boundaries</code>, <code>Deterministic</code>, <code>Pure Quad</code></td></tr>
<tr><th><code>Edge Length</code></th><td><code>Mesh</code>, <code>Mode</code>, <code>Target</code>, <code>Crease Angle</code>, <code>Iterations</code>, <code>Smooth Iterations</code>, <code>Extrinsic</code>, <code>Align Boundaries</code>, <code>Deterministic</code>, <code>Edge Length</code></td></tr>
<tr><th><code>Faces</code></th><td><code>Mesh</code>, <code>Mode</code>, <code>Target</code>, <code>Crease Angle</code>, <code>Iterations</code>, <code>Smooth Iterations</code>, <code>Extrinsic</code>, <code>Align Boundaries</code>, <code>Deterministic</code>, <code>Face Count</code></td></tr>
