<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入网格。</span><span class="en">Input mesh.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Mode<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Remesh / Field / Layout。</span><span class="en">Remesh / Field / Layout.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Remesh</code>, <code>Field</code>, <code>Layout</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Remesh</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Sharp Angle<span class="type">FloatAngle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">尖锐特征角度。</span><span class="en">Sharp feature angle.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.6108652353286743</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Remesh Input<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">是否先重网格输入。</span><span class="en">Remesh input first.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>True</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
