<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeTriangleRemesh" data-page="GeometryNodeTriangleRemesh">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeTriangleRemesh</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Triangle Remesh</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">三角形重网格：均匀或自适应边长，可保边界、贴合原表面。</p>
  <p class="en">Triangle remesh: uniform or adaptive edge length; optional boundary protect & surface project.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入网格。</span><span class="en">Input mesh.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Mode<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Uniform 或 Adaptive。</span><span class="en">Uniform or Adaptive.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Uniform</code>, <code>Adaptive</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Uniform</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Edge Length<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">均匀目标边长。</span><span class="en">Uniform target edge length.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.10000000149011612</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Min Edge Length<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">自适应最小边长。</span><span class="en">Adaptive min edge length.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.05000000074505806</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Max Edge Length<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">自适应最大边长。</span><span class="en">Adaptive max edge length.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.20000000298023224</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Approximation Error<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">逼近误差。</span><span class="en">Approximation error.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.009999999776482582</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">迭代次数。</span><span class="en">Iterations.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>10</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Crease Angle<span class="type">FloatAngle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">折痕角。</span><span class="en">Crease angle.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.5235987901687622</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Project to Surface<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">投影回原表面。</span><span class="en">Project to original surface.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>True</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Protect Boundaries<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">保护边界。</span><span class="en">Protect boundaries.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>True</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
