  <p class="zh">用站点 Points 对 Geometry 做 Voronoi 破碎；Gap/Inside/Max Neighbors 控制裂缝与邻域。</p>
  <p class="en">Voronoi fracture of Geometry by site Points; Gap/Inside/Max Neighbors control cells.</p>
  
