<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeWriteAtIndex" data-page="GeometryNodeWriteAtIndex">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeWriteAtIndex</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Write at Index</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">场节点：按 Target Index 把 Value 原子写入目标域（可跨 Domain），冲突时用 Atomic Operator 归并。</p>
  <p class="en">Field write: scatter Value into target domain by Target Index; Atomic Operator merges collisions.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Data Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Value 类型：Float / Integer / Vector。</span><span class="en">Value type: Float/Int/Vector.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Float</code>, <code>Integer</code>, <code>Vector</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>FLOAT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">always</span></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Source Domain<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">求值 Target Index 与 Value 的域。</span><span class="en">Domain for evaluating index & value.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Point</code>, <code>Edge</code>, <code>Face</code>, <code>Face Corner</code>, <code>Spline</code>, <code>Instance</code>, <code>Layer</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>POINT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">always</span></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Target Domain<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">写入目标域。</span><span class="en">Domain receiving writes.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Point</code>, <code>Edge</code>, <code>Face</code>, <code>Face Corner</code>, <code>Spline</code>, <code>Instance</code>, <code>Layer</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>POINT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">always</span></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Atomic Operator<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">多源写同一索引时：Sum / Min / Max / Mean。</span><span class="en">Merge rule on collision: Sum/Min/Max/Mean.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Sum</code>, <code>Minimum</code>, <code>Maximum</code>, <code>Mean</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>SUM</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">always</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Target Index<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个源元素映射的目标索引（越界忽略）。</span><span class="en">Target index per source element.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Value<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要写入的场值；输出为归并后的目标域场。</span><span class="en">Value field; output is merged target-domain field.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Value<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要写入的场值；输出为归并后的目标域场。</span><span class="en">Value field; output is merged target-domain field.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
