<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeRBFInterpolate" data-page="GeometryNodeRBFInterpolate">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeRBFInterpolate</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>RBF Interpolate</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">从 Source 采样点上的 Value 拟合径向基（RBF）插值，使采样点精确还原 f(xᵢ)=vᵢ（解 Φw=v，非核加权平均）；在 Sample Position 上求值输出 Value。菜单 Geometry → Sample。</p>
  <p class="en">Fits a radial-basis interpolant through Source sample Values so f(xᵢ)=vᵢ exactly (solves Φw=v, not NW kernel average); evaluates on Sample Position. Menu: Geometry → Sample.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Data Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Value 属性类型（节点头；有 socket 的 attribute type）。</span><span class="en">Value attribute type (node header; attribute types with sockets).</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>FLOAT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">always</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Source<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">采样点几何（Mesh 顶点或 Point Cloud）。</span><span class="en">Sample points (Mesh verts or Point Cloud).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Value<span class="type">Field</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">采样点上的属性/场（evaluated_geometry_field）。</span><span class="en">Attribute/field on sample points (evaluated_geometry_field).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Sample Position<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">求值位置（默认上下文 Position）。</span><span class="en">Evaluation positions (defaults to context Position).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>Position</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Kernel Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">径向基 φ(r)，q=r/size。Kernel 面板。</span><span class="en">Radial basis φ(r), q=r/size. Kernel panel.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Gaussian</code>, <code>Inverse Multiquadric</code>, <code>Linear</code>, <code>Cubic</code>, <code>Quintic</code>, <code>Wendland C2</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Gaussian</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">always</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Kernel Size<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">核形状参数 / 支撑半径（Distance）。</span><span class="en">Shape parameter / support radius (Distance).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Value<span class="type">Field</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">插值结果；在采样点上等于原值，别处平滑（RBF 薄膜）。</span><span class="en">Interpolated field; exact at samples, smooth elsewhere (RBF film).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Kernel Type <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Gaussian</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Gaussian</code>, <code>Inverse Multiquadric</code>, <code>Linear</code>, <code>Cubic</code>, <code>Quintic</code>, <code>Wendland C2</code></p>
<table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th>Kernel Type</th><th>φ(q), q = r / size</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th><code>Gaussian</code></th><td><code>exp(−q²)</code></td></tr>
<tr><th><code>Inverse Multiquadric</code></th><td><code>1 / √(1+q²)</code></td></tr>
<tr><th><code>Linear</code></th><td><code>max(0, 1−q)</code></td></tr>
<tr><th><code>Cubic</code></th><td><code>max(0, (1−q)³)</code></td></tr>
<tr><th><code>Quintic</code></th><td><code>max(0, (1−q)⁵)</code></td></tr>
<tr><th><code>Wendland C2</code></th><td>q&lt;1: <code>(1−q)⁴(4q+1)</code>; else 0</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<p class="note-inline"><span class="zh">限制</span><span class="en">Limits</span>: n ≤ 4096（稠密 O(n³)）；n &gt; 512 提示可能较慢。对角 +1e-8 正则。</p>
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeMeshGraphColoring" data-page="GeometryNodeMeshGraphColoring">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeMeshGraphColoring</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Mesh Graph Coloring</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">对网格图做顶点染色，写入属性 Name，输出 Color Count。</p>
  <p class="en">Graph-colors the mesh, stores attribute Name, outputs Color Count.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入网格。</span><span class="en">Input mesh.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Name<span class="type">String</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">写入的颜色属性名（点域整数色号）。</span><span class="en">Color attribute name (point domain).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>color</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Algorithm<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">染色算法菜单：Greedy / Greedy Random / Welsh–Powell / DSatur / RLF。</span><span class="en">Coloring algorithm menu.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Greedy</code>, <code>Greedy Random</code>, <code>Welsh–Powell</code>, <code>DSatur</code>, <code>RLF</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>DSatur</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Seed<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">仅 Greedy Random：随机置换顶点顺序的种子。其它算法不显示。</span><span class="en">Only for Greedy Random: seed for random vertex permutation. Hidden otherwise.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Algorithm = Greedy Random</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入网格。</span><span class="en">Input mesh.</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Color Count<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">使用的颜色数。</span><span class="en">Number of colors used.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Algorithm <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>DSatur</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Greedy</code>, <code>Greedy Random</code>, <code>Welsh–Powell</code>, <code>DSatur</code>, <code>RLF</code></p>
<table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th>Algorithm</th><th><span class="zh">显示的 Inputs</span><span class="en">Inputs shown</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th><code>Greedy</code></th><td><code>Mesh</code>, <code>Name</code>, <code>Algorithm</code></td></tr><tr><th><code>Greedy Random</code></th><td><code>Mesh</code>, <code>Name</code>, <code>Algorithm</code>, <code>Seed</code></td></tr><tr><th><code>Welsh–Powell</code></th><td><code>Mesh</code>, <code>Name</code>, <code>Algorithm</code></td></tr><tr><th><code>DSatur</code></th><td><code>Mesh</code>, <code>Name</code>, <code>Algorithm</code></td></tr><tr><th><code>RLF</code></th><td><code>Mesh</code>, <code>Name</code>, <code>Algorithm</code></td></tr></tbody></table>
<p class="note-inline"><code>Seed</code>：<span class="zh">源码</span><span class="en">source</span> <code>usage_by_single_menu(GreedyRandom)</code> — <span class="zh">仅 Greedy Random 显示。</span><span class="en">only when Algorithm = Greedy Random.</span></p>
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeTangentField" data-page="GeometryNodeTangentField">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeTangentField</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Tangent Field</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">在网格上生成 N 路切向场，写入以 Prefix 命名的属性。</p>
  <p class="en">Builds N tangent directions on the mesh; stores attributes with Prefix.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入网格。</span><span class="en">Input mesh.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>N<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">切向场路数。</span><span class="en">Number of tangent directions.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>4</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Prefix<span class="type">String</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">属性名前缀。</span><span class="en">Attribute prefix.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>dir</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Normalize<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">是否单位化方向。</span><span class="en">Normalize directions.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>True</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
