<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeMeshGradient" data-page="GeometryNodeMeshGradient">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeMeshGradient</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Gradient</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">对<strong>网格顶点</strong>上的标量场 Value 求<strong>每面</strong>梯度（首三角线性拟合）。勿与官方 Grid Gradient 混淆。输出 Gradient 为面域向量场，可适配其它域。</p>
  <p class="en">Per-face gradient of a scalar field defined on <strong>mesh vertices</strong> (linear fit on first triangle of each face). Not official Grid Gradient. Gradient is face-domain; may adapt to other domains.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Value<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">定义在网格顶点上的标量场。</span><span class="en">Scalar field on mesh vertices.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Gradient<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每面梯度向量（优先 Face 域）。</span><span class="en">Per-face gradient vector (preferred Face domain).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeMeshDivergence" data-page="GeometryNodeMeshDivergence">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeMeshDivergence</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Divergence</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">对网格向量场求<strong>每顶点</strong>离散散度（三角上线性 FEM：∂Vx/∂x+∂Vy/∂y+∂Vz/∂z，面积加权）。Vector 在顶点求值。勿与官方 Grid Divergence 混淆。</p>
  <p class="en">Per-vertex discrete divergence of a mesh vector field (linear FEM on triangles; area-weighted). Vector evaluated on vertices. Not official Grid Divergence.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Vector<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">网格上的向量场（顶点求值；面域属性会插值到点）。</span><span class="en">Vector field on mesh (eval on verts; face attrs interpolate to points).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Divergence<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每顶点散度标量（优先 Point 域）。</span><span class="en">Per-vertex divergence scalar (preferred Point domain).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCurveIntersections" data-page="GeometryNodeCurveIntersections">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCurveIntersections</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Curve Intersections</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">计算曲线交点并输出点云及相关属性。Mode：Curve（3D 曲线互交）/ Curve Project（投影后互交）/ Plane（与平面）/ Surface（与网格表面）。Paired Data Mode 仅在 Curve/Curve Project 下出现；Full Data 时输出配对字段。</p>
  <p class="en">Curve intersections → point cloud + fields. Mode: Curve / Curve Project / Plane / Surface. Paired Data Mode only for Curve modes; Full Data enables pair outputs.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mode<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">求交模式：Curve / Curve Project / Plane / Surface。</span><span class="en">Intersection mode: Curve / Curve Project / Plane / Surface.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Curve</code>, <code>Curve Project</code>, <code>Plane</code>, <code>Surface</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Curve</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Paired Data Mode<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Points Only 只交点；Full Data 另输出配对位置/方向/ID。仅 Mode=Curve 或 Curve Project 时显示。</span><span class="en">Points Only vs Full Data (pair fields). Only for Curve / Curve Project.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Points Only</code>, <code>Full Data</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Points Only</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode ∈ {Curve, Curve Project}</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Curve<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入曲线几何。</span><span class="en">Input curve geometry.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">表面网格（仅 Mode=Surface）。</span><span class="en">Surface mesh (Mode=Surface only).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Surface</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Self Intersections<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">是否包含自交（Curve / Curve Project）。</span><span class="en">Include self-intersections (Curve modes).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>False</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode ∈ {Curve, Curve Project}</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>All Intersections<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">是否包含全部非自交交点（Curve / Curve Project）。</span><span class="en">Include all non-self intersections (Curve modes).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>True</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode ∈ {Curve, Curve Project}</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Distance<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">交点之间的最大距离阈值（Curve / Curve Project）。</span><span class="en">Max distance between intersections (Curve modes).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode ∈ {Curve, Curve Project}</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Direction<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入：平面/正交投影方向（Plane、Curve Project）。输出：交点处曲线方向（Project 模式为投影后方向）。</span><span class="en">In: plane/ortho direction (Plane, Curve Project). Out: curve direction at hit (projected in Project mode).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 1.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode ∈ {Plane, Curve Project}</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Center<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平面中心（仅 Mode=Plane）。</span><span class="en">Plane center (Mode=Plane only).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Plane</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Min Angle<span class="type">FloatAngle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">交点最短夹角下限（始终显示）。</span><span class="en">Minimum shortest intersection angle (always).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Max Angle<span class="type">FloatAngle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">交点最短夹角上限（始终显示，默认 π/2）。</span><span class="en">Maximum shortest intersection angle (always, default π/2).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.5707963705062866</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">交点点云。</span><span class="en">Intersection point cloud.</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Curve Index<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">交点所属曲线索引（Full Data 或 Plane/Surface 时可用）。</span><span class="en">Curve index field (Full Data or Plane/Surface).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Paired Data Mode = Full Data，或 Mode ∈ {Plane, Surface}</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Direction<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入：平面/正交投影方向（Plane、Curve Project）。输出：交点处曲线方向（Project 模式为投影后方向）。</span><span class="en">In: plane/ortho direction (Plane, Curve Project). Out: curve direction at hit (projected in Project mode).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Paired Data Mode = Full Data，或 Mode ∈ {Plane, Surface}</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Factor<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">样条总长比例因子。</span><span class="en">Fraction of spline length.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Paired Data Mode = Full Data，或 Mode ∈ {Plane, Surface}</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Length<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">沿样条弧长。</span><span class="en">Distance along spline.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Paired Data Mode = Full Data，或 Mode ∈ {Plane, Surface}</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Normal<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">表面法线（Mode=Surface 时显示）。</span><span class="en">Surface normal (Mode=Surface).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Mode = Surface</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Pair Position<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">配对交点位置（Full Data）。</span><span class="en">Opposing pair position.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Paired Data Mode = Full Data</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Pair Direction<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">配对交点方向（Full Data）。</span><span class="en">Opposing pair direction.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Paired Data Mode = Full Data</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Pair<span class="type">Bool</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">是否为配对交点之一（Full Data）。</span><span class="en">Is one of a matching pair.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Paired Data Mode = Full Data</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Pair ID<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">配对唯一 ID（Full Data）。</span><span class="en">Unique pair ID.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Paired Data Mode = Full Data</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Mode <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Curve</code> · <code>Curve</code> / <code>Curve Project</code> / <code>Plane</code> / <code>Surface</code></p>
<table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th>Mode</th><th><span class="zh">额外显示的 Inputs</span><span class="en">Extra inputs</span></th><th><span class="zh">备注</span><span class="en">Notes</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th><code>Curve</code></th><td><code>Paired Data Mode</code>, <code>Self Intersections</code>, <code>All Intersections</code>, <code>Distance</code></td><td>3D 曲线–曲线求交</td></tr><tr><th><code>Curve Project</code></th><td><code>Paired Data Mode</code>, <code>Self Intersections</code>, <code>All Intersections</code>, <code>Distance</code>, <code>Direction</code></td><td>投影到正交平面后求交；Direction=投影平面法向</td></tr><tr><th><code>Plane</code></th><td><code>Direction</code>, <code>Center</code></td><td>曲线与平面求交</td></tr><tr><th><code>Surface</code></th><td><code>Mesh</code></td><td>曲线与网格表面求交</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p><span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">Always</span>: <code>Mode</code>, <code>Curve</code>, <code>Min Angle</code>, <code>Max Angle</code></p>
<h3>Paired Data Mode <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">仅当</span><span class="en">Only when</span> <code>Mode ∈ {Curve, Curve Project}</code>。<span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Points Only</code>。</p>
<table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th>Paired Data Mode</th><th><span class="zh">额外 Outputs</span><span class="en">Extra outputs</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th><code>Points Only</code></th><td>—</td></tr><tr><th><code>Full Data</code></th><td><code>Pair Position</code>, <code>Pair Direction</code>, <code>Pair</code>, <code>Pair ID</code>；且 Curve Index / Direction / Factor / Length 等字段输出可用</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p class="note-inline"><span class="zh">输出</span><span class="en">Outputs</span>: <code>Normal</code> → Mode=Surface；<code>Curve Index</code>/<code>Direction</code>/<code>Factor</code>/<code>Length</code> → Full Data 或 Mode∈{Plane,Surface}（源码 usage_inference）。</p>
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>

