<article class="page" id="page-ImageNodeBakeImage" data-page="ImageNodeBakeImage">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>ImageNodeBakeImage</code> · <code>ImageNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Bake Image</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">把求值后的图像写出到磁盘。<strong>仅点击节点体 Bake 按钮时写盘</strong>（不在每次树求值时写出）。节点体菜单：Format（PNG/JPEG/OpenEXR/…）、Color Space（默认 Auto）；接口 Path / Prefix + 可扩展多路 Image（socket 名=文件名主体）。</p>
  <p class="en">Write evaluated images to disk only when pressing Bake (not every cook). Node-body: Format + Color Space; sockets Path/Prefix + extendable Image slots (name = filename stem).</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Bake<span class="type">Operator</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">节点体上的 <strong>Bake</strong> 按钮（<code>node.image_process_bake</code>）。仅点击时写盘，不在每次 cook 时写出。</span><span class="en">Bake button on node body; writes disk only when pressed, not on every cook.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Format<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输出图片格式（节点体菜单，非 socket）。</span><span class="en">Output image format (node-body menu, not a socket).</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>PNG</code>, <code>JPEG</code>, <code>OpenEXR</code>, <code>TIFF</code>, <code>BMP</code>, <code>Targa</code>, <code>WebP</code>, <code>Radiance HDR</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>PNG</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Color Space<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">写出颜色空间。默认 <code>Auto</code>（空存储 / RNA 默认 AUTO）；界面从颜色管理列表选，与 Blender 图像保存一致。</span><span class="en">Output color space; default Auto. Picked from color management list.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Auto</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Path<span class="type">StringFilePath</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输出目录。// 相对已保存 .blend（如 //textures/）；未保存 blend 不会回退到 exe 目录；也可绝对路径。</span><span class="en">Output directory. // relative to saved .blend; absolute path allowed.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>//</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Prefix<span class="type">String</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">可选文件名前缀，加在各 Image 槽名称前（如 shot_ + Color → shot_Color.png）。</span><span class="en">Optional prefix before each image item name.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Image<span class="type">Color</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要烘焙的图像。可用扩展槽添加多路；socket 名称即输出文件名主体（加 Prefix + 扩展名）。</span><span class="en">Image to bake; extend for more. Socket name = filename stem (+ Prefix + ext).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th><span class="zh">（动态扩展）</span><span class="en">(dynamic extend)</span><span class="type">Virtual</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">拖线或侧栏添加自定义输入项</span><span class="en">Drag or sidebar to add custom inputs</span></div><div class="when">always</div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
