<article class="page" id="page-ImageNodeFractalPrimitive" data-page="ImageNodeFractalPrimitive">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>ImageNodeFractalPrimitive</code> · <code>ImageNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Fractal Primitive</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">分形原语（Mandelbrot/Julia 等）：输出 Color 与 Distance 估计。</p>
  <p class="en">Fractal primitive (Mandelbrot/Julia…) → Color + Distance estimate.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Fractal<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Mandelbrot / Julia。</span><span class="en">Mandelbrot / Julia.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Mandelbrot</code>, <code>Julia</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>MANDELBROT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <span class="zh">始终显示</span><span class="en">always</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Vector<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">采样坐标。</span><span class="en">Sample position.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Power<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">幂次。</span><span class="en">Power.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>2.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Iterations<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最大迭代。</span><span class="en">Max iterations.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>64.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Bailout<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">逃逸半径。</span><span class="en">Bailout radius.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>4.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Julia C<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Julia 常数。</span><span class="en">Julia constant.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[-0.800000011920929, 0.15600000321865082, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Fractal = Julia</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Scale<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">缩放。</span><span class="en">Scale.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.5</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
