<article class="page" id="page-CompositorNodeImageProcess" data-page="CompositorNodeImageProcess">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>CompositorNodeImageProcess</code> · <code>CompositorNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>GPU Texture Editor（合成器节点）</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">这是<strong>合成器（Compositor）</strong>节点，不是 GPU Texture Editor 编辑器里的节点。在合成树中选择一个 <code>ImageNodeTree</code>（GPU Texture Editor 节点组），合成时嵌套求值该组；本节点上的 Inputs/Outputs 随所选组的 Group Input / Group Output 接口同步。节点体：<code>node_tree</code> 数据块选择器。</p>
  <p class="en">A <strong>Compositor</strong> node (not a node inside the GPU Texture Editor). Pick an ImageNodeTree group; compositor evaluates that group nested. Socket layout mirrors the group's Group Input/Output. Body: node_tree selector.</p>
  <p class="note-inline"><span class="zh">所属树：</span><span class="en">Tree: </span><code>CompositorNodeTree</code> · <span class="zh">合成器 Add 菜单添加，不是 Image Process 编辑器内的节点。</span><span class="en">Added in Compositor, not inside Image Process editor.</span></p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Node Tree<span class="type">Data-Block</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">合成器节点体上的选择器：指定要嵌套求值的 <code>ImageNodeTree</code>（GPU Texture Editor 节点组）。不是 GTE 编辑器内部节点。</span><span class="en">Compositor node-body: ImageNodeTree group to evaluate. Not a node inside the GTE editor.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th><span class="zh">（动态接口）</span><span class="en">(dynamic IO)</span><span class="type">Group</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Inputs/Outputs 随所选组的 Group Input / Group Output 自动同步（与节点组节点相同机制）。未选组时本 dump 下为空。</span><span class="en">Sockets mirror the selected group interface; empty until a group is set.</span></div><div class="when">always</div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <p class="muted">—</p>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-shader-image-socket" data-page="shader-image-socket">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>NodeSocketImage</code> · <code>GeometryNodeImageTexture</code> · <code>ShaderNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Image Socket（着色器）</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">着色器节点树支持 <code>SOCK_IMAGE</code> 图像数据块接口：可在<strong>材质节点组</strong>上声明 <code>NodeSocketImage</code> 输入，从组外传入贴图；菜单 Texture → <strong>Image Texture</strong> 使用 Geometry 同款节点（带 Image / Vector / Frame），inline 阶段替换为 legacy <code>ShaderNodeTexImage</code>，Cycles / EEVEE 等走原有 TexImage 路径。与 GPU Texture Editor（Image Process）无关。</p>
  <p class="en">Shader trees accept <code>SOCK_IMAGE</code>: group interfaces can expose <code>NodeSocketImage</code>; Add → Texture → <strong>Image Texture</strong> uses the Geometry-style node (Image / Vector / Frame), inlined to legacy <code>ShaderNodeTexImage</code> for Cycles / EEVEE. Unrelated to GPU Texture Editor (Image Process).</p>

  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <div class="zh">
<ul class="zh">
<li><strong>组接口</strong>：Shader 组可增加 Image 类型输入；包组后组节点出现 Image 口，贴图可从外部传入。</li>
<li><strong>菜单</strong>：Add → Texture → <strong>Image Texture</strong> = <code>GeometryNodeImageTexture</code>；另保留 <strong>Image Texture (legacy)</strong> = <code>ShaderNodeTexImage</code>。</li>
<li><strong>拖图</strong>：向材质节点编辑器拖入图像 → 添加 Geo Image Texture（World 仍为 Environment）。</li>
<li><strong>求值</strong>：<code>shader_nodes_inline</code> 将 Geo Image Texture 转为 legacy TexImage（拷贝插值 / 扩展 / 帧偏移）。</li>
<li><strong>单值约束</strong>：Image 与 Frame 必须是 single value；连场会报 must be a single value。</li>
<li><strong>非 HLSL</strong>：<code>ShaderNodeHLSL</code> 的可扩展参数<strong>不含</strong> Image 类型（见 <a class="nav-link" href="#ShaderNodeHLSL" data-page="ShaderNodeHLSL">HLSL</a>）。</li>
</ul>
<p class="zh muted">Notes：<code>Blender_Shader_Image_Socket_PR151575_2026-08-04.md</code>（PR #151575 本地移植）</p>
  </div>
  <div class="en">
<ul class="en">
<li><strong>Group interface</strong> — Image input type on shader groups; outer group node exposes Image socket.</li>
<li><strong>Menu</strong> — Image Texture = <code>GeometryNodeImageTexture</code>; legacy = <code>ShaderNodeTexImage</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Drag-drop</strong> — drop image into material editor → Geo Image Texture (World stays Environment).</li>
<li><strong>Eval</strong> — inliner rewrites to legacy TexImage (interpolation / extension / frame offset).</li>
<li><strong>Single value</strong> — Image and Frame must be singles.</li>
<li><strong>Not HLSL</strong> — HLSL extendable params do not include Image type.</li>
</ul>
  </div>

  <h2>Image Texture（材质内）Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Image<span class="type">Image</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">图像数据块（单值；可来自组接口 Image socket）。</span><span class="en">Image data-block (single value; may come from group Image socket).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Vector<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">采样坐标（可连线）。</span><span class="en">Sample coordinates (linkable).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Frame<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">序列/电影帧偏移（单值）。EEVEE 对 Frame 支持可能不完整（上游 WIP）。</span><span class="en">Sequence/movie frame offset (single). EEVEE Frame support may be incomplete (upstream WIP).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Image Texture（材质内）Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Color<span class="type">Color</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">采样颜色（RGBA）。</span><span class="en">Sampled color (RGBA).</span></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Alpha<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Alpha 通道。</span><span class="en">Alpha channel.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>

  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「着色器 · image socket」+ Notes。socket/管线能力页，非 HLSL 参数。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List Shaders · image socket + Notes. Socket/pipeline feature page, not an HLSL param.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-ShaderNodeSDFShape" data-page="ShaderNodeSDFShape">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>ShaderNodeSDFShape</code> · <code>ShaderNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>SDF Shape</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">着色器侧解析 SDF 基元，输出 Distance（与 Image 版同类 Shape 菜单）。</p>
  <p class="en">Shader-side analytic SDF primitives → Distance.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Shape<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">SDF 基元类型菜单。</span><span class="en">SDF primitive type.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部</strong><strong class="en">All</strong> (58): <code>Sphere (3D)</code>, <code>Box (3D)</code>, <code>Torus (3D)</code>, <code>Round Box (3D)</code>, <code>Box Frame (3D)</code>, <code>Capsule (3D)</code>, <code>Capped Cylinder (3D)</code>, <code>Capped Cone (3D)</code>, <code>Plane (3D)</code>, <code>Hex Prism (3D)</code>, <code>Octahedron (3D)</code>, <code>Pyramid (3D)</code> …</div><div class="menu-line"><strong>Default</strong>: <code>Sphere (3D)</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: always</div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Vector<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">着色坐标。</span><span class="en">Shading position.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Scale<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">整体缩放。</span><span class="en">Overall scale.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">半径。</span><span class="en">Radius.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.5</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape ∈ （35 种形状，见下表）</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Size<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">盒/尺寸。</span><span class="en">Size.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.5, 0.5, 0.5]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape ∈ （16 种形状，见下表）</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Height<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">高度。</span><span class="en">Height.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape ∈ （19 种形状，见下表）</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Minor Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">次半径（环等）。</span><span class="en">Minor radius.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.15000000596046448</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape = Torus (3D) / Capped Torus (3D) / Link (3D) / Death Star (3D) / Moon (2D)</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Roundness<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">圆角。</span><span class="en">Roundness.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.10000000149011612</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape = Round Box (3D) / Box Frame (3D) / Rounded Cylinder (3D) / Rhombus (3D) / Rounded Box (2D)</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Top Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">顶部半径。</span><span class="en">Top radius.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.05000000074505806</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape = Capped Cone (3D) / Round Cone (3D) / Trapezoid (2D) / Uneven Capsule (2D)</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Offset<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">偏移。</span><span class="en">Offset.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape = Plane (3D)</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Point A<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">控制点 A。</span><span class="en">Control point A.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[-0.5, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape = Segment (2D) / Triangle (2D) / Oriented Box (2D)</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Point B<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">控制点 B。</span><span class="en">Control point B.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.5, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape = Segment (2D) / Triangle (2D) / Oriented Box (2D)</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Point C<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">控制点 C。</span><span class="en">Control point C.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.5, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape = Triangle (2D)</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Angle<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">角度。</span><span class="en">Angle.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape = Capped Torus (3D) / Cone (3D) / Solid Angle (3D) / Infinite Cone (3D) / Pie (2D) / Arc (2D) / Ring (2D) / Horseshoe (2D)</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Thickness<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">厚度。</span><span class="en">Thickness.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.10000000149011612</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape = Cut Hollow Sphere (3D) / Arc (2D) / Ring (2D) / Horseshoe (2D) / Cross (2D) / Rounded X (2D) / Oriented Box (2D)</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Count<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">重复/段数。</span><span class="en">Count.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>5.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape = Star (2D) / Stairs (2D)</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Factor<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">混合因子。</span><span class="en">Factor.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>3.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>Shape = Death Star (3D) / Chamfer Box (2D) / Parallelogram (2D) / Star (2D) / Vesica (2D) / Moon (2D)</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
