<article class="page" id="page-ShaderNodeHLSL" data-page="ShaderNodeHLSL">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>ShaderNodeHLSL</code> · <code>ShaderNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>HLSL</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">EEVEE 用 HLSL 子集自定义着色：中间 Code 文本框 + 可扩展 In/Out 参数，翻译为 GLSL 接入材质。可扩展参数类型为 Float / Int / Boolean / Vector / Color，<strong>不含 Image</strong>；材质贴图 Image 接口见 <a class="nav-link" href="#shader-image-socket" data-page="shader-image-socket">Image Socket</a>。</p>
  <p class="en">Custom HLSL subset for EEVEE: Code textbox + extendable In/Out, translated to GLSL. Extendable types: Float / Int / Boolean / Vector / Color — <strong>no Image</strong>; see <a class="nav-link" href="#shader-image-socket" data-page="shader-image-socket">Image Socket</a> for material image wiring.</p>
  
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Code<span class="type">String</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">HLSL 源码文本（节点体多行框）。RNA：<code>code</code>。支持 floatN、lerp、saturate 等子集。</span><span class="en">HLSL source textbox. RNA: code. Subset: floatN, lerp, saturate, …</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>// Inputs: Color, Fac  |  Outputs: Result
// HLSL subset: floatN, lerp, saturate, frac, ddx/ddy, mad, rcp, ...
Result = float4(lerp(Color.rgb, Color.rgb * Fac, saturate(Fac)), Color.a);
</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Color<span class="type">Color</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">默认可扩展输入示例 Color。</span><span class="en">Default extendable input Color.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.800000011920929, 0.800000011920929, 0.800000011920929, 1.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th>Fac<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">默认可扩展输入 Fac。</span><span class="en">Default extendable input Fac.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
<tr><th><span class="zh">（动态扩展）</span><span class="en">(dynamic extend)</span><span class="type">Virtual</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">拖线或侧栏添加自定义输入项</span><span class="en">Drag or sidebar to add custom inputs</span></div><div class="when">always</div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Result<span class="type">Color</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">默认可扩展输出 Result。</span><span class="en">Default extendable output Result.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：当前 blender.exe 导出 + Notes 参数说明。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From live blender.exe + Notes. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-ui-viewport-overlay-attr" data-page="ui-viewport-overlay-attr">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">视口叠加层属性预览优化</span><span class="en">Viewport Attribute Text Overlay</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <div class="zh"><p class="zh">Geometry Nodes Viewer 在 3D 视口叠加层显示属性文字的增强。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li><strong>Attribute Text 字号</strong>：仅控制 Viewer 属性叠加文字，不影响全局 UI 字号。</li>
<li><strong>Exclude Backfaces</strong>：按当前视图几何遮挡隐藏文字（BVH 自遮挡），不是简单的顶点法线朝向剔除。</li>
<li>UI 位置：3D Viewport Overlays → Viewer 区域。</li>
</ul>
<p class="zh muted">Notes：<code>Blender_Viewer_Attribute_Text_Overlay_Implementation.md</code></p></div>
  <div class="en"><p class="en">Enhancements for Geometry Nodes Viewer attribute text in the 3D Viewport overlay.</p>
<ul class="en">
<li><strong>Attribute Text size</strong> — only Viewer overlay text.</li>
<li><strong>Exclude Backfaces</strong> — geometric occlusion from view (mesh BVH), not simple normal facing.</li>
<li>UI: 3D Viewport Overlays → Viewer.</li>
</ul></div>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「界面 UI 与便捷操作」+ Notes。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List UI section + Notes. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-ui-group-separator-message" data-page="ui-group-separator-message">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">节点组 Separator 与 Message</span><span class="en">Group Interface Separator &amp; Message</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <div class="zh"><p class="zh">节点组接口可插入非数据项，用于布局与说明。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li><strong>Separator</strong>：横线分隔，无 socket / 链接语义。</li>
<li><strong>Message</strong>：多行说明文字（N 面板可编辑 message）。</li>
<li>Python：<code>iface.new_separator()</code> / <code>iface.new_message("note")</code>。</li>
<li>布局注意：separator 必须推进 <code>locy</code>，禁止在树行里用 <code>separator_spacer()</code> 撑破布局。</li>
</ul>
<p class="zh muted">Notes：<code>Blender_Node_Group_Interface_Separator_Message.md</code></p></div>
  <div class="en"><p class="en">Non-data interface items: horizontal Separator and multi-line Message notes.</p></div>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「界面 UI 与便捷操作」+ Notes。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List UI section + Notes. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-ui-shake-combo-insert" data-page="ui-shake-combo-insert">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">抖动分离与多节点 Combo 插线</span><span class="en">Shake Detach &amp; Combo Insert</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <div class="zh"><p class="zh">节点编辑器 Houdini 风格连线交互。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li><strong>抖动分离</strong>：拖动选中节点时快速方向翻转 → 从外部连线中脱离，邻居旁通重连。</li>
<li><strong>Combo 插线</strong>：多选节点整体拖到一条 wire 上 → 保留 combo 内部连线，以整体插入该 wire（只改边界进出边）。</li>
<li>单节点 / 多节点均支持分离。</li>
</ul>
<p class="zh muted">Notes：<code>Blender_Node_Shake_Detach_And_Combo_Insert_2026-07-26.md</code></p></div>
  <div class="en"><p class="en">Shake while dragging to detach external links; multi-node combo insert onto a wire keeping internal links.</p></div>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「界面 UI 与便捷操作」+ Notes。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List UI section + Notes. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-ui-u-align" data-page="ui-u-align">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">按住 U + 拖动对齐节点</span><span class="en">Hold U + Drag Align</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <div class="zh"><p class="zh">Houdini 风格节点布局对齐（快捷键 <strong>U</strong>；不占用 A 全选）。</p>
<ol class="zh">
<li>至少选中 2 个非 Frame 节点。</li>
<li><strong>按住 / 按下 U</strong> 进入对齐模态（十字光标，不启动框选）。</li>
<li><strong>左键拖</strong>：左右主导 → 左→右分层并对齐 socket Y；上下主导 → 上→下分层。</li>
<li>松左键确认；Esc / 右键 / 未拖松 U → 取消。</li>
</ol>
<table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th>操作</th><th>结果</th></tr></thead><tbody class="zh">
<tr><td>只按 U 移鼠标（无 LMB）</td><td>等待 LMB，不布局</td></tr>
<tr><td>U + 空白处左键拖</td><td>对齐布局（不框选）</td></tr>
<tr><td>不按 U 左键拖空白</td><td>框选</td></tr>
<tr><td>不按 U 拖节点</td><td>自由平移</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<p class="zh muted">Notes：<code>Blender_Node_Hold_U_Align_While_Dragging_2026-07-26.md</code></p></div>
  <div class="en"><p class="en">Hold <strong>U</strong>, LMB-drag to layout-align selected nodes (horizontal or vertical by drag direction).</p></div>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「界面 UI 与便捷操作」+ Notes。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List UI section + Notes. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-ui-spreadsheet-sort" data-page="ui-spreadsheet-sort">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">电子表格属性列排序</span><span class="en">Spreadsheet Column Sort</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <div class="zh"><p class="zh">Spreadsheet 表头点击排序（Houdini Geometry Spreadsheet 风格）。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li>点击<strong>整格表头</strong>循环：升序 → 降序 → 原序。</li>
<li>左侧 Index 列同样可排；同时只激活一个排序键。</li>
<li>排序在行过滤 / Selection filter 之后。</li>
<li>不破坏：拖宽、双击 fit、列重排。</li>
</ul>
<p class="zh muted">Notes：<code>Blender_Spreadsheet_Column_Sort_2026-07-26.md</code></p></div>
  <div class="en"><p class="en">Click column headers to cycle ascending / descending / none. Index column sortable too.</p></div>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「界面 UI 与便捷操作」+ Notes。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List UI section + Notes. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-ui-join-to-next" data-page="ui-join-to-next">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">节点组参数：加入下一行（横排）</span><span class="en">Join Parameter to Next (Horizontal)</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <div class="zh"><p class="zh">组接口 Socket 可勾选 <strong>Horizontally Join to Next Parameter</strong>：与下一个参数横排，可连续累加。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li>N 面板细节 toggle；最后一项灰掉（无下一个 Socket）。</li>
<li>Separator / Message 无此属性。</li>
<li>外层组节点控件横排；修改器侧连续 join 的 Input 一行多列。</li>
<li>内置节点 <code>align_with_previous</code> 经典路径不受影响。</li>
</ul>
<p class="zh muted">Notes：<code>Blender_Node_Interface_Join_To_Next_Parameter_2026-07-26.md</code></p></div>
  <div class="en"><p class="en">Interface socket flag: horizontally join with the next parameter; chainable.</p></div>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「界面 UI 与便捷操作」+ Notes。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List UI section + Notes. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-ui-ctrl-lmb-rename" data-page="ui-ctrl-lmb-rename">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">Ctrl+LMB 节点组参数改名</span><span class="en">Ctrl+LMB Rename Group Socket</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <div class="zh"><p class="zh">组接口（及 Group Input/Output）在外部可就地改名。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li><strong>Ctrl+LMB</strong>（或双击）点<strong>名字</strong> → 就地编辑（未启用 Optional Label 时）。</li>
<li>可改名时悬停有浅色高亮提示。</li>
<li>与 Capture Attribute 改名机制一致；与 Ctrl 点 socket 形状改类型不冲突。</li>
</ul>
<p class="zh muted">Notes：<code>Blender_Node_Group_Interface_Ctrl_LMB_Rename_2026-07-27.md</code></p></div>
  <div class="en"><p class="en">Ctrl+LMB (or double-click) on socket name to rename; hover highlight when renamable.</p></div>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「界面 UI 与便捷操作」+ Notes。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List UI section + Notes. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-ui-menu-multi" data-page="ui-menu-multi">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">节点组 Menu 多选与 List 输出</span><span class="en">Menu Multi-Selection &amp; List Output</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <div class="zh"><p class="zh">节点组接口 Menu 类型支持多选。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li>N 面板：<strong>Multi Selection</strong>。</li>
<li>组外折叠：checklist 下拉多选；Expanded：可同时 toggle 多项。</li>
<li>组内 <strong>Menu Switch</strong>：多选时 Output 返回 <strong>List</strong>（所有选中 item 的值）+ 各 item 布尔状态。</li>
<li>编码：单选 value=identifier；多选 value=bitfield。</li>
</ul>
<p class="zh muted">Notes：<code>Blender_Menu_Multi_Selection_2026-07-27.md</code></p></div>
  <div class="en"><p class="en">Menu interface multi-select; Menu Switch outputs a List of selected values.</p></div>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「界面 UI 与便捷操作」+ Notes。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List UI section + Notes. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-ui-ctrl-socket-type" data-page="ui-ctrl-socket-type">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">Ctrl+LMB 改 Socket 数据类型</span><span class="en">Ctrl+LMB Change Socket Data Type</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <div class="zh"><p class="zh">在节点编辑器中 <strong>Ctrl+LMB</strong> 点 socket 的<strong>彩色形状</strong>（不是名字）。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li>短按 &lt;0.2s → 常驻面板点选类型；长按 ≥0.2s → 松手菜单。</li>
<li>支持：组接口、Capture Attribute、Expression、Format String、Bundle、Closure 等可改类型的 item。</li>
<li>固定类型 socket（如 Math）无菜单。</li>
<li>Ctrl+点名字仍是改名；Ctrl+拖线仍是 detach link。</li>
<li>v2 起改类型快捷键为 <strong>Shift+LMB</strong>（见 <a class="nav-link" href="#ui-v2-shift-socket-type" data-page="ui-v2-shift-socket-type">v2 · Shift+LMB 改接口数据类型</a>）。</li>
</ul>
<p class="zh muted">Notes：<code>Blender_Node_Socket_Ctrl_Alt_Type_Shape_Switch_2026-08-04.md</code></p></div>
  <div class="en"><p class="en">Ctrl+LMB on socket shape to change data type (short click panel / long press pie). v2 remaps this to Shift+LMB.</p></div>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「界面 UI 与便捷操作」+ Notes。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List UI section + Notes. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>

<article class="page" id="page-ui-alt-socket-shape" data-page="ui-alt-socket-shape">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">Alt+LMB 改 Socket Structure 形状</span><span class="en">Alt+LMB Change Socket Structure Shape</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <div class="zh"><p class="zh">在节点编辑器中 <strong>Alt+LMB</strong> 点 socket 的<strong>彩色形状</strong>。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li>修改 Structure Type / Shape：Auto / Single / Field / Grid / List / Dynamic。</li>
<li>短按面板 / 长按松手菜单（同 Ctrl，阈值 0.2s）。</li>
<li>组接口内外、Bundle 等支持写 <code>structure_type</code>。</li>
</ul>
<p class="zh muted">Notes：<code>Blender_Node_Socket_Ctrl_Alt_Type_Shape_Switch_2026-08-04.md</code></p></div>
  <div class="en"><p class="en">Alt+LMB on socket shape to change structure type (Auto/Single/Field/Grid/List/Dynamic).</p></div>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「界面 UI 与便捷操作」+ Notes。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List UI section + Notes. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>


