<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeSetGroupInputDefault" data-page="GeometryNodeSetGroupInputDefault">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeSetGroupInputDefault</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Set Group Input Default</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">当对应的组输入在组外未连接时，此节点树中每个组输入节点对该接口返回默认值</p>
  <p class="en">When the matching group input is not linked outside the group, every Group Input node in this tree returns Default for that socket</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
