<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeGuideGeometry" data-page="GeometryNodeGuideGeometry">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeGuideGeometry</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Guide Geometry</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">物体选中时在 3D 视图中绘制额外几何。修改器禁用时隐藏。不影响渲染或修改器输出，也不出现在电子表格中</p>
  <p class="en">Draw extra geometry in the 3D Viewport while the object is selected. Hidden when the modifier is disabled. Does not affect render or the modifier output, and is not shown in the Spreadsheet</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Show<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">打开或关闭此引导叠加</span><span class="en">Turn this guide overlay on or off</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">作为视口引导绘制的几何。不属于修改器输出，不参与渲染，也不出现在电子表格中</span><span class="en">Geometry drawn as a viewport guide. It is not part of the modifier output, is not rendered, and does not appear in the Spreadsheet</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Color<span class="type">Color</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">在 3D 视图中绘制引导时使用的叠加颜色</span><span class="en">Overlay color used when drawing the guide in the 3D Viewport</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[1.0, 0.55, 0.15, 0.85]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Display<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">引导几何在 3D 视图中的绘制方式</span><span class="en">How the guide geometry is drawn in the 3D Viewport</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Wire</code>, <code>Solid</code>, <code>Wire and Solid</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Wire</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>X-Ray<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">将引导绘制在其他几何之前以保持可见</span><span class="en">Draw the guide in front of other geometry so it stays visible</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
