<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeAttributeTransfer" data-page="GeometryNodeAttributeTransfer">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeAttributeTransfer</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Attribute Transfer</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用平滑距离内所有邻居的核加权和对点域场采样。带权核保留距离衰减（不取平均）</p>
  <p class="en">Sample a point-domain field by kernel-weighted sum of all neighbors inside Smooth Distance. Weighted kernels keep distance falloff (not averaged)</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">从其点域场采样的目标几何</span><span class="en">Target geometry whose point-domain field is sampled from</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Value<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">目标几何上的点域场</span><span class="en">Point-domain field on the target geometry</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Sample Position<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">场的采样位置（默认为上下文位置）</span><span class="en">Positions where the field is sampled (defaults to the context Position)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Kernel Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平滑距离内邻居的加权方式。带权核不归一化，较远样本贡献衰减后的值</span><span class="en">How neighbors inside Smooth Distance are weighted. Weighted kernels are not normalized, so farther samples contribute a faded value</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Sum</code>, <code>Mean</code>, <code>Gaussian</code>, <code>Linear</code>, <code>Smooth</code>, <code>Inverse Distance</code>, <code>Inverse Distance Squared</code>, <code>Cubic</code>, <code>Quintic</code>, <code>Wendland C2</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Gaussian</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Smooth Distance<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">核支撑半径。为零时回退到最近邻。越大混合的邻居越多</span><span class="en">Kernel support radius. Zero falls back to nearest neighbor. Larger values blend more neighbors</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Data Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">数据类型</span><span class="en">Data Type</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Float</code>, <code>Integer</code>, <code>Boolean</code>, <code>Vector</code>, <code>Color</code>, <code>Quaternion</code>, <code>4x4 Matrix</code>, <code>String</code>, <code>8-Bit Integer</code>, <code>2D 16-Bit Integer Vector</code>, <code>2D Integer Vector</code>, <code>2D Vector</code>, <code>4D Vector</code>, <code>Byte Color</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>FLOAT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Value<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">采样位置处邻居的核加权和。保留距离衰减</span><span class="en">Kernel-weighted sum of neighbors at the sample position. Distance falloff is kept</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Kernel Type <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Gaussian</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Sum</code>, <code>Mean</code>, <code>Gaussian</code>, <code>Linear</code>, <code>Smooth</code>, <code>Inverse Distance</code>, <code>Inverse Distance Squared</code>, <code>Cubic</code>, <code>Quintic</code>, <code>Wendland C2</code></p>

  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
