</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalSimplifyPolyline3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSimplifyPolyline3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalSimplifyPolyline3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Simplify Polyline 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">丢掉相对原折线偏差不超过最大距离的采样点来简化每条样条。这是最大偏差滤波，不是曲率和重采样。输入/输出：曲线。</p>
  <p class="en">Simplify each spline by dropping samples that stay within Max Distance of the original polyline (CGAL PMP experimental::simplify_polyline, Douglas–Peucker). This is a max-deviation filter, not curvature-sum resampling. Input/output: Curve.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Curve<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要简化的折线。每条样条单独简化。</span><span class="en">Polylines to simplify. Each spline is simplified on its own.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Distance<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">相对原折线的最大偏差（Fréchet / Douglas–Peucker）。不是按曲率重采样。</span><span class="en">Maximum deviation from the original polyline (Fréchet / Douglas–Peucker). Not curvature-based: it does not sample when curvature sums to a length.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.01</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Iterative<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">用迭代删顶点代替 Douglas–Peucker。</span><span class="en">Use iterative vertex removal instead of Douglas–Peucker.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Curve<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">简化后的折线。保留原采样点的子集。</span><span class="en">Simplified polylines. Original sample points are kept (subset).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalConstrainedSimplify" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalConstrainedSimplify">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalConstrainedSimplify</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>QEM Simplify</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">Garland–Heckbert QEM 边塌缩（CGAL Constrained_placement）。保留比例是未约束边留下的分数。保留边界锁定开口边；保留顶点锁定其所有邻边。</p>
  <p class="en">Garland–Heckbert QEM edge-collapse (CGAL Constrained_placement). Keep Ratio is the fraction of unconstrained edges to keep. Keep Boundary locks open rims; Preserve vertices lock every incident edge.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">表面网格。塌缩前会先三角化。</span><span class="en">Surface mesh. Internally triangulated for collapse.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Keep Ratio<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">未约束边要保留的比例。</span><span class="en">Fraction of unconstrained edges to keep.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.5</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Keep Boundary<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">不塌缩边界边（开口边缘保持）。</span><span class="en">Do not collapse border edges (open rims stay).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Preserve<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">必须保留的顶点：其邻接边全部锁定。</span><span class="en">Vertices that must stay: every incident edge is locked.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">QEM 简化后的网格；约束边被保留。</span><span class="en">QEM-simplified mesh; constrained edges are kept.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalCollapseShortEdges" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalCollapseShortEdges">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalCollapseShortEdges</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Collapse Short Edges</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">从最短边开始，把短于最大长度的边塌缩到中点（CGAL 边长代价）。不同于简化（Lindstrom–Turk 体积）和 QEM 简化（二次误差）。</p>
  <p class="en">Collapse edges shorter than Max Length, shortest first, placing the new vertex at the midpoint (CGAL Surface_mesh_simplification Edge_length_cost). Different from Simplify (Lindstrom–Turk volume) and QEM Simplify (quadric error).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">三角或 n 边网格。塌缩前会先三角化。</span><span class="en">Triangle or n-gon mesh. Internally triangulated for collapse.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Length<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">塌缩长度不超过此值的边（从最短开始）。</span><span class="en">Collapse edges whose length is at most this (shortest first).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.01</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">塌缩短于最大长度的边之后的网格。</span><span class="en">Mesh after collapsing every edge shorter than Max Length.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalVsaApproximate" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalVsaApproximate">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalVsaApproximate</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>VSA Approximate</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用平面代理近似三角网格（CGAL 变分形状近似 VSA）。输出简化网格与代理数量。适合 CAD 式平面化。</p>
  <p class="en">Approximate a triangle mesh with planar proxies (CGAL Variational Shape Approximation). Outputs a simplified mesh and proxy count. Useful for CAD-like planarization.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要用平面代理近似的三角网格。</span><span class="en">Triangle mesh to approximate with planar proxies.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Proxies<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平面代理上限（越大越细、越慢）。</span><span class="en">Maximum number of plane proxies (higher = more detail, slower).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>32</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">播种后的划分/拟合迭代次数。</span><span class="en">Partitioning / fitting iterations after seeding.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>30</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Seeding<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">代理播种策略。</span><span class="en">Proxy seeding strategy.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Hierarchical</code>, <code>Incremental</code>, <code>Random</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Hierarchical</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">由 VSA 锚点生成的简化三角网格。</span><span class="en">Simplified triangle mesh from VSA anchors.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Proxies<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">使用的平面代理数量。</span><span class="en">Number of plane proxies used.</span></div></td></tr>
