<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalSmoothShape" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSmoothShape">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalSmoothShape</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Smooth Shape</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">平均曲率流平滑（PMP smooth_shape）。网格会临时单位化使时间参数与尺度无关；开启保持缩放可恢复尺寸。</p>
  <p class="en">Mean-curvature flow smoothing (PMP smooth_shape). Mesh is temporarily unit-normalized so Time is scale-stable; enable Preserve Scale to restore size.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入网格（拓扑保持；顶点移动）。</span><span class="en">Input mesh (topology kept; vertices move).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Time<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">流步长。越大平滑越强（可试 0.01–0.1）。</span><span class="en">Flow step size. Larger = stronger smoothing (try 0.01-0.1).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.05</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">流迭代次数。越多越平滑，体积损失也越多。</span><span class="en">Number of flow steps. More = smoother, more volume loss.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>20</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Preserve Scale<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">开启后在单位盒归一化后恢复网格尺寸。</span><span class="en">If on, restore mesh size after unit-box normalization.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平滑后的网格（拓扑相同）。</span><span class="en">Smoothed mesh (same topology).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalFair" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalFair">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalFair</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Fair</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">离散 k 次调和光顺（Botsch/Kobbelt）。连续性 k 固定原始 k 环，再求解 L^{k+1}x=0。</p>
  <p class="en">Discrete k-harmonic fairing (Botsch/Kobbelt). Continuity k pins the original k-ring, then solves L^{k+1}x=0.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入网格（拓扑不变；仅自由顶点移动）。</span><span class="en">Input mesh (topology unchanged; only free verts move).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Selection<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要光顺的顶点。未选中的保持固定。边界环始终钉住。</span><span class="en">Vertices to fair. Unselected stay fixed. Boundary loops are always pinned.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Continuity<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">0 = 保持边界位置（拉普拉斯）。1 = 同时保持原来的 1 环（切向）。2 = 同时保持原来的 2 环（曲率）。要更高阶请在 N 面板提高上限。</span><span class="en">0 = keep boundary positions (Laplace). 1 = also keep the original 1-ring (tangent). 2 = also keep the original 2-ring (curvature). Raise the N-panel max to allow higher orders.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">光顺后的网格（拓扑相同，自由顶点已平滑）。</span><span class="en">Faired mesh (same topology, smoothed free verts).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalFairHoleFill" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalFairHoleFill">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalFairHoleFill</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Fair Hole Fill</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">填每个边界环再光顺补片。保留原来的 n 边形；只有新洞是三角形。属性从源网格复制；新顶点解余切拉普拉斯（调和）。连续性 0/1/2。</p>
  <p class="en">Fill every boundary loop then fair the patch (CGAL triangulate_refine_and_fair_hole). Original n-gons are kept; only the new hole patches are triangles. Attributes copy from the source mesh; new hole verts solve a cotangent Laplace system (harmonic). Continuity 0/1/2.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">带开放边界洞的网格。</span><span class="en">Mesh with open boundary holes.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Continuity<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">补片光顺阶：0 = C0，1 = C1（默认），2 = C2。</span><span class="en">Fairing order of the patch: 0 = C0, 1 = C1 (default), 2 = C2.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">保留原来的面；只有补上的洞是三角形。属性从源网格继承。</span><span class="en">Original faces kept; only filled holes are triangles. Attributes inherited.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


