<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalSplitLongEdges" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSplitLongEdges">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalSplitLongEdges</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Split Long Edges</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
