<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalSnapBorders" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSnapBorders">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalSnapBorders</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Snap Borders</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">只吸附并缝合不同岛屿的开放边界（CGAL PMP snap_borders，两网格）。怎么用：合并/实现几块唇边几乎相接的零件 → 把容差设成那条缝。顶点不会吸到同一岛屿的另一个顶点（所以孔或单条轮廓不会被压扁）。只有一块连通件会被拒绝——没有另一座岛可缝。</p>
  <p class="en">Snap and stitch open borders of different islands only (CGAL PMP snap_borders, two-mesh). How to use: Join / Realize several separate pieces whose lips almost meet → set Tolerance to that gap. A vertex never snaps onto another vertex of the same island (so a hole or a single outline is not collapsed). One connected piece is rejected — there is no other island to sew to.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">至少两块不相连、开放边界应对齐的岛屿网格。</span><span class="en">Mesh with at least two disconnected islands whose open borders should meet.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Tolerance<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">不同岛屿边界之间的最大距离。</span><span class="en">Maximum distance between two different islands' borders.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.01</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">边界落在容差内的岛屿会被吸附并缝合。</span><span class="en">Islands whose borders were within Tolerance are snapped and stitched together.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalRemoveDegenerate" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalRemoveDegenerate">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalRemoveDegenerate</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Remove Degenerate</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">删除会使 CGAL 算法失败的零面积面与零长度边。</p>
  <p class="en">Delete zero-area faces and zero-length edges that break CGAL algorithms.</p>
