<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalRepairDegeneracies" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalRepairDegeneracies">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalRepairDegeneracies</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Repair Degeneracies</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">清掉零面积、针状（特别瘦）和帽状（有一个几乎摊平的角）三角形。怎么用：接入网格 → 帽角留 160°、针状阈值留 4（CGAL 默认）→ 塌缩长度留 0，除非还想焊更短的边。更稳：帽角 170–179°，针状 8+。更狠：帽角 120–150°，针状 2–3。比「去除退化」更细，那个只删严格零面积面。</p>
  <p class="en">Clean zero-area, needle (very skinny) and cap (one almost-flat corner) triangles. How to use: plug a Mesh → leave Cap Angle at 160° and Needle at 4 (CGAL defaults) → leave Collapse Length at 0 unless you also want to weld shorter edges. Safer: Cap Angle 170–179°, Needle 8+. More aggressive: Cap Angle 120–150°, Needle 2–3. Finer than Remove Degenerate, which only deletes exact zero-area faces.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">可能含零面积面、针状薄片或帽状三角（一个角特别平）的三角网格。布尔、重网格或导入 CAD 之后用。</span><span class="en">Triangle mesh that may contain zero-area faces, needle slivers, or cap triangles (one very flat angle). Use after boolean, remesh, or imported CAD.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Cap Angle<span class="type">FloatAngle</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">一个角至少这么平时就当成帽状三角。默认 160°（CGAL）。往 179° 调只删几乎摊直的角（更稳）。往 90° 调连比较钝的帽也删（更狠）。</span><span class="en">A triangle is a cap if one corner is at least this flat. Default 160° (CGAL). Raise toward 179° to only remove almost-straight corners (safer). Lower toward 90° also removes milder caps (more aggressive).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>2.79253</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Needle Threshold<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最长边/最短边 ≥ 此值就当成针状三角。默认 4。调到 8–16 只删特别瘦的。往 2 调会连中等瘦的也删。</span><span class="en">A face is a needle if longest_edge / shortest_edge ≥ this. Default 4 (CGAL's own default). Raise to 8–16 to only kill very skinny slivers. Lower toward 2 to also remove moderately skinny triangles.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>4.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Collapse Length<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">额外限制：比这个还短的边清理时可以塌缩。0=不加长度限制（推荐）。只有还想焊掉细碎短边时才填一个世界空间长度。</span><span class="en">Optional extra limit: an edge shorter than this may be collapsed while cleaning. 0 = no extra length limit (recommended). Set a small world-space length only if tiny edges should be welded as well.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">同一网格，精确退化已删，针/帽已塌缩或移除。可能时会重投影属性。</span><span class="en">Same mesh with exact degenerates deleted and needles/caps collapsed or removed. Attributes are reprojected when possible.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalRefineIsolevel" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalRefineIsolevel">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalRefineIsolevel</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Refine at Isolevel</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">在顶点标量场跨越等值时剖分边并插入等值线边（CGAL refine_mesh_at_isolevel）。可用 Isoline 边选择/存储。</p>
  <p class="en">Split edges where a vertex scalar field crosses Isovalue and insert contour edges (CGAL refine_mesh_at_isolevel). Use Isoline edges for selection / store.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要细化的三角曲面。</span><span class="en">Triangle surface to refine.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Value<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个顶点的标量（点域）。跨过等值的边会被剖分。</span><span class="en">Scalar at each vertex (Point domain). Edges are split where this crosses Isovalue.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Isovalue<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">等高线/等值。用线性插值在跨越的边上放置新顶点。</span><span class="en">Contour level. Linear interpolation places new vertices on crossed edges.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">在等值线处剖分边并加入等值线边后的网格。</span><span class="en">Mesh with edges split at the isoline and new isoline edges.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Isoline<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">边选择：位于等值轮廓上的边。</span><span class="en">Edge selection: edges lying on the isovalue contour.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalSurfaceDelaunayRemesh" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSurfaceDelaunayRemesh">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalSurfaceDelaunayRemesh</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Surface Delaunay Remesh</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用 CGAL surface_Delaunay_remeshing（Mesh_3 准则）重网格化三角曲面。开销大；输入应无自相交。</p>
  <p class="en">Remesh a triangle surface with CGAL surface_Delaunay_remeshing (Mesh_3 criteria). Heavy; input should be free of self-intersections.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">干净的三角表面（无自相交）。重网格很重。</span><span class="en">Clean triangle surface (no self-intersections). Heavy remesh.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Facet Size<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">曲面德劳内球半径上限（0 = 忽略）。</span><span class="en">Upper bound for surface Delaunay ball radii (0 = ignore).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Facet Angle<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">面片角度下限（度，0 = 忽略）。</span><span class="en">Lower bound for facet angles in degrees (0 = ignore).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>25.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Facet Distance<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">相对输入表面的逼近误差上限（0 = 忽略）。</span><span class="en">Approximation error bound to the input surface (0 = ignore).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Feature Angle<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">开启保护时，锐特征保护用的二面角（度）。</span><span class="en">Dihedral angle (degrees) for sharp feature protection when Protect is on.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>60.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Protect Features<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">重网格时保护锐边 / 边界边。</span><span class="en">Protect sharp / border edges during remeshing.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">德劳内细化得到的重网格三角表面。</span><span class="en">Remeshed triangle surface from Delaunay refinement.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
