<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalConvexDecomposition3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalConvexDecomposition3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalConvexDecomposition3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Convex Decomposition 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用指定数量的凸包近似网格（UE Geometry Script 风格）。快速 PCA/AABB 分割，不是精确 Nef 划分。Mesh 是合并后的凸包；Instances 可单独取出每个凸包。</p>
  <p class="en">Approximate a mesh with a user-specified number of convex hulls (UE Geometry Script style). Fast PCA/AABB splits, not exact Nef partition. Mesh is the joined hulls; Instances exposes each hull separately.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要用一组凸包近似的网格</span><span class="en">Mesh to approximate with a set of convex hulls</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Hull Count<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">凸包个数上限（类似 UE Geometry Script）</span><span class="en">Maximum number of convex hulls (like UE Geometry Script)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>8</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">拼在一起的凸包。面属性 convex_piece 存凸包编号</span><span class="en">Joined convex hulls. Face attribute convex_piece stores the hull id</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Instances<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个凸包一个实例</span><span class="en">One instance per convex hull</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Pieces<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">生成的凸包个数</span><span class="en">Number of convex hulls produced</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
