</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalApproxConvexDecomp" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalApproxConvexDecomp">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalApproxConvexDecomp</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Approximate Convex Decomposition</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用有限个凸体覆盖封闭网格（CGAL 6.2 体素近似凸分解）。面属性 Part。Resolution 是最长包围盒轴上的格数，另外两轴按包围盒比例缩放。与精确 Nef 凸分解 3 不同。</p>
  <p class="en">Cover a closed mesh with a bounded number of convex volumes (CGAL 6.2 voxel ACD). Face attribute Part. Resolution is cells on the longest bbox axis; the other axes follow the bbox. Distinct from Convex Decomposition 3, which is exact Nef.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">封闭三角网格。开口网格应先做 Alpha 包裹。</span><span class="en">Closed triangle mesh. Open meshes should be Alpha-wrapped first.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Count<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">凸部分的最大数量。</span><span class="en">Maximum number of convex parts.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>8</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Resolution<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最长包围盒轴上的格数。另外两轴按包围盒尺寸缩放，细长物体不会被当成正方体。32 可交互；100 更贴合但更慢。</span><span class="en">Cells along the longest bounding-box axis. The other two axes scale with bbox size, so a long thin mesh is not cubed. 32 is interactive; 100 is tighter and slower.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>32</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
