<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">覆盖输入的凸体积岛。面属性 Part。</span><span class="en">Convex volume islands covering the input. Face attribute Part.</span></div></td></tr>
