<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalFillPolyline" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalFillPolyline">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalFillPolyline</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Fill Polyline</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">把每条闭合三维折线三角化成补片。网格线框环、n 边形和闭合曲线都会填，不只第一条。只处理孤立环；光顺补洞是在已有表面上补洞。</p>
  <p class="en">Triangulate every closed 3D polyline into a patch (CGAL triangulate_hole_polyline). Mesh wire loops, n-gons, and cyclic curves are all filled — not just the first loop. Isolated rings only; Fair Hole Fill patches holes in an existing surface.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">闭合折线：网格线框环、n 边形或闭合曲线。每个环都会被填充。</span><span class="en">Closed polylines: mesh wire loops, n-gons, or cyclic curves. Every loop is filled.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">三角补片，每个闭合环一块。</span><span class="en">Triangle patches, one island per closed loop.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalStraightSkeleton2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalStraightSkeleton2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalStraightSkeleton2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Straight Skeleton 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">XY 上的完整内部直骨架：每个岛、保留孔洞，并含连到边界的辐条。可用于面网格、闭合边环或闭合实体（XY 剪影并）。</p>
  <p class="en">Complete interior straight skeleton on XY: every island, holes kept, including spokes to the boundary. Face meshes, closed edge rings, or closed solids (XY silhouette union).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 岛屿：面边界、闭合边环，或闭合网格（XY 剪影）。孔会嵌套保留</span><span class="en">XY islands: face borders, closed edge rings, or a closed mesh (XY silhouette). Holes are nested and kept</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个岛屿完整的内部直骨架（屋脊 + 连到边界的辐条）。含孔。全部岛屿在一个线框网格里</span><span class="en">Complete interior straight skeleton of every island (ridge + spokes to the boundary). Holes included. All islands in one wire mesh</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
