</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalExteriorSkeleton2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalExteriorSkeleton2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalExteriorSkeleton2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Exterior Skeleton 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">XY 多边形的外直骨架（CGAL create_exterior_straight_skeleton_2）。向外推进，与「直骨架 2D」相反。「最大偏移」是离多边形的距离；辅助外框会丢掉。孔请用「直骨架 2D」（内部）。</p>
  <p class="en">Exterior straight skeleton of an XY polygon (CGAL create_exterior_straight_skeleton_2). Outward wavefront, opposite of Straight Skeleton 2D. Max Offset is the distance from the polygon; the helper frame is discarded. Holes use Straight Skeleton 2D (interior).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 多边形。面边界或闭合边环。</span><span class="en">XY polygon. Face borders or closed edge rings.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Offset<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">离多边形的最大距离。角平分线在此半径处裁切（不是辅助外框尺寸）。</span><span class="en">Maximum distance from the polygon. Bisectors are clipped at this radius (not the helper frame size).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">外直骨架线框（外框已丢弃）。</span><span class="en">Exterior straight skeleton as a wire mesh (frame discarded).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
