</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalPolygonOffset2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalPolygonOffset2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalPolygonOffset2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Polygon Offset 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">对有面的边界做骨架偏移；无面的纯边线则向两侧膨胀（闭合边 → 空心框）。</p>
  <p class="en">Offset filled face borders (skeleton), or expand pure edge wires to both sides when the mesh has no faces (cyclic → hollow frame).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">有面：偏移填充边界区域（骨架）。仅边（无面）：闭合线向两侧膨胀成框；开链变成条带。</span><span class="en">Faces: offset filled border regions (skeleton). Edges only (no faces): cyclic wires expand both sides as a frame; open chains become a strip.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Offset<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">有面：有符号（+ 外扩 / − 内缩）。仅边线框：|偏移| = 线两侧各一半宽度。</span><span class="en">Faces: signed (+ expand / − shrink). Edge-only wires: |Offset| = half-width to each side of the line.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">三角化后的偏移区域或线框条带。</span><span class="en">Triangulated offset region or wire strip.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
