<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalPolygonFill2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalPolygonFill2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalPolygonFill2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Polygon Fill 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用约束德劳内把 XY 多边形岛填成三角（孔保持空）。怎么用：接入面边界或闭合边环 → 得到内部三角填充。不会为质量插入 Steiner 点——那要用「细化网格 2D」。</p>
  <p class="en">Fill XY polygon islands with a constrained Delaunay triangulation (holes stay empty). How to use: plug a Mesh of face borders or closed edge rings → get a triangle fill of the interior. Does not insert Steiner points for quality — use Refine Mesh 2D for that.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 上的开放边界岛屿（孔保持空）。</span><span class="en">Open-border islands on XY (holes preserved empty).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">多边形区域的约束德劳内三角填充。</span><span class="en">CDT triangle fill of the polygon region.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
