  <h1>Polygon Repair 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用奇偶规则重建修复自交或非法 XY 边界多边形（CGAL Polygon_repair）。</p>
