<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalRegularizeOpenContour2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalRegularizeOpenContour2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalRegularizeOpenContour2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Regularize Open Contour 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">把开放 XY 折线贴到最长方向及其正交。不同于规整轮廓 2D：这里保持曲线、不填充 n 边形，且可用于开放笔划。</p>
  <p class="en">Snap open XY polylines to their longest direction and its orthogonal (CGAL regularize_open_contour). Unlike Regularize Contour 2D this keeps curves, does not fill n-gons, and works on open strokes.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Curve<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 上的折线。开样条用开轮廓规整器；闭合的会封闭。</span><span class="en">Polylines on XY. Open splines use the open regularizer; cyclic ones close.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Offset<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">贴到最长方向及其正交时，边可横向滑多远。0 = 不做方向贴合（只按最小长度）。</span><span class="en">How far edges may slide sideways when snapping to the longest direction / its orthogonal. 0 = skip direction snap (Min Length only).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.5</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Min Length<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">规整前后用 Douglas–Peucker 去掉短折。0 = 全保留。</span><span class="en">Collapse / Douglas–Peucker short jogs before and after regularization. 0 = keep all.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Curve<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">规整后的折线（仍是曲线，不是填充面）。</span><span class="en">Regularized polylines (still curves, not filled faces).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
