<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalExtrudeSkeleton" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalExtrudeSkeleton">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalExtrudeSkeleton</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Extrude Skeleton</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">把 XY 多边形沿直骨架挤成四坡屋顶实体（CGAL extrude_skeleton）。怎么用：接入二维岛屿网格（可带孔）→ 把「高度」设为屋脊高度 → 得到三维屋顶。相关：「直骨架 2D」是二维脊线图，本节点把它变成体。</p>
  <p class="en">Raise an XY polygon into a hip-roof solid by extruding its straight skeleton (CGAL extrude_skeleton). How to use: plug a 2D island Mesh (holes allowed) → set Height to the ridge height → get a 3D roof. Related: Straight Skeleton 2D is the 2D ridge diagram; this turns it into volume.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 上的开放边界岛屿（可带孔）。</span><span class="en">Open-border islands on XY (with holes).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Height<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最大挤出高度（不能为 0）。</span><span class="en">Maximum extrusion height (non-zero).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
