<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalSsabPartition2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSsabPartition2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalSsabPartition2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>SSAB Partition 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用短边角平分线策略把简单 XY 多边形拆成凸块（CGAL Small_side_angle_bisector_decomposition_2）。怎么用：接入一个网格面 → 得到若干凸 n 边形（面属性 island_id）。与「凸划分 2D」不同，这里从凹顶点沿角平分线切开（和闵可夫斯基和 2D 内部用的策略相同）。</p>
  <p class="en">Decompose a simple XY polygon into convex pieces with the small-side angle-bisector strategy (CGAL Small_side_angle_bisector_decomposition_2). How to use: plug a Mesh face → get several convex n-gons (Face attribute island_id). Unlike Convex Partition 2D this cuts along angle bisectors from reflex vertices (the same strategy Minkowski Sum 2D uses internally).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">简单 XY 多边形。每个面单独分解。</span><span class="en">Simple XY polygon(s). Each face is decomposed on its own.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">凸 n 边形块。面属性 island_id 是块编号。</span><span class="en">Convex n-gon pieces. Face attribute island_id is the piece index.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalYMonotonePartition2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalYMonotonePartition2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalYMonotonePartition2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
