  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">把 XY 多边形剖成 y 单调块。凸剖分 2D 和 SSAB 剖分 2D 产出的是凸块。</p>
  <p class="en">Split an XY polygon into y-monotone pieces (CGAL y_monotone_partition_2). Convex Partition 2D and SSAB Partition 2D produce convex pieces instead.</p>
