<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalPolylineSimplify2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalPolylineSimplify2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalPolylineSimplify2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Shape Simplify 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用平方距离代价简化 XY 多边形。不同于曲线上的简化折线 3D。</p>
  <p class="en">Simplify an XY polygon/shape with squared-distance cost (CGAL Polyline_simplification_2). Distinct from Simplify Polyline 3D on Curves.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 多边形（可含洞）。删顶点但轮廓保持接近。</span><span class="en">XY polygon (or holes). Vertices are removed while the outline stays close.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Cost<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">下一次删顶点会超过此平方距离代价时停止。不能为 0：会被钳到一个很小的 epsilon。</span><span class="en">Stop when the next vertex removal would exceed this squared-distance cost. Never 0: values are clamped to a tiny epsilon.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.01</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">简化后的 n 边形。</span><span class="en">Simplified n-gon(s).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
