<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalRefineMesh2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalRefineMesh2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalRefineMesh2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Refine Mesh 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">XY 多边形的二维德劳内质量细化（CGAL Mesh_2）。与多边形填充 2D 不同，会插入 Steiner 顶点以满足尺寸/形状约束。</p>
  <p class="en">Quality 2D Delaunay refinement of XY polygons (CGAL Mesh_2). Unlike Polygon Fill 2D this inserts Steiner vertices to meet size/shape bounds.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 边界岛屿（孔保持空）。</span><span class="en">XY border islands (holes stay empty).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Edge<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Steiner 边的最大长度。0 = 只控形状（不限尺寸）。</span><span class="en">Maximum Steiner edge length. 0 = shape-only (no size bound).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Shape Bound<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">CGAL B 参数（0.125 ≈ 最小角 20.7°）。越小三角质量越好。</span><span class="en">CGAL B parameter (0.125 ≈ 20.7° minimum angle). Smaller = better triangles.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.125</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">多边形区域的质量三角网格。</span><span class="en">Quality triangle mesh of the polygon domain.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
