</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalConstrainedDelaunay2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalConstrainedDelaunay2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalConstrainedDelaunay2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Constrained Delaunay 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">对输入顶点和边做约束德劳内。线框用填充曲线的环绕数；二维面用重叠面环绕数。三维网格（XY 上正反面）按投影面的并集填充。</p>
  <p class="en">Constrained Delaunay of the input vertices and edges. Wires use Fill Curve winding. 2D faces use overlapping-face winding. A 3D mesh (front and back in XY) is filled by the union of the projected faces.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 多边形 / PSLG。边界成为约束边。</span><span class="en">XY polygon / PSLG. Borders become constraint edges.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Fill Rule<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">按轮廓 / 二维剪影做奇偶或非零环绕填充。</span><span class="en">Even-odd or nonzero winding on the outline / 2D silhouette.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Even-Odd</code>, <code>Non-Zero</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Even-Odd</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">约束德劳内三角。</span><span class="en">Constrained Delaunay triangles.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Fill Rule <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Even-Odd</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Even-Odd</code>, <code>Non-Zero</code></p>

  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
