</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalArrangement2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalArrangement2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalArrangement2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Find All Cells 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">从二维边图找出每个闭合环（CGAL Arrangement_2）。交叉边会插入顶点；每个有界面是与邻居共享顶点的 n 边形。可用于纯线框/边网格。面属性 cell_id。</p>
  <p class="en">From a 2D edge graph, find every closed loop (CGAL Arrangement_2). Crossing edges get a vertex; each bounded cell is an n-gon that shares verts with neighbors. Works with a pure wire / edge mesh. Face attribute cell_id.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">二维边（线框或网格）。面可选；交叉处会拆分。</span><span class="en">2D edges (wire or mesh). Faces are optional; crossings are split.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个有界面环焊成一个 n 边形。面属性 cell_id。</span><span class="en">Every bounded loop as a welded n-gon. Face attribute cell_id.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalVerticalDecomp2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalVerticalDecomp2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalVerticalDecomp2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Vertical Decomposition 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">从每个顶点落下一条竖线，把 XY 线稿切成梯形。怎么用：接入二维边或面 → 得到互不重叠的梯形（面属性 island_id）。比「找出全部格子 2D」多切了竖墙，每个面都是 Y 单调。常用于平面图/二维布尔之后做偏移或扫描填充。</p>
  <p class="en">Split an XY drawing into trapezoids by dropping a vertical line from every vertex. How to use: feed a Mesh of 2D edges or faces → get a mesh of non-overlapping trapezoids (Face attribute island_id). Compared with Find All Cells 2D / Arrangement 2D, this further cuts each cell with vertical walls so every face is y-monotone. Typical use: prepare a floor plan or 2D boolean result for offset / scanline fill.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 线稿（网格面和/或线）。先拆交叉，再从每个顶点沿世界 +Y 向上下各打一条竖线到下一条边。</span><span class="en">XY linework (Mesh faces and/or wires). Crossings are split first, then every vertex sends a vertical (world +Y) ray to the next edge above and below.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">铺满图面的梯形 / 三角。面整数 “island_id” 给每个格子编号。需要 Y 单调划分（偏移、填充或扫描线处理）时用。</span><span class="en">Trapezoids / triangles that tile the drawing. Face integer &quot;island_id&quot; numbers each cell. Use when you need a y-monotone partition (offset, fill, or scanline-style processing).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
