<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalTetRemesh" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalTetRemesh">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalTetRemesh</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Tet Remesh</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">封闭实体的四面体重网格：在内部网格上插入 Steiner 点，保留外接球心在内部的德劳内四面体。目标边长控制间距。</p>
  <p class="en">Tetrahedral remesh of a closed solid: Steiner points on an interior grid, keeping Delaunay tets whose circumcenter is inside. Target Edge controls spacing.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">内部要重网格成四面体的封闭三角实体。</span><span class="en">Closed triangle solid whose interior should be remeshed as tets.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Target Edge<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">目标 Steiner 间距。越小四面体越多。</span><span class="en">Target Steiner spacing. Smaller = more tets.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">按目标边长控制尺寸的内部四面体。</span><span class="en">Interior tetrahedra sized by Target Edge.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
