<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalConstrainedDt3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalConstrainedDt3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalConstrainedDt3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Constraint Delaunay 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">封闭三角网格的内部德劳内四面体，仅用输入顶点（无 Steiner 点）。每个四面体是独立的四三角岛，全尺寸。面属性 Tet。点属性从源复制。不同于会插入内部网格的四面体重网格。</p>
  <p class="en">Interior Delaunay tetrahedra of a closed triangle mesh using only the input vertices (no Steiner points). Each tet is a separate 4-triangle island at full scale. Face attribute Tet. Point attributes copy from the source. Distinct from Tet Remesh which inserts an interior grid.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">封闭三角 PLC。只用已有顶点（不插 Steiner 网格）。</span><span class="en">Closed triangle PLC. Only existing vertices are used (no Steiner grid).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个内部德劳内胞一个四面体（4 个三角，不缩放）。面属性 Tet = 胞 ID。点属性从源复制。</span><span class="en">One tetrahedron per interior Delaunay cell (4 triangles, unscaled). Face attribute Tet = cell id. Point attributes copy from the source.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
