</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalDualContour" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalDualContour">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalDualContour</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Processing</div>
  <h1>Implicit Surface</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">在 Min–Max 笛卡尔网格上从标量 SDF 抽出三角等值面。方法：Dual Contour（Surface Nets）或 Marching Cubes（CGAL TCMC）。与在输入采样点上做行进四面体的等值面 3D 不同。</p>
  <p class="en">Extract a triangle isosurface from a scalar SDF field on a Cartesian grid between Min and Max. Method: Dual Contour (Surface Nets) or Marching Cubes (CGAL TCMC). Distinct from Isosurface 3D (marching tetrahedra on input samples).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Method<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">对偶轮廓（Surface Nets）或移动立方体（TCMC）。</span><span class="en">Dual Contour (Surface Nets) or Marching Cubes (TCMC).</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Dual Contour</code>, <code>Marching Cubes</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Dual Contour</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Min<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">SDF 采样盒的最小角点。</span><span class="en">Minimum corner of the SDF sampling box.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[-1.0, -1.0, -1.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">SDF 采样盒的最大角点。</span><span class="en">Maximum corner of the SDF sampling box.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[1.0, 1.0, 1.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>SDF<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">有符号标量场。可接 Position、纹理、几何邻近距离等。等值面是 SDF 等于等值的地方。</span><span class="en">Signed scalar field. Connect Position, a texture, Geometry Proximity distance, etc. The isosurface is where SDF equals Isovalue.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Isovalue<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">提取水平集 SDF = 等值（0 = 零集）。</span><span class="en">Extract the level set SDF = Isovalue (0 = zero set).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Resolution<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Min–Max 盒子内每轴的网格采样数。</span><span class="en">Grid samples per axis inside Min–Max.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>32</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">SDF = 等值处的三角网格表面。</span><span class="en">Triangle mesh of the SDF = Isovalue surface.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Method <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Dual Contour</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Dual Contour</code>, <code>Marching Cubes</code></p>

  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
