<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalArapDeform" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalArapDeform">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalArapDeform</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Deform</div>
  <h1>ARAP Deform</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">尽可能刚性（ARAP）表面网格变形（CGAL Surface_mesh_deformation）。选择 ROI 与控制顶点，并为控制点设置 Target 位置。方法 0=原始 ARAP，1=Spokes-and-Rims。</p>
  <p class="en">As-Rigid-As-Possible surface mesh deformation (CGAL Surface_mesh_deformation). Select ROI and Control verts; set Target positions on controls (e.g. Set Position field). Method 0=Original ARAP, 1=Spokes-and-Rims.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要变形的表面网格（内部会三角化）。</span><span class="en">Surface mesh to deform (triangulated internally).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>ROI<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">感兴趣区域：可自由移动的顶点（包含控制点）。</span><span class="en">Region of interest: vertices free to move (include handles).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Control<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">驱动变形的控制 / 手柄顶点（用目标位置）。</span><span class="en">Control / handle vertices whose Target positions drive the deform.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Target<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个控制顶点的目标位置（非控制点忽略）。</span><span class="en">Target position for each control vertex (ignored for non-controls).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Method<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">0 = 原始 ARAP，1 = Spokes-and-Rims ARAP（默认）。</span><span class="en">0 = Original ARAP, 1 = Spokes-and-Rims ARAP (default).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">ARAP 局部/全局迭代次数。</span><span class="en">ARAP local/global iterations.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>5</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Tolerance<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">能量收敛容差（0 = 忽略）。</span><span class="en">Energy convergence tolerance (0 = ignore).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0001</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">变形后的网格（拓扑相同，属性保留）。</span><span class="en">Deformed mesh (same topology, attributes preserved).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
