<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalLaplaceDeform" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalLaplaceDeform">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalLaplaceDeform</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Deform</div>
  <h1>Laplace Deform</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">带 ROI 与控制手柄的余切拉普拉斯网格编辑（Eigen 稀疏求解）。先做一次拉普拉斯位置最小二乘，再做一次旋转补偿。不同于光顺 / 形状平滑。</p>
  <p class="en">Cotangent Laplacian mesh editing with ROI and control handles (Eigen sparse solve). One Laplacian position LS, then one rotation-compensation LS. Not the same as Fair / Smooth Shape.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要变形的表面网格（内部会三角化）。</span><span class="en">Surface mesh to deform (triangulated internally).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>ROI<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">感兴趣区域：可自由移动的顶点（包含控制点）。</span><span class="en">Region of interest: vertices free to move (include handles).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Control<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">驱动变形的控制 / 手柄顶点（用目标位置）。</span><span class="en">Control / handle vertices whose Target positions drive the deform.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Target<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个控制顶点的目标位置（非控制点忽略）。</span><span class="en">Target position for each control vertex (ignored for non-controls).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Weight<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">固定 / 控制顶点的软钉权重（越大钉得越死）。</span><span class="en">Soft pin weight for fixed / control vertices (higher = harder pins).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1e+06</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">变形后的网格（拓扑相同，属性保留）。</span><span class="en">Deformed mesh (same topology, attributes preserved).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
