<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalCageDeform3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalCageDeform3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalCageDeform3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Deform</div>
  <h1>Cage Deform 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">笼子变形：在静止笼子上算反距离权重，作用到（姿态−静止）顶点位移。两个相同笼子时内部不变。静止/姿态必须同顶点数且编号一致（复制立方体再移动姿态笼子）。</p>
  <p class="en">Cage-deform an interior mesh: inverse-distance weights on the rest cage, applied to (pose − rest) vertex deltas so two identical cages leave the interior unchanged. Rest and Pose must have the same vertex count and index order (duplicate a cube, then move Pose).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
