<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">嵌入相交接缝后的网格 1。</span><span class="en">Mesh 1 after embedding intersection seams.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Seam Edges<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">布尔边场：位于相交接缝上（或由此创建）的边为真。</span><span class="en">Boolean Edge field: true on edges created/lying on the intersection seams.</span></div></td></tr>
