<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalMinkowskiSum3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMinkowskiSum3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalMinkowskiSum3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Boolean</div>
  <h1>Convex Minkowski Sum 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">两网格的凸闵可夫斯基和：conv(A) ⊕ conv(B) = conv({a+b})。非凸输入会先换成凸包（不是精确 Nef 闵可夫斯基和）。</p>
  <p class="en">Convex Minkowski sum of two meshes: conv(A) ⊕ conv(B) = conv({a+b}). Non-convex inputs are replaced by their convex hulls first (not exact Nef Minkowski).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh A<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">第一操作数（会自动取凸包）。</span><span class="en">First operand (convex hull is taken automatically).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Mesh B<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">第二操作数（会自动取凸包）。</span><span class="en">Second operand (convex hull is taken automatically).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">顶点两两相加后的凸包。</span><span class="en">Convex hull of pairwise vertex sums.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
