<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalDoIntersect3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalDoIntersect3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalDoIntersect3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Boolean</div>
  <h1>Do Intersect 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">检测两个三角网格是否相交（CGAL PMP::do_intersect）。不同于「是否自相交」（单网格）和「网格相交」（交线）。</p>
  <p class="en">Test whether two triangle meshes intersect (CGAL PMP::do_intersect). Different from Does Self Intersect (one mesh) and Mesh Intersection (curves).</p>
