<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalBooleanOps2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalBooleanOps2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalBooleanOps2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Boolean</div>
  <h1>Boolean Ops 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">对拍平到 XY 的面做二维布尔。填充规则是非零环绕数：同向重叠仍算内部，所以差集能把重叠部分也挖掉；反向重叠会抵消。差集用法：网格 A=底板（例如包围矩形），网格 B=刀具（散布的格子/岛屿）。输出是挖掉 B 后的剩余，孔是空的。网格 B 留空则得到 A 的剪影。B 若是实例请先实现实例或合并。</p>
  <p class="en">2D boolean of flattened XY shapes (faces with XY area). Fill rule is non-zero winding: overlapping same-orientation faces stay inside, so Difference punches those overlaps; opposite-orientation overlaps cancel. How to use Difference: Mesh A = the stock (e.g. a bounding rectangle), Mesh B = the cutters (scattered grids / islands). The output is the leftover region with B actually punched out — holes stay empty. Leave Mesh B empty to get the silhouette of A. Join or Realize Instances on B first if the cutters are instances.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh A<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">第一个二维形状（拍平网格：有 XY 面积的面之并）。</span><span class="en">First 2D shape (flattened mesh: union of faces with XY area).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Mesh B<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">第二个二维形状（可选）。留空则只要 A 的剪影轮廓。</span><span class="en">Second 2D shape (optional). Empty = silhouette outline of A only.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Operation<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">对 A、B 的全部岛屿做并 / 交 / 差 / 异或。</span><span class="en">Union / Intersect / Difference / XOR over all islands of A and B.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Union</code>, <code>Intersect</code>, <code>Difference</code>, <code>Symmetric Difference</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Union</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">填充后的二维布尔区域。孔是空的（挖掉），不是再盖一层面。</span><span class="en">Filled 2D boolean region. Holes are empty (cut out), not extra covering faces.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Operation <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Union</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Union</code>, <code>Intersect</code>, <code>Difference</code>, <code>Symmetric Difference</code></p>

  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalDoIntersect2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalDoIntersect2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalDoIntersect2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Boolean</div>
  <h1>Do Intersect 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">两个 XY 多边形是否重叠：边相交，或一个包含另一个。怎么用：接入两个二维网格 → 读「相交」。这是是否判断，不是布尔实体（实体请用「布尔运算 2D」）。</p>
  <p class="en">True if two XY polygons overlap — either their edges cross, or one contains the other. How to use: plug two 2D Meshes → read Intersect. This is a yes/no test, not a boolean volume (use Boolean Ops 2D for that).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh A<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">第一个 XY 形状（面边界或闭合边环）。</span><span class="en">First XY shape (face borders or closed edge rings).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Mesh B<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">用来和 A 检测的第二个 XY 形状。</span><span class="en">Second XY shape to test against A.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Intersect<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">任意 XY 边界多边形相交则为真。</span><span class="en">True if any XY border polygons intersect.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
