</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalMinkowskiSum2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMinkowskiSum2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalMinkowskiSum2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Boolean</div>
  <h1>Minkowski Sum 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">两个 XY 多边形的二维闵可夫斯基和 A ⊕ B（CGAL 约化卷积）：把 B 放到 A 的每一点上扫过的区域。怎么用：网格 A=零件，网格 B=圆盘/方块 → 得到偏移/膨胀轮廓（可能有孔）。不同于「多边形偏移 2D」（单个形状的骨架偏移）和「凸闵可夫斯基和 3D」（三维凸包）。</p>
  <p class="en">2D Minkowski sum A ⊕ B of two XY polygons (CGAL reduced convolution): the region swept by placing a copy of B at every point of A. How to use: Mesh A = the part, Mesh B = a disk / square → get the offset / grown outline (holes possible). Different from Polygon Offset 2D (skeleton offset of one shape) and Convex Minkowski Sum 3D (3D convex hulls).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh A<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">第一个 XY 多边形（面边界）。这是被膨胀的形状。</span><span class="en">First XY polygon (face borders). This is the shape being grown.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Mesh B<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">第二个 XY 多边形，作为结构元素（例如圆盘）。</span><span class="en">Second XY polygon used as the structuring element (e.g. a disk).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">三角化后的闵可夫斯基和（可能有孔）。</span><span class="en">Triangulated Minkowski sum (may have holes).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


