  <h1>Principal Curvature</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">场节点：上下文网格上的主曲率 k_min/k_max 及其切向方向。</p>
  <p class="en">Field node: principal curvatures k_min/k_max and their tangent directions on the context mesh.</p>
