<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalRegionGrowing" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalRegionGrowing">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalRegionGrowing</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Region Growing</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">生长平面面区域。写入面整数 “Region”（0,1,2…；-1 未分配）。拓扑不变——仅标签。可在面域用命名属性上色。</p>
  <p class="en">Grow planar face regions. Writes Face int &quot;Region&quot; (0,1,2...; -1 unassigned). Topology unchanged — label only. Color by Named Attribute on Face domain.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要分割为平面片的表面网格。</span><span class="en">Surface mesh to segment into planar patches.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Distance<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">生长时点到平面的最大距离（场景单位）。越大越容忍噪声/弯曲。</span><span class="en">Max point-to-plane distance when growing (scene units). Larger tolerates more noise/bend.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.01</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Angle<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">面法线与区域平面的最大夹角（度）。越小平面越严格（CAD 可试 10–20）；越大合并越多。</span><span class="en">Max degrees between face normal and region plane. Smaller = stricter planes (e.g. 10-20 for CAD); larger merges more.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>25.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Min Region Size<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">丢弃面数少于此值的区域（过滤碎块）。</span><span class="en">Drop regions with fewer faces than this (filters scraps).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">相同网格，带面整数 “Region”（平面片 ID）。</span><span class="en">Same mesh with Face int &quot;Region&quot; (planar patch id).</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Region Count<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">找到的平面区域数量。</span><span class="en">Number of planar regions found.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
