</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalSurfaceShortestPath" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSurfaceShortestPath">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalSurfaceShortestPath</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Surface Shortest Path</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">源点与目标点之间的测地（曲面）最短路径，吸附到网格。输出为沿表面的线框/路径网格。</p>
  <p class="en">Geodesic (surface) shortest path between Source and Target, snapped to the mesh. Output is a wire/path mesh along the surface.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">路径所在的表面。</span><span class="en">Surface to travel on.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Source<span class="type">VectorTranslation</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">起点位置（吸附到最近表面位置）。</span><span class="en">Start position (snapped to nearest surface location).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Target<span class="type">VectorTranslation</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">终点位置（吸附到最近表面位置）。</span><span class="en">End position (snapped to nearest surface location).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[1.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Path<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">测地最短路径的线框网格。</span><span class="en">Wire mesh of the geodesic shortest path.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
