</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalExactGeodesic" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalExactGeodesic">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalExactGeodesic</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Exact Geodesic Distance</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">网格表面上的精确多源测地距离（CGAL Surface_mesh_shortest_path）。场节点：标记源顶点 → 每点距离。不可达为 -1。不同于热方法测地（近似）。</p>
  <p class="en">Exact multi-source geodesic distance on the mesh surface (CGAL Surface_mesh_shortest_path). Field node: mark Source verts → Distance per point. Unreachable = -1. Different from Heat Geodesic (approximate).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Source<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">源顶点（点域）。源点处距离为 0。</span><span class="en">Source vertices (Point domain). Distance is 0 at sources.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Distance<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">沿表面到最近源点的精确测地距离。不可达分量为 -1。</span><span class="en">Exact geodesic distance along the surface to the nearest source. Unreachable components get -1.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalGeodesicVoronoi" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalGeodesicVoronoi">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalGeodesicVoronoi</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Geodesic Voronoi</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">按测地距离最近源点划分三角网格。面在测地等距中垂线上切开，不是沿原三角剖分。面属性 cell_id 是源顶点序号。</p>
  <p class="en">Partition a triangle mesh by nearest source along geodesic distance (CGAL Surface_mesh_shortest_path MMP). Faces are cut on the geodesic-equidistant bisector, not along the input triangulation. Face attribute cell_id is the source vertex index.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">三角表面。</span><span class="en">Triangle surface.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Source<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">源顶点（点域）。每个源长出一个测地格子。</span><span class="en">Source vertices (Point domain). Each source seeds one geodesic cell.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">沿测地等距 Voronoi 中垂线切开的面。面属性 cell_id。</span><span class="en">Faces split along the geodesic-equidistant Voronoi bisector. Face attribute cell_id.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
