</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalSkeletonSpokes" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSkeletonSpokes">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalSkeletonSpokes</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Skeleton Spokes</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">平均曲率流骨架，加上从每个节点连到收缩进它的表面顶点的辐条。骨架节点只是中心线。</p>
  <p class="en">Mean-curvature-flow skeleton plus a spoke from each node to the surface vertices that contracted into it (CGAL extract_mean_curvature_flow_skeleton correspondence). Skeleton is only the centerline.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">封闭三角网格。</span><span class="en">Closed triangle mesh.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">线框：骨架中心线，外加连到每个收缩表面顶点的辐条。</span><span class="en">Wire: skeleton centerline plus a spoke to each contracted surface vertex.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
