<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalSelfIntersectionCurves" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSelfIntersectionCurves">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalSelfIntersectionCurves</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Self Intersection Curves</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">输出一张三角网格的自相交折线（CGAL PMP::self_intersections + 三角形求交）。不同于「标记自相交」（选择集），也不同于「网格相交」（两张网格）。</p>
  <p class="en">Emit the self-intersection polylines of one triangle mesh (CGAL PMP::self_intersections + triangle-triangle intersection). Unlike Mark Self Intersect this outputs Curves, and unlike Mesh Intersection it uses a single mesh.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">可能自交的三角表面。</span><span class="en">Triangle surface that may cross itself.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Curves<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">自相交折线，输出为多边形曲线。</span><span class="en">Self-intersection polylines as poly curves.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalMeshSlicer" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMeshSlicer">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalMeshSlicer</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Mesh Slicer</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用无限平面切开三角网格，把切口输出为曲线（CGAL Polygon_mesh_slicer）。怎么用：接入网格 → 「原点」放在平面上，「法线」为朝向 → 得到折线。这是等高线，不是实体布尔（切体积请用网格布尔 / 裁剪）。</p>
  <p class="en">Slice a triangle mesh with an infinite plane and output the cut as Curves (CGAL Polygon_mesh_slicer). How to use: plug a Mesh → set Origin on the plane and Normal as the facing → get polylines. This is a contour, not a solid boolean (use Mesh Boolean / Clip to cut volume).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要切片的三角网格。</span><span class="en">Triangle mesh to slice.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Origin<span class="type">VectorTranslation</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">切片平面上的一点。</span><span class="en">A point on the slicing plane.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Normal<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平面朝向（默认 +Z 为水平切片）。</span><span class="en">Plane facing (default +Z is a horizontal slice).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 1.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
