<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalContourStack" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalContourStack">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalContourStack</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Contour Stack</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用一叠平行平面切三角网格（CGAL Polygon_mesh_slicer）。网格切片是单平面。间距 0 会沿方向在网格上均分 Count 刀。</p>
  <p class="en">Slice a triangle mesh with a stack of parallel planes (CGAL Polygon_mesh_slicer). Mesh Slicer is a single plane. Spacing 0 fits Count slices across the mesh along Direction.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要切等高线的三角网格。</span><span class="en">Triangle mesh to contour.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Origin<span class="type">VectorTranslation</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">参考点。间距为 0 时只作为方向原点。</span><span class="en">Reference point. With Spacing=0 this is only the direction origin.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Direction<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平面法线 / 堆叠轴（默认 +Z）。</span><span class="en">Plane normal / stack axis (default +Z).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 1.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Count<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平行切片平面的数量。</span><span class="en">Number of parallel slicing planes.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>8</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Spacing<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平面间距。0 = 在网格包围盒上均分 Count 张内部切片。</span><span class="en">Distance between planes. 0 = fit Count interior slices across the mesh bbox.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Curves<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">堆叠中每个平面切出的折线。</span><span class="en">Slice polylines from every plane in the stack.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
