</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalGeodesicIsolines" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalGeodesicIsolines">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalGeodesicIsolines</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Geodesic Isolines</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">在三角网格上绘制多源测地距离等值线（CGAL MMP）。精确测地是顶点场；在等值面细化会切开网格；测地 Voronoi 划分格子。</p>
  <p class="en">Draw isolines of multi-source geodesic distance on a triangle mesh (CGAL Surface_mesh_shortest_path MMP). Exact Geodesic is a vertex field; Refine at Isolevel splits the mesh; Geodesic Voronoi partitions cells.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">三角表面。</span><span class="en">Triangle surface.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Source<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">源顶点（点域）。源点处距离为 0。</span><span class="en">Source vertices (Point domain). Distance is 0 at sources.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Count<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">从源点到最远可达顶点之间的等值线数量。</span><span class="en">Number of isolines between the sources and the farthest reachable vertex.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>8</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Distance<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">若 &gt; 0，最外圈等值线钳到此测地长度。0 = 自动。</span><span class="en">If &gt; 0, clamp the outermost isoline to this geodesic length. 0 = auto.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Curves<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">测地等值线，折线曲线。</span><span class="en">Geodesic isolines as poly curves.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalInscribedSphere3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalInscribedSphere3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalInscribedSphere3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Inscribed Sphere 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">输入点凸包内的最大球（切比雪夫中心）。点云或网格顶点。是最大内切圆 2D 的三维版。共面或几乎扁平的点集没有内部，会失败。</p>
  <p class="en">Largest sphere inside the convex hull of the input points (Chebyshev center). Takes a point cloud or mesh vertices. The 3D analog of Largest Inscribed Circle 2D. Coplanar or nearly flat point sets have no interior and fail.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要内切其凸包的站点。点云或网格顶点。</span><span class="en">Sites whose convex hull is inscribed. Point cloud or mesh vertices.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Segments<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">UV 球面细分。</span><span class="en">UV sphere tessellation.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>24</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">凸包内最大球的 UV 球面。</span><span class="en">UV sphere of the largest ball inside the convex hull.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Center<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">凸包的切比雪夫中心。</span><span class="en">Chebyshev center of the convex hull.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">凸包的内半径。</span><span class="en">Inradius of the convex hull.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalGraphcutSegment" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalGraphcutSegment">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalGraphcutSegment</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Graphcut Segment</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">按特征分块：邻面二面角小于 Angle 则合并，平面区域连在一起，切口落在锐边上。不是沿世界坐标轴切开。写入面属性 Segment。用命名属性上色。与在点上拟合图元的区域生长不同。</p>
  <p class="en">Split a mesh into feature patches: region-grow faces while the dihedral angle is below Angle, so planar areas stay together and cuts fall on sharp edges. Not a world-axis split. Writes face attribute Segment. Color by Named Attribute. Distinct from Region Growing (which fits primitives on points).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要分割为特征补丁的网格（在锐边切开的平面块）。</span><span class="en">Mesh to split into feature patches (planar chunks cut at sharp edges).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Angle<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">特征角（度）。邻面法线夹角小于此值则同属一块。30 会把立方体切成 6 面；越大合并越多。</span><span class="en">Feature angle in degrees. Adjacent faces whose normals differ by less than this stay in the same patch. 30 splits a cube into 6 faces; larger values merge more.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>30.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Min Size<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">把面数较少的补丁合并到邻居。1 = 保留每个补丁。</span><span class="en">Merge patches with fewer faces into a neighbor. 1 = keep every patch.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">相同网格，带面整数属性 Segment（每个特征补丁一个 ID）。</span><span class="en">Same mesh with face integer attribute Segment (one id per feature patch).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


