<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalVisibility2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalVisibility2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalVisibility2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Visibility 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">XY 墙之间一个查询点的可见多边形（一块连通 n 边形）。填充面：只有外框是实心，孔仍是自由空间。散边是薄墙。查询点必须在墙的包围盒内。</p>
  <p class="en">Visibility polygon from a query among XY walls (one connected n-gon). Filled faces: only the border is solid, so holes stay free space. Loose edges are thin walls. Query must be inside the walls bounding box.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Walls<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 墙。填充面：只有边界是实体障碍（房间或厚墙）。松散边：薄墙。用合并几何把房间和额外墙边混在一起。</span><span class="en">XY walls. Filled faces: only the border is a solid obstacle (room or thick wall). Loose edges: thin walls. Join Geometry to mix rooms and extra wall edges.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Query<span class="type">VectorTranslation</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">视点（XY）。必须在墙的包围盒内、自由空间中（不能在实心墙里）。</span><span class="en">Viewpoint (XY). Must lie inside the walls bounding box, in free space (not inside a solid wall).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">从查询点看出去的可见多边形，一个连通 n 边形。</span><span class="en">Visibility polygon from Query as one connected n-gon.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
