<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalLargestInscribedCircle2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalLargestInscribedCircle2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalLargestInscribedCircle2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Largest Inscribed Circle 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">能放进 XY 多边形并与边界相切的最大圆（线段 Voronoi / 中轴顶点）。孔洞视为障碍。用二维填充或边界多边形；闭合三维网格取其 XY 剪影。</p>
  <p class="en">Largest circle that fits inside the XY polygon and is tangent to the boundary (segment Voronoi / medial-axis vertex). Holes are obstacles. Use a 2D filled or border polygon; closed 3D meshes use the XY silhouette.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 多边形（开放边界或填充）。闭合三维网格用 XY 剪影。</span><span class="en">XY polygon (open border or filled). Closed 3D meshes use the XY silhouette.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Segments<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">预览圆盘用多少条边近似。</span><span class="en">How many sides approximate the preview disk.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>48</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">与 XY 边界相切的圆盘（最大内接圆）。</span><span class="en">Disk tangent to the XY boundary (largest inscribed circle).</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Center<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">能放进多边形的最大圆圆心。</span><span class="en">Center of the largest circle that fits inside the polygon.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">该内接圆半径。</span><span class="en">Radius of that inscribed circle.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalMedialAxis2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMedialAxis2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalMedialAxis2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/Analyze</div>
  <h1>Medial Axis 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">XY 多边形的二维中轴（MAT）：边界离散 Voronoi（抛物线段近似为折线）。不同于直骨架 2D（角平分线）。不是三维 MAT——实体请用骨架（MCF）。</p>
  <p class="en">2D medial axis (MAT) of an XY polygon: discrete Voronoi of the boundary (parabolic branches approximated as polylines). Different from Straight Skeleton 2D (angle bisectors). Not a 3D MAT — for solids use Skeleton (MCF).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">填充的 XY 区域：面边界或闭合边环。开放折线会跳过（中轴需要有填充域）。</span><span class="en">Filled XY region: face borders or closed edge rings. Open polylines are skipped (MAT needs a filled domain).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">内部中轴，以线框边输出（边界采样的 Voronoi；弯曲/分段线性枝，不是直骨架）。</span><span class="en">Interior medial axis as wire edges (Voronoi of boundary samples; curved/piecewise-linear branches — not straight skeleton).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalLscmUV" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalLscmUV">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalLscmUV</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/UV</div>
  <h1>LSCM UV</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">最小二乘共形映射 UV（CGAL LSCM）。在上下文网格上评估 → 角点 UV。每个连通分量展开为独立岛（开启归一化则打包）。闭合壳体需要接缝边。用存储命名属性（角点矢量/Float2）保存。</p>
  <p class="en">Least Squares Conformal Map UV (CGAL LSCM). Field on context mesh → Corner UV. Each connected component is unwrapped as its own island (then packed if Normalize). Closed shells need Seam edges. Store with Store Named Attribute (Corner Vector/Float2).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Selection<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要参数化的面（面域）。</span><span class="en">Faces to parameterize (Face domain).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Seam<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">展开时切开的边（边域）。闭合网格需要接缝以形成边界。</span><span class="en">Edges where the mesh is cut for unwrapping (Edge domain). Required on closed meshes to create a boundary.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Normalize<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">将打包后的 UV 图集缩放到约 [0,1]²。岛的相对大小仍与三维表面积成比例（均匀纹素密度）。</span><span class="en">Fit packed UV atlas into approximately [0,1]^2. Island sizes stay proportional to 3D surface area (uniform texel density).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>UV<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个面角的 UV (x,y)，z 为 0。可存为角点 UVMap。</span><span class="en">UV coordinates (x,y) per face corner; z is 0. Store as Corner UVMap.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalArapUV" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalArapUV">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalArapUV</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/UV</div>
  <h1>ARAP UV</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">尽可能刚性 UV 参数化（CGAL ARAP_parameterizer_3）。场节点：接缝 + 选择 + 归一化。输出角点 UV。</p>
  <p class="en">As-Rigid-As-Possible UV parameterization (CGAL ARAP_parameterizer_3). Field node: Seam + Selection + Normalize. Output Corner UV for UVMap.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Selection<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要参数化的面（面域）。</span><span class="en">Faces to parameterize (Face domain).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Seam<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">用于展开的接缝边。</span><span class="en">Edge seams that cut the mesh for unwrapping.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Lambda<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">ARAP 能量权重：越大越刚硬（更保形）。</span><span class="en">ARAP energy weight: larger = more rigid (shape-preserving).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1000.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">能量最小化最大迭代次数。</span><span class="en">Max energy minimization iterations.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>50</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Normalize<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">将打包后的 UV 图集缩放到约 [0,1]²。岛的相对大小仍与三维表面积成比例（均匀纹素密度）。</span><span class="en">Fit packed UV atlas into approximately [0,1]^2. Island sizes stay proportional to 3D surface area (uniform texel density).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>UV<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">角点 UV (x,y)，z=0。可存为角点 UVMap。</span><span class="en">Corner UV (x,y), z=0. Store as Corner UVMap.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalUVDistortion" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalUVDistortion">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalUVDistortion</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Mesh/UV</div>
  <h1>UV Distortion</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">按角点 UV 与三维几何测量每面参数化扭曲。面积拉伸≈1 表示保面积；共形拉伸≈1 表示保角。与 CGAL measure_distortion（L2 拉伸族）相关。</p>
  <p class="en">Measure parameterization distortion per face from Corner UV vs 3D geometry. Area Stretch ≈ 1 means area-preserving; Conformal Stretch ≈ 1 means angle-preserving. Related to CGAL measure_distortion (L2 stretch family).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>UV<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">角点 UV (x,y)。可接 LSCM/ARAP 等 UV 或命名属性。</span><span class="en">Corner UV (x,y). Connect from LSCM/ARAP/… UV or Named Attribute.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Selection<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要测量的面（面域）。</span><span class="en">Faces to measure (Face domain).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Area Stretch<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每面面积尺度 σ_a=√(A_uv/A_3d)。1=保面积；&gt;1 在 UV 中放大；&lt;1 压缩。</span><span class="en">Per-face area scale sigma_a = sqrt(A_uv / A_3d). 1 = area-preserving; &gt;1 expands in UV; &lt;1 compresses.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Conformal Stretch<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每面共形拉伸（3D→UV 映射奇异值 max/min）。1=保角；越大剪切/各向异性越强。</span><span class="en">Per-face conformal stretch (max/min singular value of the 3D→UV map). 1 = angle-preserving; larger = more shear/stretch anisotropy.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalAlphaShape" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalAlphaShape">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalAlphaShape</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Reconstruction</div>
  <h1>Alpha Shape</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">由点集构建三维 Alpha 形状表面（德劳内过滤）。Alpha 越小保留越密区域；开启最优 Alpha 会自动选择实体分量阈值。</p>
  <p class="en">Build a 3D alpha-shape surface from points (Delaunay filtration). Smaller Alpha keeps denser parts; Optimal Alpha auto-picks a solid component threshold.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">用于生成 Alpha 形状的输入点。</span><span class="en">Input points to wrap with an alpha shape.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Optimal Alpha<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">开启后忽略手动 Alpha，自动选取使实体分量数达标的值。</span><span class="en">If on, ignore manual Alpha and pick a value that yields Solid Components solid pieces.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Solid Components<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">开启最优 Alpha 时：目标实体分量数（通常为 1）。</span><span class="en">When Optimal Alpha is on: target number of solid components (usually 1).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Alpha<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">手动 Alpha 半径（场景单位）。越小越贴合细节，越大越整体圆滑。</span><span class="en">Manual alpha radius (scene units). Smaller = tighter / more detail; larger = smoother bulk.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Alpha 形状表面的三角网格。</span><span class="en">Triangle mesh of the alpha-shape surface.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Alpha Used<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">实际使用的 Alpha 值（手动或自动选择）。</span><span class="en">Actual alpha value used (manual or auto-chosen).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalAlphaWrap" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalAlphaWrap">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalAlphaWrap</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Reconstruction</div>
  <h1>Alpha Wrap</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用防水的 Alpha 包裹包络几何（CGAL alpha_wrap_3）。适合填洞并得到稳固外壳。</p>
  <p class="en">Offset/wrap geometry with a watertight alpha-wrap envelope (CGAL alpha_wrap_3). Useful to close holes and get a robust outer shell.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要包裹的网格或点。</span><span class="en">Mesh or points to wrap.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Alpha<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">特征尺寸 / 包裹分辨率（场景单位）。越小越贴细节，但更慢。</span><span class="en">Feature size / wrap resolution (scene units). Smaller tracks detail more closely but is slower.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Offset<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">包裹后的额外外扩偏移（场景单位）。0 为紧贴包裹。</span><span class="en">Extra outward offset after wrap (scene units). 0 = tight wrap.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">包裹输入后的防水网格。</span><span class="en">Watertight wrap mesh around the input.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
