<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalAdvancingFront" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalAdvancingFront">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalAdvancingFront</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Reconstruction</div>
  <h1>Advancing Front</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">从点云通过推进前沿生长三角网格表面（CGAL advancing_front_surface_reconstruction）。适合开放表面；半径比 / Beta 控制三角形形状与前沿推进。</p>
  <p class="en">From a point cloud, grow a triangle surface by advancing a front (CGAL advancing_front_surface_reconstruction). Good for open surfaces; Radius Ratio / Beta control triangle shape and front advance.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入点云（或网格顶点）。不需要法线。</span><span class="en">Input point cloud (or mesh verts). No normals required.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Radius Ratio<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">候选三角形的外接圆半径与最短边之比的上限。越大允许越扁的三角形（默认约 5）。</span><span class="en">Max circumradius / shortest edge of candidate triangles. Larger allows flatter/skinnier triangles (default ~5).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>5.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Beta<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">前沿推进参数；越大生长越激进（常用 0.5–1.5）。</span><span class="en">Front advance parameter; higher is more aggressive growth (typical 0.5-1.5).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.52</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">重建得到的三角表面网格。</span><span class="en">Reconstructed triangle surface mesh.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalPoisson" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalPoisson">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalPoisson</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Reconstruction</div>
  <h1>Poisson Reconstruct</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">由带方向点做泊松曲面重建。若有 &quot;normal&quot; 属性则使用，否则先估计。</p>
  <p class="en">Poisson surface reconstruction from oriented points. Uses attribute &quot;normal&quot; when present, else estimates.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">定向点云（建议带 “normal” 属性）。</span><span class="en">Oriented point cloud (&quot;normal&quot; attribute recommended).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Spacing<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">八叉树目标采样间距（0 = 自动）。越小细节越多、越重。</span><span class="en">Target sample spacing for the octree (0 = auto). Smaller = more detail / heavier.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Neighbors<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">缺少法线时：用于估计法线的 k。</span><span class="en">If normals missing: k used to estimate them.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>18</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">泊松重建的三角表面。</span><span class="en">Poisson-reconstructed triangle surface.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
