<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalScaleSpace" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalScaleSpace">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalScaleSpace</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Reconstruction</div>
  <h1>Scale Space Reconstruct</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">面向噪声无序点云的尺度空间重建：加权 PCA 多尺度平滑后，用 Alpha 形状在平滑坐标上建连接，再把三角形索引映回原始采样点（插值表面）。与单独的 Alpha 形状/推进前沿管线不同。</p>
  <p class="en">Scale-space reconstruction for noisy unorganized points: Weighted-PCA multi-scale smoothing, then Alpha-shape connectivity mapped back onto the original samples (interpolating surface). Different pipeline from standalone Alpha Shape / Advancing Front.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">无定向点云。</span><span class="en">Unoriented point cloud.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">成面之前的平滑迭代。越多越平滑、噪声越少，细节损失越多。</span><span class="en">Smoothing iterations before meshing. More = smoother / less noise, more detail loss.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>4</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">尺度空间重建的表面。</span><span class="en">Scale-space reconstructed surface.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalSkinSurface" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSkinSurface">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalSkinSurface</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Reconstruction</div>
  <h1>Skin Surface</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">以输入点为球心做球的蒙皮并（收缩并）重建光滑曲面（CGAL Skin_surface_3）。半径场控制球大小。点宜稀疏；过密会极慢。</p>
  <p class="en">Reconstruct a smooth surface as the skin (shrunk union) of balls centered on the input points (CGAL Skin_surface_3). Radius field controls ball size.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">球心（点云或网格顶点）。宜稀疏，过密会极慢。</span><span class="en">Ball centers (point cloud or mesh verts).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Radius<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每点球半径（点域）。未连接时为常数。</span><span class="en">Ball radius per point (Point domain). Constant if unconnected.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Shrink<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">蒙皮收缩因子（0–1）。越小越像糊成一团；越接近 1 越贴球。</span><span class="en">Skin shrink factor (0–1). Smaller = more blob-like union; closer to 1 = tighter to balls.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.5</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Subdivisions<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">蒙皮细分次数（更光滑更密，明显变慢）。默认 0。</span><span class="en">Skin surface subdivision passes (smoother, denser mesh).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Points<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最多使用的球/点数。超出则均匀抽稀（蒙皮复杂度高，密点会卡死）。</span><span class="en">Maximum input balls. Excess points are subsampled (skin is O(n²+) and freezes on dense meshes).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>128</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">蒙皮曲面网格（球的光滑并）。</span><span class="en">Skin surface mesh (smooth union of balls).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalUnionOfBalls" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalUnionOfBalls">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalUnionOfBalls</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Reconstruction</div>
  <h1>Union of Balls</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">生成球并的外表面网格（CGAL make_union_of_balls_mesh_3）。无收缩（与蒙皮曲面不同）。点宜稀疏；过密会抽稀。</p>
  <p class="en">Mesh the outer surface of the union of balls (CGAL make_union_of_balls_mesh_3). No shrink (unlike Skin Surface). Use sparse points; dense sets are subsampled.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">球心（点云或网格顶点）。保持稀疏。</span><span class="en">Ball centers (point cloud or mesh verts). Keep sparse.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Radius<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每点球半径。</span><span class="en">Ball radius per point.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Subdivisions<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">表面细分次数（&gt;0 更慢）。</span><span class="en">Surface subdivision passes (slower if &gt; 0).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Points<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最多使用的球数；超出则抽稀（密点会卡）。</span><span class="en">Max balls used; excess are stride-subsampled (dense input freezes).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>128</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">球并的外表面。</span><span class="en">Outer surface of the union of balls.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
