<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalCrust2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalCrust2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalCrust2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Reconstruction</div>
  <h1>Crust 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">Amenta–Bern–Eppstein crust：对 XY 采样点并上它们的 Voronoi 顶点做德劳内，再只保留两端都是原采样点的边。从足够密的点重建曲线。不同于「OTR 重建 2D」。</p>
  <p class="en">Amenta–Bern–Eppstein crust: Delaunay of the XY samples union their Voronoi vertices, then keep edges that join two original samples. Reconstructs a curve from a dense point sampling. Distinct from OTR Reconstruct 2D.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">曲线的 XY 采样（要密到 crust 唯一）。</span><span class="en">XY samples of a curve (dense enough that the crust is unique).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">重建折线（线框）。用「网格到曲线」查看。</span><span class="en">Reconstructed polyline as a wire. Mesh to Curve to see it.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalAlphaComplex3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalAlphaComplex3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalAlphaComplex3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Reconstruction</div>
  <h1>Alpha Complex 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">三维 Alpha 复形，输出四面体外壳（CGAL Alpha_shape_3 单元）。不同于仅表面的 Alpha 形状，这里导出体积四面体。面属性 alpha_tet。</p>
  <p class="en">3D alpha complex as tetrahedron shells (CGAL Alpha_shape_3 cells). Unlike Alpha Shape (surface only) this exports the volume tets. Face attribute alpha_tet.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
