<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalEstimateNormals" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalEstimateNormals">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalEstimateNormals</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>Jet Estimate Normals</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">CGAL jet_estimate_normals（局部多项式/曲面拟合）+ MST 定向。写出 float3 属性 &quot;normal&quot;。更快用 PCA；更保锐边用 VCM。</p>
  <p class="en">CGAL jet_estimate_normals (local polynomial/surface fit) + MST orient. Writes float3 attribute &quot;normal&quot;. Faster alternative: PCA; sharper creases: VCM.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">点云或网格顶点。</span><span class="en">Point cloud or mesh verts.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Neighbors<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Jet 拟合的 k 近邻（常用 12–24；越大越平滑）。</span><span class="en">k-nearest for Jet fitting (typical 12-24; larger = smoother).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>18</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">相同点，带 float3 属性 “normal”（Jet + MST）。</span><span class="en">Same points with float3 attribute &quot;normal&quot; (Jet + MST).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
