<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalVcmEstimateNormals" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalVcmEstimateNormals">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalVcmEstimateNormals</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>VCM Estimate Normals</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用 Voronoi 协方差测度（特征感知）估计法线，再 MST 定向。尖锐棱边附近通常优于 Jet。半径为绝对场景单位。</p>
  <p class="en">Estimate normals with Voronoi Covariance Measure (feature-aware), then MST orient. Often better than Jet near sharp edges. Radii are absolute scene units.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">点云或网格顶点。</span><span class="en">Point cloud or mesh verts.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Offset Radius<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">VCM 偏移半径（协方差局部球）。可从数倍平均间距开始。</span><span class="en">VCM offset radius (local ball for covariance). Start at a few times mean spacing.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Convolution Radius<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">VCM 平滑半径（≥ 偏移）。越大法线越平滑、特征保真度越低。</span><span class="en">Smoothing radius for VCM (&gt;= Offset). Larger = smoother normals, less feature fidelity.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.2</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">相同点，带 float3 属性 “normal”（VCM）。</span><span class="en">Same points with float3 attribute &quot;normal&quot; (VCM).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalJetSmooth" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalJetSmooth">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalJetSmooth</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>Jet Smooth</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">使用 Jet 拟合平滑点云（CGAL jet_smooth_point_set）。适合重建/估法线前去噪；可能糊掉锐边（锐边请用双边平滑）。</p>
  <p class="en">Smooth a point set with jet fitting (CGAL jet_smooth_point_set). Good denoising before normals/reconstruction; may blur sharp features (prefer Bilateral Smooth for creases).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">带噪声的点集（也接受网格顶点）。</span><span class="en">Noisy point set (mesh verts also accepted).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Neighbors<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">k 近邻邻域大小。</span><span class="en">k-nearest neighborhood size.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>24</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平滑次数。</span><span class="en">Smoothing passes.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平滑后的点（数量不变）。</span><span class="en">Smoothed points (same count).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
