<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalBilateralSmooth" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalBilateralSmooth">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalBilateralSmooth</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>Bilateral Smooth</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">点云双边平滑（CGAL bilateral_smooth_point_set）。特征感知，比 Jet 平滑更易保留锐边。</p>
  <p class="en">Bilateral smooth of a point set (CGAL bilateral_smooth_point_set). Feature-aware; reduces noise while better keeping sharp creases than plain jet smooth.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">带噪声的点集（也接受网格顶点）。</span><span class="en">Noisy point set (mesh verts also accepted).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Neighbors<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">k 近邻邻域大小。</span><span class="en">k-nearest neighborhood size.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>24</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平滑次数。</span><span class="en">Smoothing passes.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>3</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Sharpness<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">特征角（度）。越大越不保锐边。</span><span class="en">Feature angle (degrees). Higher preserves sharper edges less.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>25.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平滑后的点（数量不变）。</span><span class="en">Smoothed points (same count).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
