<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalRemoveOutliers" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalRemoveOutliers">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalRemoveOutliers</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>Remove Outliers</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">按 k 邻域平均距离剔除最远的百分比点（CGAL remove_outliers）。适合重建前清离群点。</p>
  <p class="en">Remove the farthest percent of points by average k-neighbor distance (CGAL remove_outliers). Useful before reconstruction.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
