<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalWLOP" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalWLOP">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalWLOP</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>WLOP</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">WLOP：简化并规则化点集（加权局部最优投影）。输出点数约为输入的百分比。</p>
  <p class="en">WLOP: simplify and regularize a point set (Weighted Locally Optimal Projection). Output count is about Percent of input.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">带噪/稠密点云。</span><span class="en">Noisy/dense point cloud.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Percent<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">保留点数百分比（0–100）。常用 5–20。</span><span class="en">Keep percentage of points (0-100). 5-20 is common.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>5.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Neighbor Radius<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">局部邻域半径（场景单位）。请使用相对模型尺度的正值。</span><span class="en">Local neighborhood radius (scene units). Use a positive size relative to model scale.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">投影迭代次数。越多越规则、越慢。</span><span class="en">Projection iterations. More = more regular, slower.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>35</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Uniform Sampling<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">结果中优先更均匀的间距。</span><span class="en">Prefer more uniform spacing in the result.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
