<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalHierarchySimplify" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalHierarchySimplify">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalHierarchySimplify</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>Hierarchy Simplify</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">层级聚类简化：递归合并邻近点，直至簇达到簇大小/变化量限制。</p>
  <p class="en">Hierarchical cluster simplification: recursively merge nearby points until clusters reach Cluster Size / variation limit.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入点集。</span><span class="en">Input point set.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Cluster Size<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">叶簇目标点数（越大简化越强）。</span><span class="en">Target points per leaf cluster (larger = stronger simplify).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>10</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Variation<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">簇内最大空间变化量（0 = 仅按大小；越大平坦区可合并更大簇）。</span><span class="en">Max spatial variation inside a cluster (0 = size-only; larger allows bigger clusters on flats).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.333</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">简化后的点子集。</span><span class="en">Simplified point subset.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
