<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalEdgeAwareUpsample" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalEdgeAwareUpsample">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalEdgeAwareUpsample</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>Edge Aware Upsample</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">加密点集：输出 = 原点 + 新采样。点数为目标总数。边缘敏感度会把采样集中在折痕上。需要良好法线。</p>
  <p class="en">Densify a point set: output = originals + new samples. Number of Points is the target TOTAL count. Edge Sensitivity concentrates samples on creases. Needs good normals.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入点；若有 “normal” 属性则使用，否则估计。</span><span class="en">Input points; uses attribute &quot;normal&quot; if present, else estimates.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Number of Points<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">加密后的目标总点数（必须大于输入）。例：输入 6k 时设 12k 约 2 倍密度。</span><span class="en">Target total point count after densify (must be greater than input). Example: 6k in -&gt; set 12k for about 2x density.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>2000</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Sharpness Angle<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">特征角（度）。越大过渡越软；越小越保留尖锐折痕。</span><span class="en">Feature angle in degrees. Larger keeps softer transitions; smaller preserves sharper creases.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>30.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Edge Sensitivity<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">0 = 较均匀加密；1 = 强烈偏向锐边（新点堆积在折痕上）。</span><span class="en">0 = fairly uniform densify; 1 = strongly prefer sharp edges (new points pile on creases).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.5</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Neighbor Radius<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">加密邻域（0 = 自动约 3 倍平均间距）。过小则几乎无新点。</span><span class="en">Neighborhood for densify (0 = auto ~3x average spacing). Too small -&gt; few/no new points.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Normal Neighbors<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">缺少法线时 Jet 法线估计的 k。</span><span class="en">k for jet normal estimate when normals are missing.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>18</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">原点加新采样（带法线的加密点云）。</span><span class="en">Original points plus new samples (densified cloud with normals).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalPcaEstimateNormals" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalPcaEstimateNormals">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalPcaEstimateNormals</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>PCA Estimate Normals</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用局部 PCA（对 k 近邻拟平面）估计法线，再 MST 定向。快速基线；尖锐特征上弱于 VCM。</p>
  <p class="en">Estimate normals by local PCA (plane fit on k neighbors), then MST orient. Fast baseline; weaker on sharp features than VCM.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">点云或网格顶点。</span><span class="en">Point cloud or mesh verts.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Neighbors<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">PCA 的 k 近邻（常用 12–32）。</span><span class="en">k-nearest for PCA (typical 12-32).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>18</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">相同点，带 float3 属性 “normal”（PCA）。</span><span class="en">Same points with float3 attribute &quot;normal&quot; (PCA).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
