<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalMstOrientNormals" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMstOrientNormals">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalMstOrientNormals</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>MST Orient Normals</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">通过最小生成树翻转已有法线使其一致。不会从零计算法线——请先运行估计/PCA/VCM。</p>
  <p class="en">Flip existing normals so they are consistent via a minimum spanning tree. Does not compute normals from scratch — run Estimate/PCA/VCM first.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">已有 float3 属性 “normal” 的点云。</span><span class="en">Point cloud that already has float3 attribute &quot;normal&quot;.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Neighbors<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">构建 MST 邻接的 k（常用 12–24）。</span><span class="en">k for building the MST adjacency (typical 12-24).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>18</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">法线朝向已一致的相同点。</span><span class="en">Same points with consistently oriented &quot;normal&quot;.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
