<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalClusterPointSet" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalClusterPointSet">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalClusterPointSet</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>Cluster Point Set</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">空间聚类：把距离小于邻域半径的点连起来，用整数属性 &quot;Cluster&quot;（0,1,2…）标记每个连通分量。不移动或删除点。可用命名属性 + 分离几何拆分组。</p>
  <p class="en">Spatial clustering: link points closer than Neighbor Radius and label each connected component with int attribute &quot;Cluster&quot; (0,1,2...). Does not move or delete points. Use Named Attribute + Separate Geometry to split groups.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要聚类的点云（或网格顶点）。</span><span class="en">Point cloud (or mesh verts) to cluster.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Neighbor Radius<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">两点距离 ≤ 此值则连接（场景单位）。0 = 自动（包围盒对角线 1%）。过小→大量单点簇；过大→合成一簇。</span><span class="en">Connect two points if distance &lt;= this (scene units). 0 = auto (1% of bbox diagonal). Too small -&gt; many single-point clusters; too large -&gt; one cluster.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">相同点，带整数属性 “Cluster”（0,1,2…）。</span><span class="en">Same points with int attribute &quot;Cluster&quot; (0,1,2...).</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Cluster Count<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">找到的连通簇数量。</span><span class="en">How many connected clusters were found.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalVcmFeatureEdges" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalVcmFeatureEdges">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalVcmFeatureEdges</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>VCM Feature Edges</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">用 Voronoi 协方差测度（CGAL VCM）标记锐特征点。写出 Feature（0/1）、Feature Ratio 与 .selection。不改位置——可用选择分离几何，或开启「仅特征」。</p>
  <p class="en">Mark sharp-feature points via Voronoi Covariance Measure (CGAL VCM). Writes float Feature (0/1), Feature Ratio, and .selection. Does not change positions — use Separate Geometry on .selection, or enable Only Features.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">点云或网格顶点。</span><span class="en">Point cloud or mesh verts.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Offset Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">VCM 偏移半径。0 = 由平均点间距 × 2 自动。</span><span class="en">VCM offset radius. 0 = auto from average point spacing * 2.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Convolution Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">VCM 卷积半径。0 = 由平均间距 × 6 自动。</span><span class="en">VCM convolution radius. 0 = auto from average spacing * 6.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Threshold<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">特征值比阈值（比值 ≥ 阈值则标为特征）。越低标出的特征点越多。可查看 “Feature Ratio” 属性。</span><span class="en">Eigenvalue ratio threshold (Feature when ratio &gt;= Threshold). Lower marks more points as features. Inspect &quot;Feature Ratio&quot; attribute.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Only Features<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">为真则只输出特征点（没有则为空）。</span><span class="en">If true, output only feature points (empty if none).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">相同点（或仅特征点），带 Feature / Feature Ratio / .selection 属性。</span><span class="en">Same points (or only features) with Feature / Feature Ratio / .selection attributes.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
