</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalPointShapeFitting" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalPointShapeFitting">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalPointShapeFitting</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>Point Shape Fitting</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">在点云上生长区域并为每区拟合一个图元（平面/球/柱/圆/线）。主输出是带点整数 Region 的原点。拟合形状面板里是预览网格及其分辨率。</p>
  <p class="en">Grow regions on a point cloud and fit a primitive per region (CGAL Region_growing: plane / sphere / cylinder / circle / line). Main output is the original points with Point int &quot;Region&quot;. The Fitted Shape panel holds the preview mesh and its resolution.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Shape<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个区域拟合的图元类型。</span><span class="en">Primitive type fitted to each region.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Plane</code>, <code>Sphere</code>, <code>Cylinder</code>, <code>Circle</code>, <code>Line</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Plane</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">点云（可选 float3 “normal”；否则用 Jet 估计）。</span><span class="en">Point cloud (optional float3 &quot;normal&quot;; else jet-estimated).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Neighbor Radius<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">区域生长的球邻域半径。</span><span class="en">Sphere neighborhood radius for growing.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Distance<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">点到图元的最大距离。</span><span class="en">Max point-to-primitive distance.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.02</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Angle<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">点法线与图元法线的最大夹角（度）。</span><span class="en">Max degrees between point normal and the primitive.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>25.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Min Region Size<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">拟合区域的最少点数。</span><span class="en">Minimum number of points in a fitted region.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>10</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Min Radius<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">拒绝半径小于此值的拟合图元。0 = 无下限。</span><span class="en">Reject fitted primitives smaller than this radius. 0 = no minimum.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Radius<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">0 = 不限制。</span><span class="en">0 = unlimited.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Resolution<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">预览网格的 UV / 圆柱细分。</span><span class="en">UV / cylinder tessellation of the preview mesh.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>24</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入点，带点整数 Region（-1 未分配）。</span><span class="en">Input points with Point int &quot;Region&quot; (-1 unassigned).</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Region Count<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">拟合区域数量。</span><span class="en">Number of fitted regions.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Shape<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">拟合的平面 / 球 / 圆柱 / 圆盘 / 线段。</span><span class="en">Fitted planes / spheres / cylinders / disks / line segments.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Shape <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Plane</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Plane</code>, <code>Sphere</code>, <code>Cylinder</code>, <code>Circle</code>, <code>Line</code></p>

  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
