</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalNaturalNeighbor3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalNaturalNeighbor3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalNaturalNeighbor3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>Natural Neighbor 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">在顶点三维德劳内上对网格属性做拉普拉斯自然邻点插值。在上下文位置（或采样位置）求值。在凸包外「值」为 0，「有效」为假。</p>
  <p class="en">Laplace natural-neighbor interpolation of a mesh attribute on the 3D Delaunay of its vertices. Evaluated at the context Position (or Sample Position). Outside the hull Value is 0 and Is Valid is false</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">目标网格或点云。顶点值在三维德劳内上插值</span><span class="en">Target mesh or point cloud. Vertex values are interpolated on the 3D Delaunay</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Value<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">目标网格点上的属性 / 场</span><span class="en">Attribute / field on the target Mesh points</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Sample Position<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">插值位置。默认使用上下文位置</span><span class="en">Where to interpolate. Defaults to the context Position</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Data Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">数据类型</span><span class="en">Data Type</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Float</code>, <code>Integer</code>, <code>Boolean</code>, <code>Vector</code>, <code>Color</code>, <code>Quaternion</code>, <code>4x4 Matrix</code>, <code>String</code>, <code>8-Bit Integer</code>, <code>2D 16-Bit Integer Vector</code>, <code>2D Integer Vector</code>, <code>2D Vector</code>, <code>4D Vector</code>, <code>Byte Color</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>FLOAT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Value<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">在采样位置的拉普拉斯自然邻点插值</span><span class="en">Laplace natural-neighbor interpolation at Sample Position</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Is Valid<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">采样点落在网格顶点三维凸包内时为真</span><span class="en">True when the sample lies inside the 3D convex hull of Mesh vertices</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
