<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalKnnGraph3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalKnnGraph3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalKnnGraph3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>Neighbor Graph 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">把三维点连成线框。K 近邻模式用 k 个邻居；半径模式用距离阈值。顶点保持输入顺序和属性。</p>
  <p class="en">Connect 3D points into a wire mesh. Mode K Nearest uses k neighbors (CGAL Orthogonal_k_neighbor_search); Mode Radius uses a distance threshold (Kd_tree + Fuzzy_sphere). Vertices keep the input point order and attributes.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr class="mode-row"><th>Mode<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">K 近邻或半径图。</span><span class="en">K nearest neighbors or radius graph.</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>K Nearest</code>, <code>Radius</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>K Nearest</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">三维站点。输出顶点与此点顺序 1:1。</span><span class="en">3D sites. Output vertices match this point order.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>K<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每点邻居数（不含自身）。</span><span class="en">Neighbors per point (self is excluded).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>8</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Radius<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">连接距离小于此值的点对。</span><span class="en">Connect pairs closer than this distance.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">线框网格。顶点与输入点 1:1（属性会复制）。</span><span class="en">Wire mesh. Vertices are 1:1 with input points (attributes copied).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Mode <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>K Nearest</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>K Nearest</code>, <code>Radius</code></p>

  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
