</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalPointFeatures" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalPointFeatures">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalPointFeatures</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>Point Features</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">局部 PCA 特征（Weinmann）。只写入全方差、球度和各向异性（各向异性 = 1 − 球度）。可用已命名属性上色。</p>
  <p class="en">Local PCA eigen-features (Weinmann). Writes only omnivariance, sphericity, and anisotropy (anisotropy = 1 − sphericity). Color by Named Attribute.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">密点云（或网格顶点）。立方体几个角点会看起来均匀。</span><span class="en">Dense point cloud (or mesh verts). A handful of cube corners will look uniform.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Neighbors<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">局部协方差所用的 k 近邻。</span><span class="en">k-nearest neighbors for the local covariance.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>24</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">带全方差、球度、各向异性的相同点。可用已命名属性上色。</span><span class="en">Same points with omnivariance, sphericity, anisotropy. Color by Named Attribute.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalRegisterIcp" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalRegisterIcp">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalRegisterIcp</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>Iterative Closest Point</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">迭代最近点（ICP）：反复把源点配到目标最近点，用 Kabsch 求刚体变换。需要大致重叠；大旋转请先用四点全等集。</p>
  <p class="en">Iterative Closest Point (ICP): rigid-align Source onto Target by repeatedly pairing each source point to its nearest target neighbor and solving a Kabsch rotation+translation. Needs a rough initial overlap; for large rotations use 4-Point Congruent Sets first.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
