<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalSuper4pcs" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSuper4pcs">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalSuper4pcs</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Processing</div>
  <h1>4-Point Congruent Sets</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">全局刚体配准（Super4PCS 风格）：在源/目标上采样全等四点基，选内点最多的变换，再用 ICP 精修。能处理 ICP 搞不定的大旋转。</p>
  <p class="en">Global rigid registration (Super4PCS-style): sample congruent 4-point bases on Source and Target, pick the transform with most inliers, then refine with ICP. Handles large rotations that Iterative Closest Point cannot. Search names: 4PCS, Super4PCS, global align.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Source<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">移动的点云。</span><span class="en">Moving cloud.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Target<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">固定的点云。</span><span class="en">Fixed cloud.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Samples<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">尝试的随机全等四点基数量。越多越慢，越容易碰到好的旋转。</span><span class="en">Random congruent bases to try. More = slower, more chance of a good rotation.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>80</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>ICP Iterations<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">全局四点猜测之后的 ICP 精修步数。</span><span class="en">ICP refine steps after the global 4-point guess.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>12</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">全局四点对齐再 ICP 精修后的源点。保留源点属性。</span><span class="en">Source after global 4-point alignment + ICP refine. Source point attributes are kept.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
