</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalDelaunay3D" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalDelaunay3D">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalDelaunay3D</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Delaunay 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">三维德劳内四面体化。开启「分离四面体」得到独立四面体外壳（不共享顶点）；关闭则焊接成一个网格。</p>
  <p class="en">3D Delaunay tetrahedralization. Enable Separate Tetrahedra for independent tet shells (no shared vertices); disable to weld verts into one mesh.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入点（点云或网格顶点）。</span><span class="en">Input points (point cloud or mesh verts).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Separate Tetrahedra<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">开：每个四面体是独立岛屿（顶点复制，可炸开/分离）。关：相邻四面体共享顶点（合并网格）。</span><span class="en">On: each tetrahedron is an independent island (duplicated verts, can explode/separate). Off: share vertices between adjacent tets (merged mesh).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">四面体以三角壳体输出。开启分离四面体：每个四面体自带 4 个顶点（不共享）。关：焊接共享顶点。</span><span class="en">Tetrahedra as triangle shells. With Separate Tetrahedra: each tet has its own 4 vertices (no sharing). Off: welded shared vertices.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
