<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalMinParallelogram2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMinParallelogram2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalMinParallelogram2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Min Parallelogram 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">包住 XY 点的最小面积平行四边形（CGAL min_parallelogram_2）。怎么用：接入点 → 得到四边形网格以及中心 / 半径。点云是斜向团块时可能比「最小矩形 2D」更紧；对边保持平行。</p>
  <p class="en">Smallest-area parallelogram that contains the XY points (CGAL min_parallelogram_2). How to use: plug Points → get a quad Mesh plus Center / Radius. Compared with Min Rectangle 2D this may be tighter when the set is a sheared blob; the sides stay parallel in pairs.</p>
