</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最小面积包围平行四边形，以四边形网格输出。</span><span class="en">Minimum-area enclosing parallelogram as a quad mesh.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Center<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">平行四边形中心。</span><span class="en">Center of the parallelogram.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">较长对角线的一半（方便快速读尺寸）。</span><span class="en">Half the longer diagonal (for a quick size read).</span></div></td></tr>
