  <h1>Min Annulus 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">包住全部 XY 点的最薄圆环（CGAL Min_annulus_d）。怎么用：接入点 → 得到圆环网格以及中心 / 外半径 / 内半径。用来衡量点云离圆有多远。不同于「最小圆 2D」（实心圆盘，没有内孔）。</p>
  <p class="en">Thinnest ring (annulus) that contains every XY point (CGAL Min_annulus_d). How to use: plug Points → get a ring Mesh plus Center / Outer Radius / Inner Radius. Useful to measure how far a cloud is from a circle. Different from Min Circle 2D (solid disk, no inner hole).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要包围的点。</span><span class="en">Points to enclose.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Segments<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">圆环用多少个四边形近似。越高预览越圆。</span><span class="en">How many quads approximate the ring. Higher = rounder preview.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>48</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">圆环，由外圈到内圈的四边形组成。</span><span class="en">Annulus as a ring of quads (outer-inner).</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Center<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">内外圆的公共圆心。</span><span class="en">Common center of the inner and outer circles.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Outer Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">外包围圆半径。</span><span class="en">Radius of the outer enclosing circle.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Inner Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">内空圆半径（若有点落在圆心则为 0）。</span><span class="en">Radius of the inner empty circle (0 if a point sits at the center).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
