<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalWidth3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalWidth3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalWidth3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Width 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">三维点集在一对平行支撑平面之间的最小宽度（CGAL Width_3）。</p>
  <p class="en">Minimal width of a 3D point set with parallel supporting planes (CGAL Width_3).</p>
