<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalDelaunay2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalDelaunay2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalDelaunay2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Delaunay 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">XY 点的德劳内三角剖分（CGAL Delaunay_triangulation_2）。怎么用：接入点云 → 得到用空外接圆连接各站点的三角网格。忽略 Z。有约束边/孔用「约束德劳内 2D」；要三维体用「德劳内 3D」。</p>
  <p class="en">Delaunay triangulation of XY points (CGAL Delaunay_triangulation_2). How to use: plug a Point Cloud → get a triangle mesh that connects every site with empty circumcircles. Z is ignored. For constrained edges / holes use Constrained Delaunay 2D; for a 3D volume use Delaunay 3D.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 平面上的站点（点云或网格顶点）。忽略 Z。</span><span class="en">Sites on the XY plane (point cloud or mesh verts). Z is ignored.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 上的德劳内三角网格。</span><span class="en">Delaunay triangulation as a triangle mesh on XY.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalAlphaShape2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalAlphaShape2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalAlphaShape2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Alpha Shape 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">XY 点集的二维 Alpha 形状（CGAL Alpha_shape_2）：能用半径为 Alpha、内部不含其它采样点的圆盘盖住的区域。怎么用：接入点 → 先用较大 Alpha，再减小直到轮廓贴住点云；或打开「最优」自动选取。输出是填充三角（不只是边界）。不同于三维「Alpha 形状」（表面）和「Alpha 包裹」（防水外扩）。</p>
  <p class="en">2D alpha shape of XY points (CGAL Alpha_shape_2): the region you can cover with disks of radius Alpha that contain no other sample. How to use: plug Points → start with a large Alpha, then lower it until the outline hugs the cloud; or turn Optimal on to auto-pick. Output is filled triangles (not just a boundary). Different from Alpha Shape (3D surface) and Alpha Wrap (watertight offset).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 点集（点云或网格顶点）。忽略 Z。</span><span class="en">XY point set (point cloud or mesh verts). Z is ignored.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Alpha<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">手动 Alpha 半径（场景单位）。越小越贴合、孔越多；越大越整体圆滑。开启最优时忽略。</span><span class="en">Manual alpha radius (scene units). Smaller = tighter / more holes; larger = smoother bulk. Ignored when Optimal is on.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Optimal<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">开：忽略 Alpha，自动选取能得到一个二维实体分量的值。</span><span class="en">On: ignore Alpha and auto-pick a value that yields one solid 2D component.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">点集的二维 Alpha 形状填充三角。</span><span class="en">Filled 2D alpha-shape triangles of the point set.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Alpha Used<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">实际使用的 Alpha（手动，或开启最优时自动选取）。</span><span class="en">Actual alpha used (manual Alpha, or the auto-picked value when Optimal is on).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalVoronoi2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalVoronoi2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalVoronoi2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Voronoi 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">XY 点的 Voronoi 单元（德劳内对偶）。每个单元是独立 n 边形（不共享顶点）。无界单元裁剪到点包围盒 + Padding。面属性 cell_id。</p>
  <p class="en">Voronoi cells of XY points (dual of Delaunay). Each cell is an isolated n-gon (no shared verts). Unbounded cells are clipped to the input-point bounding box + Padding. Face attribute cell_id.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">站点（点云或网格顶点）。在 XY 中做沃罗诺伊。</span><span class="en">Sites (point cloud or mesh vertices). Voronoi in XY.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Padding<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入点包围盒的外扩。0 = 正好裁到包围盒。</span><span class="en">Outward padding of the input-point bounding box. 0 = clip exactly to the bbox.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个 Voronoi 格子一个独立 n 边形。面属性 cell_id。</span><span class="en">One isolated n-gon per Voronoi cell. Face attribute cell_id.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalVoronoi3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalVoronoi3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalVoronoi3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Voronoi 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">点站点的三维 Voronoi 单元（德劳内四面体对偶）。每个单元是独立多面体（不共享顶点）。无界单元裁剪到点包围盒 + Padding。面属性 cell_id。</p>
  <p class="en">3D Voronoi cells of point sites (dual of Delaunay tetrahedra). Each cell is an isolated polyhedron (no shared verts). Unbounded cells are clipped to the input-point bounding box + Padding. Face attribute cell_id.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">三维站点（至少 5 个不共面的点）。</span><span class="en">3D sites (need at least 5 non-coplanar points).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Padding<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">输入点包围盒的外扩。0 = 正好裁到包围盒。</span><span class="en">Outward padding of the input-point bounding box. 0 = clip exactly to the bbox.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个 Voronoi 格子一个独立多面体。面属性 cell_id。</span><span class="en">One isolated polyhedron per Voronoi cell. Face attribute cell_id.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
