<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicDelaunay3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicDelaunay3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicDelaunay3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Periodic Delaunay 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">周期盒子上的德劳内四面体（CGAL Periodic_3_Delaunay_triangulation_3）。跨周期单元使用偏移顶点，落在域边界上而不是拉穿盒子。Domain 0 使用加边距的包围盒。</p>
  <p class="en">Delaunay tetrahedra on a periodic box (CGAL Periodic_3_Delaunay_triangulation_3). Wrapping cells use offset vertices so they sit on the domain boundary instead of stretching across the box. Domain 0 uses a padded bbox.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">站点（会折进周期盒）。</span><span class="en">Sites (wrapped into the periodic box).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Domain X<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">周期宽度。0 = 加点填充的点包围盒。</span><span class="en">Period width. 0 = padded point bbox.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Domain Y<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">周期深度。0 = 加点填充的点包围盒。</span><span class="en">Period depth. 0 = padded point bbox.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Domain Z<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">周期高度。0 = 加点填充的点包围盒。</span><span class="en">Period height. 0 = padded point bbox.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Separate Tetrahedra<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">开：每个四面体是独立岛屿。关：焊接共享顶点。</span><span class="en">On: each tet is an independent island. Off: weld shared vertices.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">四面体以三角壳体输出。面属性 periodic_tet。</span><span class="en">Tetrahedra as triangle shells. Face attribute periodic_tet.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Tets<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">四面体个数。</span><span class="en">Number of tetrahedra.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
