<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalDelaunayOnSphere" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalDelaunayOnSphere">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalDelaunayOnSphere</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Delaunay on Sphere</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">将点投影到包围球上再做德劳内三角剖分（CGAL Delaunay_triangulation_on_sphere_2）。适合地球/球面网格。</p>
