<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalVoronoiOnSphere" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalVoronoiOnSphere">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalVoronoiOnSphere</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Voronoi on Sphere</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">点投影到包围球上的球面 Voronoi 单元（「球面德劳内」的对偶）。每个单元是独立的 n 边形。面属性 cell_id。</p>
  <p class="en">Spherical Voronoi cells of points projected onto their bounding sphere (dual of Delaunay on Sphere). Each cell is an isolated n-gon. Face attribute cell_id.</p>
