  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个球面 Voronoi 单元一个独立 n 边形。面属性 cell_id。</span><span class="en">One isolated n-gon per spherical Voronoi cell. Face attribute cell_id.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
