<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalLargestEmptyCircle2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalLargestEmptyCircle2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalLargestEmptyCircle2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Largest Empty Circle 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">XY 上不含任何输入站点、圆心在凸包内的最大空圆（Voronoi 顶点或 Voronoi∩凸包）。请用散点云——不是填充网格（那是最大内切圆 2D）。</p>
  <p class="en">Largest XY circle that contains no input sites, center inside the convex hull (Voronoi vertex or Voronoi∩hull). Use a point cloud of scattered sites — not a filled mesh (that is Largest Inscribed Circle 2D).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
