<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">不含任何输入站点的最大圆盘。</span><span class="en">Disk of the largest circle that contains no input sites.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Center<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最大空圆圆心（在凸包内）。</span><span class="en">Center of the largest empty circle (inside the convex hull).</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">该空圆半径。</span><span class="en">Radius of that empty circle.</span></div></td></tr>
