<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalLargestEmptySphere3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalLargestEmptySphere3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalLargestEmptySphere3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Largest Empty Sphere 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">不含任何输入站点、球心落在凸包内的最大球（CGAL Delaunay_triangulation_3 外接球心）。是「最大空圆 2D」的三维对应。请用散点云，不要用实心网格（那是「内切球 3D」）。</p>
  <p class="en">Largest sphere that contains no input sites, with its center inside the convex hull (CGAL Delaunay_triangulation_3 circumcenter). The 3D analog of Largest Empty Circle 2D. Use a scattered point cloud — not a filled mesh (that is Inscribed Sphere 3D).</p>
