<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalMinWidth2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMinWidth2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalMinWidth2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Min Width 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">XY 凸包的最小卡尺宽度（旋转卡尺）：两条平行支撑线之间的最小间隙。怎么用：接入点 → 读「宽度」，或看预览条带。与「宽度 3D」（空间中两张支撑平面）互补。</p>
  <p class="en">Minimal caliper width of the XY convex hull (rotating calipers): the smallest gap between two parallel supporting lines. How to use: plug Points → read Width, or look at the preview strip. Complementary to Width 3D (two supporting planes in space).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要测量 XY 凸包的点（点云或网格顶点）。</span><span class="en">Points whose XY convex hull is measured (point cloud or mesh verts).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Plane Scale<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">支撑条带四边形的半长。</span><span class="en">Half-length of the supporting-strip quad.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">跨在两条平行支撑线上的预览四边形。</span><span class="en">Preview quad spanning the two parallel supporting lines.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Width<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最小卡尺宽度（两条支撑线间距）。</span><span class="en">Minimal caliper width (distance between the two supporting lines).</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Center<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最小宽度条带的中点。</span><span class="en">Midpoint of the min-width strip.</span></div></td></tr>
