<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalMinSphereOfSpheres" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMinSphereOfSpheres">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalMinSphereOfSpheres</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Min Sphere of Spheres</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">包住输入球（带半径）的最小球（CGAL Min_sphere_of_spheres_d）。与仅包点的「最小包围球」不同。输出可视化网格、中心、半径。</p>
  <p class="en">Smallest sphere enclosing input balls with radii (CGAL Min_sphere_of_spheres_d). Unlike Min Sphere (points only), each input has a radius. Outputs visualization mesh, Center, Radius.</p>
