<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalMongeJetFit" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMongeJetFit">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalMongeJetFit</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Monge Jet Fit</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">对 k 近邻做 Jet 拟合得到局部 Monge 形式（主曲率 k1/k2、主方向、法线；双精度 kd 树）。保留输入属性；写入 monge_k1/k2、monge_d1/d2、monge_normal。</p>
  <p class="en">Local Monge form (k1/k2, principal directions, normal) via jet fitting on k nearest neighbors (double-precision kd-tree). Preserves input attributes; writes monge_k1/k2, monge_d1/d2, monge_normal.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">点云或网格顶点。已有属性会保留。</span><span class="en">Point cloud or mesh verts. Existing attributes are preserved.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Neighbors<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">局部 Jet 的 k 近邻（哈希网格 kNN，多线程）。越大越平滑，但每点 SVD 更慢。拟合阶 d 时须 ≥ (d+1)(d+2)/2（2 阶 → ≥6）。会钳到点数。</span><span class="en">k nearest neighbors for the local jet (hash-grid kNN, multi-threaded). Larger = smoother but slower SVD per point. Must be ≥ (d+1)(d+2)/2 for Fitting Degree d (degree 2 → ≥6). Clamped to point count.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>12</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Fitting Degree<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">多项式 Jet 次数（常用 2；3–4 明显更慢）。</span><span class="en">Polynomial jet degree (2 is usual; 3–4 much slower).</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>2</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Monge Degree<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Monge 形式阶数（≤ 拟合次数）。2 给出主曲率。</span><span class="en">Monge form order (≤ Fitting Degree). 2 gives principal curvatures.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>2</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">相同点（属性保留）+ monge_k1/k2、monge_d1/d2、monge_normal。</span><span class="en">Same points (attrs kept) + monge_k1/k2, monge_d1/d2, monge_normal.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalEuclideanMst3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalEuclideanMst3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalEuclideanMst3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Euclidean MST 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">最小生成树。点云：在三维德劳内上做 Borůvka。网格：在现有边上做 Borůvka（跳过德劳内）。输出为线框。</p>
  <p class="en">Minimum spanning tree. Point cloud: Borůvka on the 3D Delaunay. Mesh: Borůvka on existing edges (Delaunay skipped). Output is a wire.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">点云：先德劳内再 MST。网格：在现有边上做 MST，不做德劳内。</span><span class="en">Point cloud: Delaunay then MST. Mesh: MST on existing edges, no Delaunay.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最小生成树线框。</span><span class="en">Minimum spanning tree as a wire.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
