  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">洋葱剥皮：反复取 XY 凸包（CGAL convex_hull_2）再剥掉。每一层是独立 n 边形，带面属性 layer_id。</p>
