<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalConvexLayers3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalConvexLayers3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalConvexLayers3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Convex Layers 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">三维剥洋葱：反复求凸包（CGAL convex_hull_3）并剥掉这些顶点。每层是独立凸包，面属性 layer_id（0 = 最外层）。不同于 Blender 自带的单个凸包。</p>
  <p class="en">Onion peeling in 3D: repeatedly compute the convex hull (CGAL convex_hull_3) and peel those vertices. Each layer is an isolated hull with face attribute layer_id (0 = outermost). Distinct from Blender's single Convex Hull.</p>
