<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">嵌套凸包。面属性 layer_id（0 = 最外层）。</span><span class="en">Nested convex hulls. Face attribute layer_id (0 = outer).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
