<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicVoronoi2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicVoronoi2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicVoronoi2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Periodic Voronoi 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">平坦环面上的 Voronoi 格子（周期德劳内 2D 的对偶）。不是加权 / 正则三角剖分。</p>
  <p class="en">Voronoi cells on a flat torus (dual of Periodic Delaunay 2D). Not a weighted / regular triangulation.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 站点。会折进周期域。</span><span class="en">XY sites. Wrapped into the periodic domain.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Domain X<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">周期宽度。0 = XY 跨度的 1.05 倍。</span><span class="en">Periodic width. 0 = 1.05 times the XY span.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Domain Y<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">周期高度。0 = XY 跨度的 1.05 倍。</span><span class="en">Periodic height. 0 = 1.05 times the XY span.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">独立 n 边形格子。面属性 cell_id。</span><span class="en">Isolated n-gon cells. Face attribute cell_id.</span></div></td></tr>
