<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicVoronoi3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicVoronoi3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalPeriodicVoronoi3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Periodic Voronoi 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">三维点的周期 Voronoi 格子，输出为闭合网格体（周期德劳内 3D 的对偶，用邻点中垂面裁切）。不是加权 / 正则三角剖分。</p>
  <p class="en">Periodic Voronoi cells of 3D points as closed mesh volumes (dual of Periodic Delaunay 3D, clipped by neighbor bisectors). Not a weighted / regular triangulation.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">三维站点。会折进周期盒。</span><span class="en">3D sites. Wrapped into the periodic box.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Domain X<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">沿 X 的周期域尺寸。0 = 使用点包围盒。</span><span class="en">Periodic domain size along X. 0 = use the point bounding box.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Domain Y<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">沿 Y 的周期域尺寸。0 = 使用点包围盒。</span><span class="en">Periodic domain size along Y. 0 = use the point bounding box.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Domain Z<span class="type">FloatDistance</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">沿 Z 的周期域尺寸。0 = 使用点包围盒。</span><span class="en">Periodic domain size along Z. 0 = use the point bounding box.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每个周期 Voronoi 格子作为一个闭合网格体。面属性 cell_id。</span><span class="en">Each periodic Voronoi cell as a closed mesh volume. Face attribute cell_id.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
