<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalMinCylinder3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMinCylinder3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalMinCylinder3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Min Cylinder 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">沿 PCA 轴、包住点集的有限圆柱（CGAL linear_least_squares_fitting_3 + 径向平面 Min_circle_2）。适合管子 / 装箱。不同于「最小包围球」和「最优包围盒」。</p>
  <p class="en">Finite cylinder along the PCA axis that encloses the points (CGAL linear_least_squares_fitting_3 + Min_circle_2 of the radial plane). Use for pipes / packing. Different from Min Sphere (ball) and Optimal Bounding Box.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要包围的点（点云或网格顶点）。</span><span class="en">Points to enclose (point cloud or mesh verts).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Segments<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">圆柱用多少边近似。</span><span class="en">How many sides approximate the cylinder.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>24</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">沿 PCA 轴的有限圆柱（带盖）。</span><span class="en">Finite cylinder (capped) along the PCA axis.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Center<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">圆柱轴线中点。</span><span class="en">Midpoint of the cylinder axis.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">包围圆半径。</span><span class="en">Radius of the enclosing circle.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
