</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalMinAnnulus3" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalMinAnnulus3">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalMinAnnulus3</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Min Annulus 3D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">包围点集的最小球壳。预览是两个同心 UV 球。不同于最小球（一个实心球）和最小圆环 2D（平面环）。</p>
  <p class="en">Smallest spherical shell enclosing the points (CGAL Min_annulus_d in 3D). Preview is two concentric UV spheres. Different from Min Sphere (one ball) and Min Annulus 2D (planar ring).</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">要包围的点（点云或网格顶点）。</span><span class="en">Points to enclose (point cloud or mesh verts).</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Segments<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">预览球面的 UV 细分。</span><span class="en">UV tessellation of the preview spheres.</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>24</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">外 UV 球加内 UV 球（球壳）。</span><span class="en">Outer UV sphere plus inner UV sphere (spherical shell).</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Center<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">两球的公共球心。</span><span class="en">Common center of both spheres.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Outer Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">包围球半径。</span><span class="en">Radius of the enclosing sphere.</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Inner Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">空心内球半径（若有点在球心则为 0）。</span><span class="en">Radius of the empty inner sphere (0 if a point sits at the center).</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
