</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeCgalSimplePolygon2" data-page="GeometryNodeCgalSimplePolygon2">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeCgalSimplePolygon2</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code> · Bikini/Lib/CGAL/Points/Shape</div>
  <h1>Simple Polygon 2D</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">把一堆 XY 点连成一个不自交、并且经过每个点的多边形。怎么用：接入点 → 得到一条边不相交的 n 边形。和凸包不同，内部点也当顶点留下。点全在一条直线上会失败。适合把平面撒点变成可填充轮廓，再接「多边形填充 2D」或「布尔运算 2D」。</p>
  <p class="en">Turn a cloud of XY points into one simple polygon that visits every point. How to use: plug Points → get a single n-gon whose edges do not cross. Unlike Convex Hull this keeps interior points as vertices. If all points sit on one line the node fails. Good for turning a 2D scatter into a fillable outline before Polygon Fill 2D or Boolean Ops 2D.</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Points<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">XY 上的点云或网格顶点。每个不重复的点都会成为多边形顶点（不只是凸包）。全共线会失败。</span><span class="en">Point Cloud or Mesh vertices in XY. Every distinct point becomes a vertex of one polygon (not just the convex hull). Collinear-only sets fail.</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Mesh<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">经过全部不重复 XY 点的一个简单（不自交）n 边形。顶点顺序会重写，使边不再交叉。</span><span class="en">One simple (non-self-intersecting) n-gon through all distinct XY points. The vertex order is rewritten so edges no longer cross.</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeBoxEngineSetRigidBody" data-page="GeometryNodeBoxEngineSetRigidBody">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeBoxEngineSetRigidBody</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Box Set Rigid Body</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">Box 引擎的刚体类型 + 碰撞形状。基于网格的模式不需要尺寸。碰撞输出显示实际碰撞体（凸包 / 岛凸包 / 三角网格）</p>
  <p class="en">Body type + collision shape for Box Engine. Mesh-based modes need no Size. Collision output shows the actual collider (hull / island hulls / triangle mesh)</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">刚体几何：网格（→ 居中实例）、点或实例</span><span class="en">Body geometry: Mesh (→ centered instance), Points, or Instances</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Selection<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">哪些点/实例获得刚体</span><span class="en">Which points/instances receive a rigid body</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Name Prefix<span class="type">String</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">body_name 前缀。第一个空闲名就是此前缀；重复项加 .001、.002、…。已有的非空 body_name 不会被覆盖</span><span class="en">body_name prefix. First free name is the prefix itself; duplicates get .001, .002, … Existing non-empty body_name is not overwritten</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>Body</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Body Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">静态、运动学或动态刚体</span><span class="en">Static, kinematic, or dynamic rigid body</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Static</code>, <code>Kinematic</code>, <code>Dynamic</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Dynamic</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Shape<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">求解器使用的碰撞形状</span><span class="en">Collision shape used by the solver</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Box</code>, <code>Sphere</code>, <code>Capsule</code>, <code>Bounding Box</code>, <code>Convex Hull</code>, <code>Compound</code>, <code>Triangle Mesh</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Bounding Box</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Proxy<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">仅复合体：可选碰撞网格。每个网格岛（及每个实例）成为同一刚体上的一个凸包。为空 = 使用几何</span><span class="en">Compound only: optional collision mesh. Each mesh island (and each instance) becomes one convex hull on a single body. Empty = use Geometry</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Size<span class="type">VectorXYZ</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">仅盒体 / 球体 / 胶囊 — 全尺寸（不是一半）</span><span class="en">Box / Sphere / Capsule only — full extents (not half)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[1.0, 1.0, 1.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Density<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">仅用于动态刚体的质量密度</span><span class="en">Mass density for Dynamic bodies only</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Friction<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">库仑摩擦系数</span><span class="en">Coulomb friction coefficient</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.4</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Restitution<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">回弹系数（0 = 不弹，1 = 完全弹性）</span><span class="en">Bounce coefficient (0 = no bounce, 1 = elastic)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.05</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">原始可视几何 + 刚体属性（不是碰撞体网格）</span><span class="en">Original visual geometry + rigid-body attributes (not the collider mesh)</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Collision<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">碰撞形状预览（与求解器碰撞体一致：凸包 / 岛 / 三角网格 / 图元）。连接到预览器 — 不用于渲染</span><span class="en">Collision-shape preview (matches the solver collider: hull / islands / triangle mesh / primitive). Connect to Viewer — not for rendering</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Body Type <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Dynamic</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Static</code>, <code>Kinematic</code>, <code>Dynamic</code></p>
<h3>Shape <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Bounding Box</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Box</code>, <code>Sphere</code>, <code>Capsule</code>, <code>Bounding Box</code>, <code>Convex Hull</code>, <code>Compound</code>, <code>Triangle Mesh</code></p>

  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
