</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeBoxEngineSetConstraint" data-page="GeometryNodeBoxEngineSetConstraint">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeBoxEngineSetConstraint</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Box Set Constraint</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">添加一个 Box 引擎关节。距离/焊接/滑动副需要两个已命名刚体。转动副把刚体 A 铰到世界锚点</p>
  <p class="en">Add one Box Engine joint. Distance/Weld/Prismatic take two named bodies. Revolute hinges Body A to a world Anchor</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Constraints<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">可选的已有关节（点云），将追加到其上</span><span class="en">Optional existing joints (point cloud) to append to</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Body A<span class="type">String</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">匹配设置刚体写出的实例/点属性 body_name</span><span class="en">Matches instance/point attribute body_name from Set Rigid Body</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>Body</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Body B<span class="type">String</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">第二个 body_name。距离、焊接和滑动副需要</span><span class="en">Second body_name. Required for Distance, Weld, and Prismatic</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>Body.001</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">距离=保持间距；转动副=世界铰链；焊接=粘合；滑动副=滑轨</span><span class="en">Distance=keep spacing; Revolute=world hinge; Weld=glue; Prismatic=slider</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Distance</code>, <code>Revolute</code>, <code>Weld</code>, <code>Prismatic</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Revolute</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Anchor<span class="type">VectorTranslation</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">转动副的世界空间铰点</span><span class="en">World-space hinge point for Revolute</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Axis<span class="type">VectorXYZ</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">世界空间滑动方向。刚体 B 沿此轴移动</span><span class="en">World-space slide direction. Body B moves along this axis</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[1.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Constraints<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">关节点云 → 接到 Box 引擎求解器 · 约束</span><span class="en">Point cloud of joints → plug into Box Engine Solver · Constraints</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Type <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Revolute</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Distance</code>, <code>Revolute</code>, <code>Weld</code>, <code>Prismatic</code></p>

