<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeBoxEngineSolver" data-page="GeometryNodeBoxEngineSolver">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeBoxEngineSolver</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Box Solver</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">步进 Box2D/Box3D 刚体。几何上的静态/运动学刚体是障碍。子步数 = 本帧碰撞切片数。建议在模拟区内使用实例</p>
  <p class="en">Step Box2D/Box3D rigid bodies. Static/Kinematic bodies on Geometry are obstacles. Substeps = collide slices this frame. Prefer Instances inside a Simulation Zone</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">刚体：实例（推荐）。把动态盒与静态墙 / 运动学推动器合并。用设置刚体标记类型和形状</span><span class="en">Bodies: Instances (preferred). Join Dynamic boxes with Static walls / Kinematic movers. Use Set Rigid Body to tag type and shape</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Constraints<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">来自设置约束的可选点云。转动副把刚体 A 铰到世界锚点；距离 / 焊接 / 滑动副连接两个已命名刚体</span><span class="en">Optional Point Cloud from Set Constraint. Revolute hinges Body A to a world Anchor; Distance / Weld / Prismatic join two named bodies</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Engine<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Box2D（XY）或 Box3D 求解器</span><span class="en">Box2D (XY) or Box3D solver</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Box2D</code>, <code>Box3D</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Box2D</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Gravity<span class="type">VectorAcceleration</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">世界重力。Box2D 使用 (X, Y)；若 Y≈0 则用 Z，因此 (0,0,-9.81) 仍会下落</span><span class="en">World gravity. Box2D uses (X, Y); if Y≈0, Z is used so (0,0,-9.81) still falls</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, -9.81]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Delta Time<span class="type">FloatTimeAbsolute</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">在模拟区内使用场景时间增量</span><span class="en">Use Scene Time delta inside a Simulation Zone</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0416667</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Substeps<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">本帧的碰撞/求解切片。16 表示 16 次 dt/16 的物理步进。这是碰撞频率，不是隐藏的求解器旋钮</span><span class="en">Collide/solve slices this frame. 16 means 16 physics steps of dt/16. This is the collision rate, not a hidden solver knob</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>16</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">已更新变换和速度属性的刚体</span><span class="en">Bodies with updated transforms and velocity attributes</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Engine <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Box2D</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Box2D</code>, <code>Box3D</code></p>

  <p class="src zh">数据：本编译版 blender.exe 导出 + 源码 description / zh_HANS.po。无单独「属性」章节。</p>
  <p class="src en">From this blender.exe dump + source descriptions / zh_HANS.po. No separate Properties section.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeJoltSetRigidBody" data-page="GeometryNodeJoltSetRigidBody">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeJoltSetRigidBody</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Jolt Set Rigid Body</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">刚体类型 + 碰撞形状。静态刚体在 Jolt 求解器中作为碰撞体。胶囊/圆柱为 Z 向上。三角网格为静态（动态改用凸包）</p>
  <p class="en">Body type + collision shape. Static bodies are colliders in Jolt Solver. Capsule/Cylinder are Z-up. Triangle Mesh is static (Dynamic uses a hull)</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">刚体几何：网格（→ 居中实例）、点或实例</span><span class="en">Body geometry: Mesh (→ centered instance), Points, or Instances</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Selection<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">哪些点/实例获得刚体</span><span class="en">Which points/instances receive a rigid body</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>true</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Name Prefix<span class="type">String</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">body_name 前缀。重复项加 .001、.002、…</span><span class="en">body_name prefix. Duplicates get .001, .002, …</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>Body</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Body Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">静态、运动学或动态刚体</span><span class="en">Static, kinematic, or dynamic rigid body</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Static</code>, <code>Kinematic</code>, <code>Dynamic</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Dynamic</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Shape<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">求解器使用的碰撞形状</span><span class="en">Collision shape used by the solver</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Box</code>, <code>Sphere</code>, <code>Capsule</code>, <code>Cylinder</code>, <code>Bounding Box</code>, <code>Convex Hull</code>, <code>Compound</code>, <code>Triangle Mesh</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Bounding Box</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>DOFs<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">允许的平移/旋转轴</span><span class="en">Allowed translation/rotation axes</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>All</code>, <code>Plane XY</code>, <code>Plane XZ</code>, <code>Plane YZ</code>, <code>Translation</code>, <code>Rotation</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>All</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Proxy<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">仅复合体：可选碰撞网格</span><span class="en">Compound only: optional collision mesh</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Size<span class="type">VectorXYZ</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">盒体 / 球体 / 胶囊 / 圆柱尺寸</span><span class="en">Box / Sphere / Capsule / Cylinder extents</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[1.0, 1.0, 1.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Density<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">动态刚体的质量密度</span><span class="en">Mass density for Dynamic bodies</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Friction<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">库仑摩擦系数</span><span class="en">Coulomb friction coefficient</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.5</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Restitution<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">回弹系数（0 = 不弹，1 = 完全弹性）</span><span class="en">Bounce coefficient (0 = no bounce, 1 = elastic)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Linear Damping<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">线速度阻尼</span><span class="en">Linear velocity damping</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Angular Damping<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">更高的值抑制残余自旋，使堆叠能够静止</span><span class="en">Higher values stop residual spin so stacks can rest</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.25</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Convex Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Jolt 凸半径（圆角边）。0 = 尖锐</span><span class="en">Jolt convex radius (rounded edges). 0 = sharp</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.05</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Sensor<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">报告接触但不解算它们</span><span class="en">Report contacts without resolving them</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>CCD<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">LinearCast 运动质量</span><span class="en">LinearCast motion quality</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">原始可视几何 + 刚体属性</span><span class="en">Original visual geometry + rigid-body attributes</span></div></td></tr><tr><th>Collision<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">碰撞形状预览。连接到预览器</span><span class="en">Collision-shape preview. Connect to Viewer</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2><span class="zh">菜单模式与接口显隐</span><span class="en">Menus &amp; input visibility</span></h2>
<h3>Body Type <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Dynamic</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Static</code>, <code>Kinematic</code>, <code>Dynamic</code></p>
<h3>Shape <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>Bounding Box</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>Box</code>, <code>Sphere</code>, <code>Capsule</code>, <code>Cylinder</code>, <code>Bounding Box</code>, <code>Convex Hull</code>, <code>Compound</code>, <code>Triangle Mesh</code></p>
<h3>DOFs <span class="type">Menu</span></h3>
<p><span class="zh">默认</span><span class="en">Default</span>: <code>All</code> · <span class="zh">全部</span><span class="en">All</span>: <code>All</code>, <code>Plane XY</code>, <code>Plane XZ</code>, <code>Plane YZ</code>, <code>Translation</code>, <code>Rotation</code></p>

