<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeJoltSetConstraint" data-page="GeometryNodeJoltSetConstraint">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeJoltSetConstraint</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Jolt Set Constraint</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">添加一个 Jolt 约束（固定、距离、点、铰链、锥、滑轨、摆动-扭转、六自由度、路径、齿轮、齿条齿轮、滑轮、载具）。接到 Jolt 求解器</p>
  <p class="en">Add one Jolt constraint (fixed, distance, point, hinge, cone, slider, swing-twist, six-DOF, path, gear, rack-and-pinion, pulley, vehicle). Plug into Jolt Solver</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Constraints<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">可选的已有关节，将追加到其上</span><span class="en">Optional existing joints to append to</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Body A<span class="type">String</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">匹配实例/点属性 body_name</span><span class="en">Matches instance/point attribute body_name</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>Body</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Body B<span class="type">String</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">第二个 body_name。为空 = 世界。载具不使用</span><span class="en">Second body_name. Empty = world. Unused for Vehicle</span></div><div class="def">default=<code></code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Type<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Jolt 关节类型</span><span class="en">Jolt joint type</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Fixed</code>, <code>Distance</code>, <code>Point</code>, <code>Hinge</code>, <code>Cone</code>, <code>Slider</code>, <code>Swing Twist</code>, <code>Six DOF</code>, <code>Path</code>, <code>Gear</code>, <code>Rack and Pinion</code>, <code>Pulley</code>, <code>Vehicle</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Hinge</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Anchor<span class="type">VectorTranslation</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">世界空间附着点</span><span class="en">World-space attachment point</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Axis<span class="type">VectorXYZ</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">主轴（铰链 / 滑轨 / 扭转 / 齿轮）</span><span class="en">Primary axis (hinge / slider / twist / gear)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 1.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Axis 2<span class="type">VectorXYZ</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">次轴（铰链法向 / 齿轮 B / 齿条滑轨 / 滑轮 B）</span><span class="en">Secondary axis (hinge normal / gear B / rack slider / pulley B)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[1.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Anchor 2<span class="type">VectorTranslation</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">第二个世界点（滑轮刚体 B / 齿轮 B 铰链）</span><span class="en">Second world point (pulley body B / gear B hinge)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Min Limit<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">铰链/滑轨最小值（弧度或米）。距离最小值。锥约束不用</span><span class="en">Hinge/slider min (rad or m). Distance min. Cone unused</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Max Limit<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">铰链/滑轨最大值。锥半角（弧度）。距离最大值</span><span class="en">Hinge/slider max. Cone half-angle (rad). Distance max</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Ratio<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">齿轮 / 齿条 / 滑轮比</span><span class="en">Gear / rack / pulley ratio</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Frequency<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">距离限位弹簧频率 Hz（0 = 刚性）</span><span class="en">Distance limit spring Hz (0 = hard)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Damping<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">距离限位弹簧阻尼</span><span class="en">Distance limit spring damping</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Motor<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">铰链/滑轨/载具电机：关闭、速度或位置</span><span class="en">Hinge/slider/vehicle motor: off, velocity, or position</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Off</code>, <code>Velocity</code>, <code>Position</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Off</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Motor Target<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">铰链为弧度或弧度/秒。滑轨为米或米/秒。载具油门 [-1, 1]</span><span class="en">Hinge rad or rad/s. Slider m or m/s. Vehicle throttle [-1, 1]</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Motor Force<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最大电机力/力矩。载具：发动机扭矩</span><span class="en">Max motor force/torque. Vehicle: engine torque</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Path<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">路径约束的可选折线 / 网格顶点</span><span class="en">Optional polyline / mesh verts for Path constraint</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Wheel Radius<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">载具车轮半径</span><span class="en">Vehicle wheel radius</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.3</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Wheel Width<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">载具车轮宽度</span><span class="en">Vehicle wheel width</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Suspension Min<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最小悬挂长度</span><span class="en">Minimum suspension length</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.2</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Suspension Max<span class="type">Float</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">最大悬挂长度</span><span class="en">Maximum suspension length</span></div><div class="def">d