<article class="page" id="page-GeometryNodeJoltSolver" data-page="GeometryNodeJoltSolver">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>GeometryNodeJoltSolver</code> · <code>GeometryNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Jolt Solver</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">从输入几何做黑盒 Jolt 步进。写入 velocity、angular_velocity、acceleration、angular_acceleration、mass 和 inertia（I，不是角加速度）</p>
  <p class="en">Black-box Jolt step from input geometry. Writes velocity, angular_velocity, acceleration, angular_acceleration, mass and inertia (I, not angular accel)</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">由 Jolt 设置刚体标记的刚体。静态 = 碰撞体，动态 = 模拟，运动学 = 节点图驱动</span><span class="en">Bodies tagged by Jolt Set Rigid Body. Static = colliders, Dynamic = simulated, Kinematic = graph-driven</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Constraints<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">来自 Jolt 设置约束的点云（可选路径网格）</span><span class="en">Point Cloud from Jolt Set Constraint (optional Path mesh)</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Gravity<span class="type">VectorAcceleration</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">每步施加到动态刚体的世界重力（Blender Z 向上）</span><span class="en">World gravity applied each step to dynamic bodies (Blender Z-up)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, -9.81]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Delta Time<span class="type">FloatTimeAbsolute</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">在模拟区内使用场景时间增量</span><span class="en">Use Scene Time delta inside a Simulation Zone</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>0.0416667</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Substeps<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">本帧的 Jolt 碰撞步数（通常约每 1/60 秒 1 步）</span><span class="en">Jolt collision steps of this frame (1 per ~1/60s is typical)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Velocity Steps<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">约束速度迭代（Jolt 默认 10）</span><span class="en">Constraint velocity iterations (Jolt default 10)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>10</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>Position Steps<span class="type">Int</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">约束位置迭代（Jolt 默认 2）</span><span class="en">Constraint position iterations (Jolt default 2)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>2</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr><th>CCD<span class="type">Boolean</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">动态刚体的 LinearCast 运动质量（更慢，更少穿透）</span><span class="en">LinearCast motion quality on dynamic bodies (slower, fewer tunnels)</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>false</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Geometry<span class="type">Geometry</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">已更新变换以及速度 / 加速度 / 质量 / 惯性的刚体</span><span class="en">Bodies with updated transforms plus velocity / acceleration / mass / inertia</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
