</article>


<article class="page" id="page-ImageNodeCameraView" data-page="ImageNodeCameraView">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>ImageNodeCameraView</code> · <code>ImageNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Camera View</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">Viewport-style preview from a camera (Wireframe/Solid/Material/Rendered). Updates every frame when used; does not re-evaluate unrelated node branches</p>
  <p class="en">Viewport-style preview from a camera (Wireframe/Solid/Material/Rendered). Updates every frame when used; does not re-evaluate unrelated node branches</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Camera<span class="type">Object</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Camera object; empty uses the scene camera</span><span class="en">Camera object; empty uses the scene camera</span></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Shading<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Viewport shading type used for the offscreen render</span><span class="en">Viewport shading type used for the offscreen render</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Wireframe</code>, <code>Solid</code>, <code>Material Preview</code>, <code>Rendered</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>SOLID</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Alpha<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Background alpha for the rendered view</span><span class="en">Background alpha for the rendered view</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Sky</code>, <code>Transparent</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>TRANSPARENT</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Image<span class="type">Color</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Viewport-style preview from the camera (Wireframe/Solid/Material/Rendered modes)</span><span class="en">Viewport-style preview from the camera (Wireframe/Solid/Material/Rendered modes)</span></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  
