<article class="page" id="page-ImageNodeIslandUV" data-page="ImageNodeIslandUV">
  <div class="node-badge"><code>ImageNodeIslandUV</code> · <code>ImageNodeTree</code></div>
  <h1>Island UV</h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">功能</span><span class="en">Function</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">Each same-color connected island gets its own UV from that island's OBB. Origin: OBB center (0 at center) or bottom-left (0 at min). Fit 0-1 normalizes the island; Real Size keeps its size in the texture 0-1 UV</p>
  <p class="en">Each same-color connected island gets its own UV from that island's OBB. Origin: OBB center (0 at center) or bottom-left (0 at min). Fit 0-1 normalizes the island; Real Size keeps its size in the texture 0-1 UV</p>
  <h2>Inputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 菜单 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / menu / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>ID<span class="type">Color</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Color or ID image. Each 4-connected block of the same color is one island. Near-black / ID 0 is background</span><span class="en">Color or ID image. Each 4-connected block of the same color is one island. Near-black / ID 0 is background</span></div><div class="def">default=<code>[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Origin<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Where UV (0,0) sits on this island's OBB</span><span class="en">Where UV (0,0) sits on this island's OBB</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Center</code>, <code>Bottom Left</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Center</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr><tr class="mode-row"><th>Scale<span class="type">Menu</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Fit: normalize this island. Real Size: use texture 0-1 units, no per-island stretch</span><span class="en">Fit: normalize this island. Real Size: use texture 0-1 units, no per-island stretch</span></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">全部模式</strong><strong class="en">All modes</strong>: <code>Fit 0-1</code>, <code>Real Size</code></div><div class="menu-line"><strong class="zh">默认</strong><strong class="en">Default</strong>: <code>Fit 0-1</code></div><div class="when"><span class="zh">显示条件</span><span class="en">Shown when</span>: <code>始终显示 / always</code></div></td></tr>
</tbody></table>
  <h2>Outputs</h2>
  <table class="io-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:32%"><span class="zh">名称</span><span class="en">Name</span></th><th><span class="zh">用途 / 显示条件</span><span class="en">Purpose / visibility</span></th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>UV<span class="type">Vector</span></th><td><div class="desc"><span class="zh">Per-island UV. Each connected same-color blob has its own OBB mapping</span><span class="en">Per-island UV. Each connected same-color blob has its own OBB mapping</span></div></td></tr>
