<article class="page" id="page-ui-v2-g-move" data-page="ui-v2-g-move">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作 · v2</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts · v2</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">按 G 只移动、不插入连线</span><span class="en">G moves nodes without inserting on drop</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">节点编辑器里按 <strong>G</strong> 只平移选中节点，<strong>松开时不插入</strong>经过的连线（不再走 <code>translate_attach</code> 插线）。拖动节点仍可插到连线上。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li><strong>G</strong>：<code>transform.translate</code>，只移动。</li>
<li>鼠标拖节点：仍可 <code>translate_attach</code>（落到 wire 上插入）。</li>
<li>Shift+G 仍是 Select Grouped；Ctrl+G 仍是建组。</li>
</ul>
<p class="en">Press <strong>G</strong> to move selected nodes without inserting into noodles on confirm. Click-drag can still attach/insert on a wire.</p>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「V2 / 杂项」+ 本编译版行为。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List v2 misc + this build. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-ui-v2-rename-highlight" data-page="ui-v2-rename-highlight">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作 · v2</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts · v2</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">改名高亮优化</span><span class="en">Rename highlight polish</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">组接口 / socket 可改名时的悬停高亮更清晰，避免和选中、连线高亮抢视觉。Ctrl+LMB（或双击）点名字仍进入就地改名。</p>
<p class="en">Clearer hover highlight on renamable group sockets, without fighting selection/link highlights.</p>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「V2 / 杂项」+ 本编译版行为。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List v2 misc + this build. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-ui-v2-shift-socket-type" data-page="ui-v2-shift-socket-type">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作 · v2</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts · v2</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">Shift+LMB 改接口数据类型</span><span class="en">Shift+LMB change socket data type</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">v1 用 Ctrl+LMB 改 socket 数据类型；<strong>v2 改为 Shift+LMB</strong> 点 socket 的彩色形状。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li>短按 → 常驻面板点选类型；长按 → 松手菜单。</li>
<li><strong>Alt+LMB</strong> 仍改 Structure / 形状（Auto / Single / Field / Grid / List / Dynamic）。</li>
<li>Ctrl+LMB 点名字仍是改名；Ctrl 拖线仍是 detach。</li>
</ul>
<p class="en">v2 uses <strong>Shift+LMB</strong> on the socket shape to change data type (was Ctrl+LMB in v1). Alt+LMB still changes structure/shape.</p>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「V2 / 杂项」+ 本编译版行为。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List v2 misc + this build. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-ui-v2-group-clipboard" data-page="ui-v2-group-clipboard">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作 · v2</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts · v2</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">不同编辑器之间节点组复制粘贴</span><span class="en">Copy-paste node groups across editors</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">节点组可在不同节点树类型之间复制粘贴（几何 / 着色器 / Image Process / 合成器 / 物体编辑器）。粘贴时会把 Group 节点 retarget 到目标树的 group idname，并尽量转换可映射的内部节点。</p>
<p class="en">Node groups can be copied between editor tree types. Paste retargets the Group node to the destination tree type and converts mappable inner nodes.</p>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「V2 / 杂项」+ 本编译版行为。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List v2 misc + this build. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-ui-v2-dirty-eval" data-page="ui-v2-dirty-eval">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作 · v2</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts · v2</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">Dirty 评估与 Ctrl 点击</span><span class="en">Dirty evaluation and Ctrl-click</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">节点图改为<strong>按脏节点局部评估</strong>，不再每次整树重算。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li>改属性 / 改连线：只煮到依赖这条脏路径的终端（Viewer / Image Output 等）。</li>
<li><strong>Ctrl+点击</strong>（及 Viewer 预览快捷）：只刷新当前预览终端，不重跑无关的 Bake / File Output 分支。</li>
<li>Image Process 尤其明显：独立 Repeat→Image Output 不会因为预览另一个 Viewer 而整图重煮。</li>
</ul>
<p class="en">Graphs recook only dirty demand paths instead of the whole tree. Ctrl-click / Viewer preview isolates the active terminal so unrelated outputs are not recooked.</p>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「V2 / 杂项」+ 本编译版行为。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List v2 misc + this build. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>


<article class="page" id="page-ui-v2-spreadsheet" data-page="ui-v2-spreadsheet">
  <div class="node-badge"><span class="zh">界面 / 快捷操作 · v2</span><span class="en">UI / Shortcuts · v2</span></div>
  <h1><span class="zh">电子表格：Group 与 Attribute Filter</span><span class="en">Spreadsheet: group filter and attribute filter</span></h1>
  <h2><span class="zh">说明</span><span class="en">Overview</span></h2>
  <p class="zh">Spreadsheet 增加两套过滤。</p>
<ul class="zh">
<li><strong>Group Filter</strong>（<code>row_pattern</code>）：空格/逗号分隔。支持索引区间 <code>0-10</code>、<code>30-40:2</code>，布尔组 <code>@select</code>，表达式 <code>@position.y&gt;0</code>。前缀 <code>^</code> / <code>!</code> 表示从该集合排除。空则显示全部行。</li>
<li><strong>Attribute Filter</strong>（<code>attribute_pattern</code>）：按属性名过滤列，支持 <code>*</code> / <code>?</code> 通配。前缀 <code>^</code> / <code>!</code> 隐藏匹配名。空则显示全部列。</li>
</ul>
<p class="en">Group Filter matches rows (index ranges, <code>@attr</code> groups, expressions; <code>^</code>/<code>!</code> exclude). Attribute Filter shows/hides columns by name wildcards.</p>
  <p class="src zh">来自 Achieve List「V2 / 杂项」+ 本编译版行为。非几何节点 IO 页。</p>
  <p class="src en">From Achieve List v2 misc + this build. Not a node IO page.</p>
</article>

<footer class="page-footer"><span class="zh">IO 来自 blender.exe · 类型名已校正</span><span class="en">IO from blender.exe</span> · <a href="index.html">Docs</a></footer>
</div></main></div>

<script>
(function(){
  var KEYS=["bikini-docs-lang","bikini-changelog-lang"];
  var pages=document.querySelectorAll(".page");
  // ONLY sidebar/nav anchors — never .page articles (they also have data-page)
  var links=document.querySelectorAll("a.nav-link[data-page], .sidebar a[data-page]");
  var currentId=null;
  function setLang(l){
    if(l!=="en"&&l!=="zh") l="en";
    document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-lang",l);
    document.documentElement.lang=l==="zh"?"zh-CN":"en";
    document.title=l==="zh"?"BIKINI 用户手册":"BIKINI User Manual";
    try{KEYS.forEach(function(k){localStorage.setItem(k,l);});}catch(e){}
    document.getElementById("lang-zh").setAttribute("aria-pressed",l==="zh"?"true":"false");
    document.getElementById("lang-en").setAttribute("aria-pressed",l==="en"?"true":"false");
  }
  function showPage(id, push, scroll){
    if(!id) id="intro";
    var ok=false;
    pages.forEach(function(p){
      var on=p.getAttribute("data-page")===id;
      p.classList.toggle("is-active", on);
      if(on) ok=true;
    });
    if(!ok){
      id="intro";
      pages.forEach(function(p){ p.classList.toggle("is-active", p.getAttribute("data-page")===id); });
    }
    document.querySelectorAll(".sidebar .nav-link[data-page]").forEach(function(a){
      var on=a.getAttribute("data-page")===id;
      a.classList.toggle("is-active", on);
      if(on){
        var el=a;
        while(el){
          if(el.tagName==="DETAILS") el.open=true;
          el=el.parentElement;
        }
      }
    });
    if(push!==false) history.replaceState(null,"","#"+id);
    // Only scroll to top when actually switching pages (not on content click / same page)
    if(scroll!==false && currentId!==id){
      window.scrollTo(0,0);
    }
    currentId=id;
    document.body.classList.remove("nav-open");
  }
  function hash(){
    var h=(location.hash||"#intro").replace(/^#/,"")||"intro";
    var ids={};
    pages.forEach(function(p){ ids[p.getAttribute("data-page")]=true; });
    return ids[h]?h:"intro";
  }
  links.forEach(function(a){
    a.addEventListener("click", function(e){
      var id=a.getAttribute("data-page");
      if(!id) return;
      e.preventDefault();
      showPage(id, true, true);
    });
  });
  window.addEventListener("hashchange", function(){ showPage(hash(), false, true); });
  document.getElementById("lang-zh").onclick=function(){ setLang("zh"); };
  document.getElementById("lang-en").onclick=function(){ setLang("en"); };
  document.getElementById("nav-toggle").onclick=function(){ document.body.classList.toggle("nav-open"); };
  try{
    var s=localStorage.getItem(KEYS[0])||localStorage.getItem(KEYS[1]);
    if(s==="en"||s==="zh") setLang(s);
    else setLang(/^zh\b/i.test(navigator.language||"")?"zh":"en");
  }catch(e){ setLang("zh"); }
  // Initial load: show page, do not force scroll fight with browser hash restore
  showPage(hash(), false, false);
})();
</script>
</body></html>
